rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "Any change to a land\'s type or splicing of text into a land can affect the types of mana a land can produce."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Any replacement effects are considered by Reflecting Pool when determining the types of mana a land can produce.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "Multiple Reflecting Pools won\'t help each other produce mana. If you control a Reflecting Pool, and all other lands you control either lack mana abilities or are other Reflecting Pools, you may still activate Reflecting Pool\'s ability — it just won\'t produce any mana."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': \'Reflecting Pool checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands you control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag says "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If you control Vivid Crag and Reflecting Pool, you can tap Reflecting Pool for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "Reflecting Pool doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your lands put on the mana they produce, such as Pillar of the Paruns and Hall of the Bandit Lord do. It just cares about types of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': \'The types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'An activated ability has a “Cost: Effect” format. Look for the colon. A triggered ability starts with “when”, “whenever”, or “at”.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It can target delayed triggered abilities. For example, a card that says “Whenever a player cycles a card, you may exile target creature. If you do, return that creature to the battlefield at the beginning of the end step.” triggers when a player cycles a card and creates a delayed trigger that happens at the beginning of the end step. You can choose to target the “at the beginning of the end step” trigger when it is placed on the stack at end of turn.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Turn-based actions and special actions like the normal card draw, combat damage, or turning a face-down creature face up can’t be targeted.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can affect basic or non-basic types, but it must be for a specific type. The chosen type must be an existing land type. See the glossary of the comprehensive rulebook for more details on existing land types.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If there is no other legal target for the spell, this does not change the target.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Once the spell resolves, the new target is considered to be targeted by the deflected spell. This will trigger any effects which trigger on being targeted.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The target of a spell that targets another spell on the stack can be changed to any other spell on the stack, even if the new target will resolve before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This does not check if the current target is legal. It just checks if the spell has a single target.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This only targets the spell being changed, not the original or new target of the spell it is affecting.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can choose to make a spell on the stack target this spell (if such a target choice would be legal had the spell been cast while this spell was on the stack). The new target for the deflected spell is not chosen until this spell resolves. This spell is still on the stack when new targets are selected for the spell.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can’t make a spell which is on the stack target itself.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You choose the spell to target on announcement, but you pick the new target for that spell on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It is only considered “cast from your hand” if you cast it as a spell from your hand. Putting it onto the battlefield from your hand using a spell or ability will cause you to lose the game.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'In a Commander game where this card is your commander, casting it from the Command zone does not count as casting it from your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Players can get fewer than 3 cards if they want.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The “If you do” means “If you search”.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can target an untapped creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'The controller of Vedalken Orrery can cast nonland artifact, creature, enchantment, and sorcery cards any time they could cast an instant. This includes on other players’ turns and during the upkeep step, draw step, combat phase, and end step.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'This applies only to casting spells. It does not, for example, change when you may activate abilities that can only be activated “any time you could cast a sorcery”.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'A permanent’s ability that refers to cards the creature exiled (such as Sisters of Stone Death’s third ability) only affects cards exiled by other abilities intrinsic to that permanent (such as Sisters of Stone Death’s second ability). Suppose that (a) Dimir Doppelganger copies Arc-Slogger, (b) its “deal 2 damage” ability is activated, and then (c) it copies Sisters of Stone Death. Creatures exiled by Arc-Slogger’s ability can’t be returned with Sisters of Stone Death’s ability.'}, {'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'This creature becomes an exact copy of a copied card, except that it also has Dimir Doppelganger’s activated ability. If it becomes a copy of a different creature card, the new copy will overwrite the old copy.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'The target is chosen just after any creatures dealt lethal damage at the same time that the enchanted creature dealt damage have been put into the graveyard. That might include the enchanted creature itself, if it had trample and was blocked, for example.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'You may choose yourself.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "This spell isn\'t Modal. When it resolves, it will destroy the target if it\'s a creature or an enchantment, even if it changed from one to the other between targeting and resolution."}]', "[{'date': '2006-05-01', 'text': 'Wakestone Gargoyle’s ability allows itself to attack.'}, {'date': '2006-05-01', 'text': 'Wakestone Gargoyle’s ability will affect creatures with defender that come under your control after the ability resolves but before you declare attackers (though those creatures still can’t attack unless they have haste).'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'The number of cards the player draws is equal to the number of cards they discarded, not the amount of damage dealt by Barbed Shocker.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'When the life totals are exchanged, each player gains or loses the amount of life necessary to equal the other player’s previous life total. For example, if player A has 5 life and player B has 3 life before the exchange, player A will lose 2 life and player B will gain 2 life. Replacement effects may modify these gains and losses, and triggered abilities may trigger on them.'}, {'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'If an effect says that a player can’t lose life, that player can’t exchange life totals with a player who has a lower life total; in that case, the exchange won’t happen.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': 'Coward is a new creature type.'}, {'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': 'Each of the activated abilities replaces all creature types the affected creature may have had.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Note that the exact wording of this card has changed since it was printed in the _Future Sight_(TM) set, but its functionality is the same.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': 'Wrap in Vigor sets up a separate regeneration shield on each creature you control at the time it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'If the creature you put onto the battlefield can’t be equipped by Deathrender (due to protection from artifacts, for example), the creature enters the battlefield but Deathrender remains unattached.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "Volcanic Fallout can be targeted by spells that try to counter it (such as Countersquall). Those spells will still resolve, but the part of their effect that would counter Volcanic Fallout won\'t do anything. Any other effects those spells have will work as normal."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Mountaincycling is a form of cycling. Any ability that triggers on a card being cycled also triggers on Mountaincycling this card. Any ability that stops a cycling ability from being activated also stops Mountaincycling from being activated.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Mountaincycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with Mountaincycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "Unlike the normal cycling ability, Mountaincycling doesn\'t allow you to draw a card. Instead, it lets you search your library for a Mountain card. After you find a Mountain card in your library, you reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'You can choose to find any card with the Mountain land type, including nonbasic lands. You can also choose not to find a card, even if there is a Mountain card in your library.\'}]', "[{'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'The affected land loses its existing land types and any abilities printed on it. It becomes the chosen basic land type and now has the ability to tap to add one mana of the appropriate color to your mana pool. Grixis Illusionist’s ability doesn’t change the affected land’s name or whether it’s legendary or basic.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'You choose a basic land type as the ability resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'An "attacking creature" is one that has been declared as an attacker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield attacking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game, or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Even though Trumpet Blast affects only attacking creatures, the bonus will remain for the rest of the turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Only creatures that are attacking as Trumpet Blast resolves will receive the bonus. In other words, casting it before you\'ve declared attackers usually won\'t do anything."}]', "[{'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'An ability that turns a land into a creature also sets that creature’s power and toughness. If the land was already a creature, this will overwrite the previous effect that set its power and toughness. Effects that modify its power or toughness, such as the effects of Disfigure or Glorious Anthem, will continue to apply, no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change its power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'An attacking or blocking creature that stops being a creature is removed from combat. This can happen if a Zendikon enchanting an attacking or blocking creature leaves the battlefield, for example. The permanent that was removed from combat neither deals nor is dealt combat damage. Any attacking creature that the land creature was blocking remains blocked, however.'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'If a Zendikon and the land it’s enchanting are destroyed at the same time (due to Akroma’s Vengeance, for example), the Zendikon’s last ability will still trigger.'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'If a Zendikon’s last ability triggers, but the land card it refers to leaves the graveyard before it resolves, it will resolve but do nothing.'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'The enchanted permanent will be both a land and a creature and can be affected by anything that affects either a land or a creature.'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'When a land becomes a creature, that doesn’t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won’t trigger.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'The targeted permanents may be controlled by different players.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If a targeted permanent has indestructible or regenerates, its controller won\'t get an Elephant token for it. Similarly, if the targeted permanent is destroyed but a replacement effect moves it to a different zone instead of its owner\'s graveyard, its controller won\'t get an Elephant token for it."}]', "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the equipped creature doesn’t have defender, the second ability simply doesn’t affect it.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'The second ability doesn’t cause the equipped creature to lose defender. It just lets it attack.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'As Copperhorn Scout’s ability resolves, you’ll untap each other creature you control regardless of whether that creature was attacking.'}, {'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'Untapping an attacking creature doesn’t cause it to stop attacking.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If, during a player’s declare attackers step, a creature is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or hasn’t been under that player’s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn’t have haste), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having a creature attack, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The creature’s controller still decides which player or planeswalker the creature attacks.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Only creatures your opponents control when Turn the Tide resolves are affected. Creatures that enter the battlefield later in the turn are not.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "A creature controlled by an opponent that deals combat damage to another opponent will cause Edric\'s ability to trigger. The creature\'s controller chooses whether to draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'When a creature you control deals combat damage to one of your opponents, you may draw a card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-01-19\', \'text\': \'Edric, Spymaster of Trest is banned as a commander in Duel Commander format, but it may be part of your deck.\'}]', "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Pride Guardian gains the ability to block additional creatures and does so, you’ll still gain only 3 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If, during a player’s declare attackers step, a creature is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or hasn’t been under that player’s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn’t have haste), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having a creature attack, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Players may still activate abilities during combat.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'While Basandra, Battle Seraph is on the battlefield, players can’t cast any spells during the combat phase, including permanent spells with flash.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The damage dealt by Hydra Omnivore as a result of its triggered ability is not combat damage (and doesn’t cause the ability to trigger again).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'You choose the target as part of casting the spell. You choose what color the target gains protection from when the spell resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'If Unhallowed Pact is enchanting a token creature, that creature can’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'The card will return to the battlefield under your control only if it’s still in the graveyard when Unhallowed Pact’s ability resolves. If it’s not (perhaps because an ability like undying has already returned it to the battlefield), nothing happens.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Null Profusion (an enchantment that says your maximum hand size is two) onto the battlefield and then put Minamo Scrollkeeper onto the battlefield, your maximum hand size will be three. However, if those permanents entered the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be two.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you cannot sacrifice additional creatures.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "Effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell will be copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy. For example, if a player exiles three cards from their graveyard to cast Skeletal Scrying, and you copy it, the copy will also cause you to draw three cards and lose 3 life (but you won\'t exile any cards from your graveyard)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'If the spell being copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Skeletal Scrying has), the copy will have the same value of X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'If the spell being copied is modal (that is, it says "Choose one —" or the like), the copy will have the same mode. You can\\\'t choose a different one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the spell it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'When the ability resolves, it creates a copy of the spell. You control the copy. That copy is created on the stack, so it\\\'s not "cast." Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\\\'t trigger. The copy will resolve like a normal spell, after players get a chance to cast spells and activate abilities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "You must turn Double Stroke face up before you cast the spell with the chosen name to have Double Stroke\'s second ability trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "A conspiracy doesn\'t count as a card in your deck for purposes of meeting minimum deck size requirements. (In most drafts, the minimum deck size is 40 cards.)"}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "A conspiracy with hidden agenda that has a triggered ability must be face up before that ability\'s trigger condition is met in order for it to trigger. Turning it face up afterward won\'t have any effect."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "A conspiracy\'s static and triggered abilities function as long as that conspiracy is face-up in the command zone."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "As a special action, you may turn a face-down conspiracy face up. You may do so any time you have priority. This action doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to. Once face up, the named card is revealed and the conspiracy\'s abilities will affect the game."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'At the end of the game, you must reveal any face-down conspiracies you own in the command zone to all players.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "At the end of the game, you must reveal any face-down conspiracies you own in the command zone to all players. Notably, you can\'t bluff conspiracies with hidden agenda by putting other cards into the command zone face down as the game starts."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Conspiracies are colorless, have no mana cost, and can\'t be cast as spells."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Conspiracies are never put into your deck. Instead, you put any number of conspiracies from your card pool into the command zone as the game begins. These conspiracies are face up unless they have hidden agenda, in which case they begin the game face down.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Conspiracies aren\'t legal for any sanctioned Constructed format, but may be included in other Limited formats, such as Cube Draft."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'If you play multiple games after the draft, you can name a different card in each new game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "There are several ways to secretly name a card, including writing the name on a piece of paper that\'s kept with the face-down conspiracy. If you have multiple face-down conspiracies, you may name a different card for each one. It\'s important that each named card is clearly associated with only one of the conspiracies."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You can look at any player\'s face-up conspiracies at any time. You\'ll also know how many face-down conspiracies a player has in the command zone, although you won\'t know what they are."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to play with any conspiracy you draft. However, you have only one opportunity to put conspiracies into the command zone, as the game begins. You can\'t put conspiracies into the command zone after this point."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You must name a Magic card. Notably, you can\'t name a token."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'You name the card as the game begins, as you put the conspiracy into the command zone, not as you turn the face-down conspiracy face up.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "If Realm Seekers enters the battlefield directly from a player\'s hand without being cast, it counts itself when determining the value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'The value of X is determined as Realm Seekers enters the battlefield. Players can cast spells and activate abilities while Realm Seekers is on the stack to remove cards from their hands if they wish, and this will result in fewer counters being placed on Realm Seekers as it enters the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "If you have Power Play but aren\'t the starting player (because another player also had Power Play), your place in the turn order is unaffected. If you\'re sitting to the right of the starting player, you\'re going last. Not all power plays bear fruit."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "A conspiracy doesn\'t count as a card in your deck for purposes of meeting minimum deck size requirements. (In most drafts, the minimum deck size is 40 cards.)"}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "A conspiracy\'s static and triggered abilities function as long as that conspiracy is face-up in the command zone."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Conspiracies are colorless, have no mana cost, and can\'t be cast as spells."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Conspiracies are never put into your deck. Instead, you put any number of conspiracies from your card pool into the command zone as the game begins. These conspiracies are face up unless they have hidden agenda, in which case they begin the game face down.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Conspiracies aren\'t legal for any sanctioned Constructed format, but may be included in other Limited formats, such as Cube Draft."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You can look at any player\'s face-up conspiracies at any time. You\'ll also know how many face-down conspiracies a player has in the command zone, although you won\'t know what they are."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to play with any conspiracy you draft. However, you have only one opportunity to put conspiracies into the command zone, as the game begins. You can\'t put conspiracies into the command zone after this point."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "If, through a combination of Backup Plan and/or other conspiracies, you have fewer cards in your deck than you must draw as the game begins, you\'ll lose the game when state-based actions are checked during the upkeep of the first turn."}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "The effect of Backup Plan is cumulative. If you have two in your command zone to start the game, you\'ll draw three hands of seven cards and shuffle all but one of them into your library."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "A conspiracy doesn\'t count as a card in your deck for purposes of meeting minimum deck size requirements. (In most drafts, the minimum deck size is 40 cards.)"}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "A conspiracy\'s static and triggered abilities function as long as that conspiracy is face-up in the command zone."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Conspiracies are colorless, have no mana cost, and can\'t be cast as spells."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Conspiracies are never put into your deck. Instead, you put any number of conspiracies from your card pool into the command zone as the game begins. These conspiracies are face up unless they have hidden agenda, in which case they begin the game face down.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Conspiracies aren\'t legal for any sanctioned Constructed format, but may be included in other Limited formats, such as Cube Draft."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You can look at any player\'s face-up conspiracies at any time. You\'ll also know how many face-down conspiracies a player has in the command zone, although you won\'t know what they are."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to play with any conspiracy you draft. However, you have only one opportunity to put conspiracies into the command zone, as the game begins. You can\'t put conspiracies into the command zone after this point."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined as the ability resolves. If, at that time, you control no artifacts, you won\'t look at any cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "Your card pool includes every card you drafted or received after the draft because of Deal Broker. It doesn\'t include any cards removed from the draft with Cogwork Grinder."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "A conspiracy doesn\'t count as a card in your deck for purposes of meeting minimum deck size requirements. (In most drafts, the minimum deck size is 40 cards.)"}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "A conspiracy\'s static and triggered abilities function as long as that conspiracy is face-up in the command zone."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Conspiracies are colorless, have no mana cost, and can\'t be cast as spells."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Conspiracies are never put into your deck. Instead, you put any number of conspiracies from your card pool into the command zone as the game begins. These conspiracies are face up unless they have hidden agenda, in which case they begin the game face down.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Conspiracies aren\'t legal for any sanctioned Constructed format, but may be included in other Limited formats, such as Cube Draft."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You can look at any player\'s face-up conspiracies at any time. You\'ll also know how many face-down conspiracies a player has in the command zone, although you won\'t know what they are."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to play with any conspiracy you draft. However, you have only one opportunity to put conspiracies into the command zone, as the game begins. You can\'t put conspiracies into the command zone after this point."}]', "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'A card that is removed from the draft isn’t in any player’s card pool. That card can’t be played in any games associated with that draft.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If a Cogwork Grinder owned by another player enters the battlefield under your control, the number of counters it enters with will be based on the number of cards you’ve removed from the draft with Cogwork Grinders, not the number its owner removed. Unless you also drafted Cogwork Grinder, this will be 0.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If you draft multiple Cogwork Grinders, the value for X will be the same for each of them. It doesn’t matter that some of the removed cards may have been removed before you drafted the second Cogwork Grinder, for example.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'No other player may look at the cards you remove from the draft (unless Cogwork Spy allows a player to).'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'You can’t remove cards from the draft that you’ve already drafted. Only cards drafted after you draft Cogwork Grinder may be removed this way.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'You still draft the card that you remove. This may matter if an ability refers to “the next card you draft” or similar. If that card instructs you to draft it face up, do so, then turn it face down as you remove it. If that card instructs you to reveal it as you draft it and then perform additional actions, perform those actions before turning the card face down and removing it from the draft.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Adding a booster pack to a draft may cause some players to have more cards in their card pools than others. This is normal.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If you use Agent of Acquisitions to draft a booster pack containing Lore Seeker, and you wish to add a booster pack to the draft, first draft each remaining card from the Lore Seeker booster pack. Then open the new booster pack. You may look at the cards in that pack, but you can’t draft any cards from it. You’ll pass the new booster pack as normal. That was very generous of you.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The booster pack can be from any Magic: The Gathering set, but you must provide it. Consult your co-conspirators for guidance.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'To add a booster pack to the draft, first pass the booster pack that contained Lore Seeker to the next player. Then open the new booster pack, draft a card, and pass the new booster pack in the same direction. Then you’ll receive the booster pack you would’ve received had you not added a booster pack, and the draft round will continue. The added booster pack will last a few picks longer than the rest of the booster packs opened that draft round.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Dack’s Duplicate enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen creature will also work.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Dack’s Duplicate copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing more (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below), except it will have haste and dethrone. It doesn’t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Dethrone doesn’t trigger if the creature attacks a planeswalker, even if its controller has the most life.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Haste and dethrone are part of the copiable values of Dack’s Duplicate. If another creature enters the battlefield as or becomes a copy of Dack’s Duplicate, it will copy whatever Dack’s Duplicate is copying and have haste and dethrone.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If Dack’s Duplicate somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, Dack’s Duplicate can’t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that’s already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is a token, Dack’s Duplicate copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put the token onto the battlefield. Dack’s Duplicate is not a token, even when copying one.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is copying something else (for example, if the chosen creature is another Dack’s Duplicate), then Dack’s Duplicate enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen creature is copying. It will have haste and dethrone.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost (such as Grenzo, Dungeon Warden), X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, dethrone will trigger if the creature attacks either player on the team with the most life or tied for the most life.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Once dethrone triggers, it doesn’t matter what happens to the players’ life totals before the ability resolves. You’ll put a +1/+1 counter on the creature even if the defending player doesn’t have the most life as the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The +1/+1 counter is put on the creature before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The ability of Dack’s Duplicate doesn’t target the creature.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'You can choose to not copy anything. In that case, Dack’s Duplicate enters the battlefield as a 0/0 Shapeshifter creature, and will probably die almost immediately, when state-based actions are next performed.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Because the votes are cast in turn order, each player will know the votes of players who voted beforehand.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell will be copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy. For example, if a player exiles three cards from their graveyard to cast Skeletal Scrying, and you copy it, the copy will also cause you to draw three cards and lose 3 life (but you won’t exile any cards from your graveyard).'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If duplication gets more votes, Split Decision creates a copy of the spell. You control the copy. That copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger. The copy will resolve like a normal spell, after players get a chance to cast spells and activate abilities.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If the spell being copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Skeletal Scrying has), the copy will have the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If the spell being copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. You can’t choose a different one.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'No player votes until the spell or ability resolves. Any responses to that spell or ability must be made without knowing the outcome of the vote.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Players can’t do anything after they finishing voting but before the spell or ability that included the vote finishes resolving.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The phrase “the vote is tied” refers only to when there is more than one choice that received the most votes. For example, if a 5-player vote from among three different choices ends 3 votes to 1 vote to 1 vote, the vote isn’t tied.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'You must vote for one of the available options. You can’t abstain.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Because the votes are cast in turn order, each player will know the votes of players who voted beforehand.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If Council Guardian is not on the battlefield when its ability resolves, the vote will still take place; it simply won’t have any effect. However, cards that care about voting (for example, Grudge Keeper) will still see the vote.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'No player votes until the spell or ability resolves. Any responses to that spell or ability must be made without knowing the outcome of the vote.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Players can’t do anything after they finishing voting but before the spell or ability that included the vote finishes resolving.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The phrase “the vote is tied” refers only to when there is more than one choice that received the most votes. For example, if a 5-player vote from among three different choices ends 3 votes to 1 vote to 1 vote, the vote isn’t tied.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The vote happens as the ability resolves. Until this happens, Council Guardian doesn’t have protection from any color. Spells and abilities may target Council Guardian as normal in response to its enters-the-battlefield ability, but not in response to the vote. Once players have started voting, it’s too late to respond.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'You must vote for one of the available options. You can’t abstain.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'Because the votes are cast in turn order, each player will know the votes of players who voted beforehand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'If Custodi Squire is not on the battlefield when its ability resolves, the vote will still take place and the card(s) that had the most votes will still be returned to your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'No player votes until the spell or ability resolves. Any responses to that spell or ability must be made without knowing the outcome of the vote.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "Players can\'t do anything after they finishing voting but before the spell or ability that included the vote finishes resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "The phrase “the vote is tied” refers only to when there is more than one choice that received the most votes. For example, if a 5-player vote from among three different choices ends 3 votes to 1 vote to 1 vote, the vote isn\'t tied."}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "You must vote for one of the available options. You can\'t abstain."}, {\'date\': \'2017-06-13\', \'text\': "If a choice has no votes, it can\'t have the most votes. If all choices have zero votes, the voting ability has no effect."}]', "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Because the votes are cast in turn order, each player will know the votes of players who voted beforehand.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If death gets more votes, each opponent chooses and sacrifices a creature they control. None of these creatures are targeted. An opponent could sacrifice a creature with protection from black, for example.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'No player votes until the spell or ability resolves. Any responses to that spell or ability must be made without knowing the outcome of the vote.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Players can’t do anything after they finishing voting but before the spell or ability that included the vote finishes resolving.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The phrase “the vote is tied” refers only to when there is more than one choice that received the most votes. For example, if a 5-player vote from among three different choices ends 3 votes to 1 vote to 1 vote, the vote isn’t tied.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'You must vote for one of the available options. You can’t abstain.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'Because the votes are cast in turn order, each player will know the votes of players who voted beforehand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'No player votes until the spell or ability resolves. Any responses to that spell or ability must be made without knowing the outcome of the vote.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "Players can\'t do anything after they finish voting but before the spell or ability that included the vote finishes resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'The phrase "the vote is tied" refers only to when there is more than one choice that received the most votes. For example, if a 5-player vote from among three different choices ends 3 votes to 1 vote to 1 vote, the vote isn\\\'t tied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "You must vote for one of the available options. You can\'t abstain."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'Because the votes are cast in turn order, each player will know the votes of players who voted beforehand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'No player votes until the spell or ability resolves. Any responses to that spell or ability must be made without knowing the outcome of the vote.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "Players can\'t do anything after they finishing voting but before the spell or ability that included the vote finishes resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'The phrase "the vote is tied" refers only to when there is more than one choice that received the most votes. For example, if a 5-player vote from among three different choices ends 3 votes to 1 vote to 1 vote, the vote isn\\\'t tied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "You must vote for one of the available options. You can\'t abstain."}]', "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Because the votes are cast in turn order, each player will know the votes of players who voted beforehand.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'No player votes until the spell or ability resolves. Any responses to that spell or ability must be made without knowing the outcome of the vote.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Players can’t do anything after they finishing voting but before the spell or ability that included the vote finishes resolving.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The effect will be the same for all your opponents, no matter how they voted.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The phrase “the vote is tied” refers only to when there is more than one choice that received the most votes. For example, if a 5-player vote from among three different choices ends 3 votes to 1 vote to 1 vote, the vote isn’t tied.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'You must vote for one of the available options. You can’t abstain.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Because the votes are cast in turn order, each player will know the votes of players who voted beforehand.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'No player votes until the spell or ability resolves. Any responses to that spell or ability must be made without knowing the outcome of the vote.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Players can’t do anything after they finishing voting but before the spell or ability that included the vote finishes resolving.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The phrase “the vote is tied” refers only to when there is more than one choice that received the most votes. For example, if a 5-player vote from among three different choices ends 3 votes to 1 vote to 1 vote, the vote isn’t tied.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'You must vote for one of the available options. You can’t abstain.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Cogwork Librarian essentially lets you draft two cards from a booster pack in exchange for putting Cogwork Librarian back into that booster pack.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The two cards you draft are drafted one at a time, in case one of the cards cares about when it was drafted or what the next card you draft is.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'You may use the ability of more than one Cogwork Librarian while drafting from one booster pack. For example you can draft three cards from one booster pack and put two Cogwork Librarians into that booster pack.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Copies of the affected land won’t be 4/4 red Elemental creatures. For example, if the target land is a basic Mountain, a copy of that creature would just be a basic Mountain.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Effects that modify power and/or toughness without setting them to a specific value (like the one created by Giant Growth), power and toughness changes from counters, and effects that switch a creature’s power and toughness will continue to apply. This may happen if the land was already a creature when the ability resolved.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If the target land hasn’t been under its controller’s control continuously since the beginning of their most recent turn, that land won’t be able to attack and its {T} abilities can’t be activated. In most cases, that means it will no longer be able to be tapped for mana that turn.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Ignition Team’s ability doesn’t affect the land’s name or any other types, subtypes, or supertypes (such as basic or legendary) the land may have. The land will also keep any abilities it had.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'This doesn’t count as a creature entering the battlefield. The land was already on the battlefield; it only changed types.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Dethrone doesn’t trigger if the creature attacks a planeswalker, even if its controller has the most life.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If Marchesa has a +1/+1 counter on it when it dies, it will return to the battlefield under your control because of its own ability.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If a creature has multiple instances of dethrone, each triggers separately.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If the creature card leaves the graveyard before the delayed triggered ability resolves, that card won’t return to the battlefield, even if it’s back in the graveyard when the delayed triggered ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, dethrone will trigger if the creature attacks either player on the team with the most life or tied for the most life.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Once dethrone triggers, it doesn’t matter what happens to the players’ life totals before the ability resolves. You’ll put a +1/+1 counter on the creature even if the defending player doesn’t have the most life as the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The +1/+1 counter is put on the creature before blockers are declared.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Dethrone doesn’t trigger if the creature attacks a planeswalker, even if its controller has the most life.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, dethrone will trigger if the creature attacks either player on the team with the most life or tied for the most life.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Once dethrone triggers, it doesn’t matter what happens to the players’ life totals before the ability resolves. You’ll put a +1/+1 counter on the creature even if the defending player doesn’t have the most life as the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The +1/+1 counter is put on the creature before blockers are declared.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'Except in some very rare cases, the card each player draws will be the card revealed from the top of their library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "If you activate Selvala\'s ability while casting a spell, and you discover you can\'t produce enough mana to pay that spell\'s costs, the spell is reversed. The spell returns to whatever zone you were casting it from. You may reverse other mana abilities you activated while casting the spell, but Selvala\'s ability can\'t be reversed. Whatever mana that ability produced will be in your mana pool and each player will have drawn a card."}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "Selvala\'s parley ability is a mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Except in some very rare cases, the card each player draws will be the card revealed from the top of their library.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If Selvala’s Enforcer leaves the battlefield before its ability resolves, the top card of each library will still be revealed and drawn, although no +1/+1 counters will be placed.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Except in some very rare cases, the card each player draws will be the card revealed from the top of their library.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'For example, if you draft Lurking Automaton as the third card in a draft round and then another one as the sixth card in a draft round, each Lurking Automaton that enters the battlefield under your control does so with six +1/+1 counters on it.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If a Lurking Automaton owned by another player enters the battlefield under your control, the number of counters it enters with will be based on the highest number you noted as you drafted a card named Lurking Automaton, not as its owner did. Unless you also drafted Lurking Automaton, this will be considered 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Grudge Keeper’s ability considers only the vote that caused it to trigger, not any previous votes, even if they were caused by the same permanent.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If one of your opponents has additional votes because of Brago’s Representative, and that player votes for more than one choice you didn’t vote for, that player will lose only 2 life.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If you have additional votes because of Brago’s Representative, and you vote for more than one choice, an opponent will lose 2 life only if they voted for none of those choices.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The spell or ability that caused you to vote will finish resolving before Grudge Keeper’s ability is put on the stack. The ability will be put on the stack even if the results of the vote cause Grudge Keeper to leave the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If Aether Searcher is the last card you draft in any draft round other than the last one, you’ll reveal the first card you draft in the following draft round and note its name.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If Aether Searcher is the last card you draft, there won’t be a noted name. You can still search your hand and/or library when it enters the battlefield, but you won’t cast any card this way unless you also drafted an Aether Searcher and noted a card then.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If Aether Searcher leaves the battlefield before its ability resolves, you’ll still be able to search for the named card and cast it.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If an Aether Searcher owned by another player enters the battlefield under your control, you can search for a card you’ve named while drafting a card named Aether Searcher, not a card named by its owner. Unless you also drafted a card named Aether Searcher, you won’t cast a card.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as its value.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If the card you draft after Aether Searcher is a land card, you won’t be able to play that land using Aether Searcher’s ability.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t pay alternative costs such as overload costs. You can pay additional costs such as kicker costs. If the card has mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'When casting a card this way, ignore timing restrictions based on the card’s type. Other timing restrictions, such as “Cast [this spell] only during combat,” must be followed.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'You cast the card before shuffling your library (if it was searched). In some very rare cases, you may need to take actions involving your library while casting the card. For example, if it has an additional cost and you activate Deranged Assistant’s ability (“{T}, Put the top card of your library into your graveyard: Add {C}.”) to pay for it, you must maintain the order of your library while you search it.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If Drakestown Forgotten enters the battlefield from a graveyard, it counts itself when determining the value of X.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If a permanent has more than one of the listed types, it can be chosen for any of them. For example, if the player to your left controls an artifact creature, you could choose it as the creature, the artifact, or both.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'None of the chosen permanents are targeted. A player can choose a creature with protection from red, for example.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The choices are made in turn order starting with you. However, all chosen permanents are destroyed simultaneously.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The player on your right can choose the Ogre that Grenzo’s Rebuttal creates.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If a player exchanges a card that has multiple pieces of information noted for it, all of the information is shared during the exchange. For example, if you receive a Cogwork Tracker from a player who drafted multiple Cogwork Trackers, your Cogwork Trackers may attack any player noted by either you or the other player for Cogwork Tracker. The other player will not remove a noted player from their remaining Cogwork Tracker.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If either card involved in the exchange has any information noted for it, that information stays with the exchanged card, not the player who initially drafted it. Any abilities that refer to actions taken as you drafted the card (or similar) now refer to the card’s new owner, even though that player wasn’t the person who actually drafted the card.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If more than one player drafts a Deal Broker, players who wish to use the second ability to exchange cards do so in a random order.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If you accept a player’s offer, the card you revealed becomes part of that player’s card pool and the other offered card becomes part of your card pool.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If your draft is breaking up into multiple games, the exchange happens before it’s known who will be playing in each game.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The cards exchanged this way aren’t drafted. They can’t be removed from the draft by Cogwork Grinder, for example.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'When you use Deal Broker’s second ability, after you reveal your card, each other player chooses up to one card from their card pool, then all those chosen cards are revealed simultaneously.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'You may reveal Deal Broker itself for its second ability. If you do, and you accept another player’s offer, that player won’t be able to use the second ability to offer another exchange.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If multiple players have drafted a card named Canal Dredger, each player chooses which of those players to pass the last card to.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If you draft a card named Canal Dredger, you pass the last card from each booster pack to yourself. In other words, when you are passed two cards, you draft both of them.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'You draft all cards passed to you this way one at a time. If you also drafted a Cogwork Grinder, you may remove any of those cards from the draft.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If the last ability doesn’t apply, you choose which player or planeswalker Cogwork Tracker attacks.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If the noted player isn’t in the game, Cogwork Tracker’s last ability won’t do anything, although it must still attack each turn if able. This is also true if there is no noted player because Cogwork Tracker was the first card drafted from a booster pack.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If there are multiple noted players, perhaps because the players on both your left and right passed a Cogwork Tracker to you, you choose which of those players each Cogwork Tracker attacks. If you control more than one, they can each attack a different noted player.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If your draft is breaking up into multiple games, you and the noted player(s) aren’t required to be in the same game.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If, during your declare attackers step, Cogwork Tracker is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or hasn’t been under your control continuously since the turn began (and doesn’t have haste), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having a creature attack, you’re not forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'If there are additional costs to cast the spell, such as kicker costs, apply those increases before applying cost reductions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'The second ability can reduce alternative costs such as overload costs.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "The second ability can\'t reduce the colored mana requirement of a spell."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "A conspiracy doesn\'t count as a card in your deck for purposes of meeting minimum deck size requirements. (In most drafts, the minimum deck size is 40 cards.)"}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "A conspiracy with hidden agenda that has a triggered ability must be face up before that ability\'s trigger condition is met in order for it to trigger. Turning it face up afterward won\'t have any effect."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "A conspiracy\'s static and triggered abilities function as long as that conspiracy is face-up in the command zone."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "As a special action, you may turn a face-down conspiracy face up. You may do so any time you have priority. This action doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to. Once face up, the named card is revealed and the conspiracy\'s abilities will affect the game."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'At the end of the game, you must reveal any face-down conspiracies you own in the command zone to all players.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "At the end of the game, you must reveal any face-down conspiracies you own in the command zone to all players. Notably, you can\'t bluff conspiracies with hidden agenda by putting other cards into the command zone face down as the game starts."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Conspiracies are colorless, have no mana cost, and can\'t be cast as spells."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Conspiracies are never put into your deck. Instead, you put any number of conspiracies from your card pool into the command zone as the game begins. These conspiracies are face up unless they have hidden agenda, in which case they begin the game face down.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Conspiracies aren\'t legal for any sanctioned Constructed format, but may be included in other Limited formats, such as Cube Draft."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'If you play multiple games after the draft, you can name a different card in each new game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "There are several ways to secretly name a card, including writing the name on a piece of paper that\'s kept with the face-down conspiracy. If you have multiple face-down conspiracies, you may name a different card for each one. It\'s important that each named card is clearly associated with only one of the conspiracies."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You can look at any player\'s face-up conspiracies at any time. You\'ll also know how many face-down conspiracies a player has in the command zone, although you won\'t know what they are."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to play with any conspiracy you draft. However, you have only one opportunity to put conspiracies into the command zone, as the game begins. You can\'t put conspiracies into the command zone after this point."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You must name a Magic card. Notably, you can\'t name a token."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'You name the card as the game begins, as you put the conspiracy into the command zone, not as you turn the face-down conspiracy face up.\'}]', "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If you are the next person to draft from the booster pack (perhaps because of Cogwork Librarian), the first ability doesn’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'You may look at the card even if it’s removed from the draft face down by Cogwork Grinder.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If you control Paliano, the High City but you didn’t draft a card named Paliano, the High City, its second ability won’t add mana to your mana pool. Notably, Paliano won’t produce colorless mana.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The three chosen colors must be different.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If you look at a booster pack not being drafted during the current draft round, open that booster pack, look at the cards, and return them in a face-down pile.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If you look at a booster pack that is being drafted during the current draft round, you may do so after a player has drafted a card from that booster pack and before the next player has been passed the cards. As a courtesy, you may inform the player currently looking at the booster pack that you’ll be looking at it next, before it’s passed to the next player.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'If you use Whispergear Sneak during the first draft round to look at an unopened booster pack, the owner of that booster pack doesn’t have to “open” that booster pack for the next draft round, although they may do so.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'In Limited formats (including Conspiracy Draft), the minimum deck size is generally 40 cards. With Advantageous Proclamation, your Conspiracy Draft deck must contain at least 35 cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'The effect of Advantageous Proclamation is cumulative. If you have two in your command zone to start the game, your minimum deck size is reduced by ten, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "A conspiracy doesn\'t count as a card in your deck for purposes of meeting minimum deck size requirements. (In most drafts, the minimum deck size is 40 cards.)"}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "A conspiracy\'s static and triggered abilities function as long as that conspiracy is face-up in the command zone."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Conspiracies are colorless, have no mana cost, and can\'t be cast as spells."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Conspiracies are never put into your deck. Instead, you put any number of conspiracies from your card pool into the command zone as the game begins. These conspiracies are face up unless they have hidden agenda, in which case they begin the game face down.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Conspiracies aren\'t legal for any sanctioned Constructed format, but may be included in other Limited formats, such as Cube Draft."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You can look at any player\'s face-up conspiracies at any time. You\'ll also know how many face-down conspiracies a player has in the command zone, although you won\'t know what they are."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to play with any conspiracy you draft. However, you have only one opportunity to put conspiracies into the command zone, as the game begins. You can\'t put conspiracies into the command zone after this point."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'In a Two-Headed Giant game, dethrone will trigger if the creature attacks either player on the team with the most life or tied for the most life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': "Once dethrone triggers, it doesn\'t matter what happens to the players\' life totals before the ability resolves. You\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on the creature even if the defending player doesn\'t have the most life as the ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'Scourge of the Throne\\\'s ability has an intervening "if" clause. It must be attacking the player with the most life or tied with the most life both when it\\\'s declared as an attacker and as it starts to resolve for it to have any effect. If, at either time, the player isn\\\'t the one with the most life or tied for the most life, the ability will have no effect. Notably, this is different than how dethrone works. (Dethrone checks only once to see if the ability triggers.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-05-29\', \'text\': \'The +1/+1 counter is put on the creature before blockers are declared.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Dethrone doesn\'t trigger if the creature attacks a planeswalker, even if its controller has the most life. The same is true if the creature attacks a battle, even if its protector has the most life."}]', "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The ability is cumulative. For example, if you control two Brago’s Representatives, you’ll vote three times per vote.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The ability only affects spells and abilities that use the word “vote.” Other cards that involve choices, such as Archangel of Strife, are unaffected.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'You make all your votes at the same time. Players who vote after you will know all of your votes when making their own.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'The second ability of Agent of Acquisitions works only if you’re drafting a card. For example, if you’ve already used one Agent of Acquisitions in a draft round, you can’t use a second Agent of Acquisitions later in that same draft round.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'You choose the order the cards in that booster pack are drafted. In many cases this won’t matter, but it could be relevant if one of the cards cares about when it was drafted or what the next card you draft is.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'Use the powers of the creatures as they last existed on the battlefield to determine the value of X, even if they were negative. For example, if the sacrificed creatures were 3/3, 5/5, 0/4, and -2/2, the Demon will be 6/6.'}, {'date': '2014-05-29', 'text': 'You choose which creature you are sacrificing first, then each other player in turn order does the same. The creatures are all sacrificed simultaneously.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "Extract from Darkness doesn\'t target a creature card. You choose which card you\'re putting onto the battlefield as it resolves. You can choose any creature card in a graveyard at that time, including one just put into a graveyard by Extract from Darkness. If there are no creature cards in graveyards at that time, Extract from Darkness simply finishes resolving."}]', "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If Elephant Guide enchants an opponent’s creature, you get the Elephant when that creature dies.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If Glimmerpoint Stag somehow enters the battlefield during a turn’s end step, the exiled card won’t be returned to the battlefield until the beginning of the following turn’s end step.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it ceases to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If the exiled card is an Aura, that card’s owner chooses what it will enchant as it comes back onto the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn’t target anything (so it could be attached to a permanent with shroud, for example), but the Aura’s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can’t legally be attached to anything, it remains exiled.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'The exiled card will return to the battlefield at the beginning of the next end step even if Glimmerpoint Stag is no longer on the battlefield at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If another creature with flying is dealt lethal damage at the same time as Soulcatcher, they’ll be destroyed at the same time. Soulcatcher’s ability won’t save it.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If you gain control of a permanent another player owns, and that player leaves the game, the permanent will also leave the game.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If you gain control of a permanent, and you leave the game, the control-changing effect will end. Unless there’s another control-changing effect affecting that permanent, it will return to its owner’s control.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'The ability of Dack’s emblem will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'The effect of Dack’s second ability and the effect of the emblem’s ability last indefinitely. You won’t lose control of the permanents if Dack leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'The targeted player draws two cards and discards two cards all while Dack’s first ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'Swampcycling is a form of cycling. Any ability that triggers on a card being cycled also triggers on Swampcycling this card. Any ability that stops a cycling ability from being activated also stops Swampcycling from being activated.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'Swampcycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with Swampcycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "Unlike the normal cycling ability, Swampcycling doesn\'t allow you to draw a card. Instead, it lets you search your library for a Swamp card. After you find a Swamp card in your library, you reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library."}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'You can choose to find any card with the Swamp land type, including nonbasic lands. You can also choose not to find a card, even if there is a Swamp card in your library.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "A conspiracy doesn\'t count as a card in your deck for purposes of meeting minimum deck size requirements. (In most drafts, the minimum deck size is 40 cards.)"}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "A conspiracy with hidden agenda that has a triggered ability must be face up before that ability\'s trigger condition is met in order for it to trigger. Turning it face up afterward won\'t have any effect."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "A conspiracy\'s static and triggered abilities function as long as that conspiracy is face-up in the command zone."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "As a special action, you may turn a face-down conspiracy face up. You may do so any time you have priority. This action doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to. Once face up, the named card is revealed and the conspiracy\'s abilities will affect the game."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'At the end of the game, you must reveal any face-down conspiracies you own in the command zone to all players.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "At the end of the game, you must reveal any face-down conspiracies you own in the command zone to all players. Notably, you can\'t bluff conspiracies with hidden agenda by putting other cards into the command zone face down as the game starts."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Conspiracies are colorless, have no mana cost, and can\'t be cast as spells."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Conspiracies are never put into your deck. Instead, you put any number of conspiracies from your card pool into the command zone as the game begins. These conspiracies are face up unless they have hidden agenda, in which case they begin the game face down.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Conspiracies aren\'t legal for any sanctioned Constructed format, but may be included in other Limited formats, such as Cube Draft."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'If you play multiple games after the draft, you can name a different card in each new game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "There are several ways to secretly name a card, including writing the name on a piece of paper that\'s kept with the face-down conspiracy. If you have multiple face-down conspiracies, you may name a different card for each one. It\'s important that each named card is clearly associated with only one of the conspiracies."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You can look at any player\'s face-up conspiracies at any time. You\'ll also know how many face-down conspiracies a player has in the command zone, although you won\'t know what they are."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to play with any conspiracy you draft. However, you have only one opportunity to put conspiracies into the command zone, as the game begins. You can\'t put conspiracies into the command zone after this point."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You must name a Magic card. Notably, you can\'t name a token."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'You name the card as the game begins, as you put the conspiracy into the command zone, not as you turn the face-down conspiracy face up.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "A conspiracy doesn\'t count as a card in your deck for purposes of meeting minimum deck size requirements. (In most drafts, the minimum deck size is 40 cards.)"}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "A conspiracy\'s static and triggered abilities function as long as that conspiracy is face-up in the command zone."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Conspiracies are colorless, have no mana cost, and can\'t be cast as spells."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Conspiracies are never put into your deck. Instead, you put any number of conspiracies from your card pool into the command zone as the game begins. These conspiracies are face up unless they have hidden agenda, in which case they begin the game face down.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Conspiracies aren\'t legal for any sanctioned Constructed format, but may be included in other Limited formats, such as Cube Draft."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You can look at any player\'s face-up conspiracies at any time. You\'ll also know how many face-down conspiracies a player has in the command zone, although you won\'t know what they are."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to play with any conspiracy you draft. However, you have only one opportunity to put conspiracies into the command zone, as the game begins. You can\'t put conspiracies into the command zone after this point."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If one target permanent becomes an illegal target, the other will be returned to its owner\'s hand. If both targets become illegal, Aether Tradewinds won\'t resolve."}]', "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'The target player can discard either one land card or two cards which may or may not be lands. The player can discard one land and one other card or two land cards if they choose.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "A face-down creature has no name, so it can\'t share a name with anything. This includes other creatures with no name."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'Echoing Courage has only one target. Other creatures with that name are not targeted. For example, a creature with protection from green will still get +2/+2 if it has the same name as the target creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Echoing Courage tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. No creatures get +2/+2."}, {\'date\': \'2022-06-10\', \'text\': \'Unless a token is a copy of another permanent or was explicitly given a name by the effect that created it, its name is the subtypes it was given when it was created plus the word "Token." For example, if an effect creates a 1/1 Soldier creature token, that token is named "Soldier Token."\'}]', "[{'date': '2018-03-16', 'text': 'A token has a mana value of 0 unless it is copying something else.'}, {'date': '2018-03-16', 'text': 'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-03-16', 'text': 'You draw three cards and put two cards back all while Brainstorm is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Infectious Horror’s ability causes the opposing team to lose 4 life.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If the target player\'s library contains fewer cards than the sacrificed creature\'s power, all of those cards are put into that player\'s graveyard. That player won\'t lose the game until they try to draw from the empty library."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'The number of cards the target player puts into their graveyard is equal to the power of the sacrificed creature as it last existed on the battlefield.\'}]', "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If any of the targeted creatures is an illegal target by the time Wrap in Flames resolves, it won’t be dealt damage and will be able to block. The other targeted creatures will still be affected.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The “can’t block” effect applies to each of the targeted creatures—and to only those creatures—even if Wrap in Flames deals no damage to one or more of them (due to a prevention effect, for example) or if Wrap in Flames deals damage to a different creature (due to a redirection effect).'}]", "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that Pitchburn Devils is dealt lethal damage, you lose the game before the ability goes on the stack.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a creature didn\'t die before a turn\'s end step begins, Deathreap Ritual\'s ability doesn\'t trigger at all. The creature may have died before Deathreap Ritual entered the battlefield, however."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'You draw one card when the ability resolves, not one card per creature that died during the turn.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Because the votes are cast in turn order, each player will know the votes of players who voted beforehand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Each player must vote for one of the candidate permanents. They can\'t abstain."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'In the unusual case that no permanents have any votes, nothing is exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'No player votes until the spell or ability resolves. Any responses to that spell or ability must be made without knowing the outcome of the vote.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'None of the candidate permanents are targeted. Players may vote for a permanent with protection from white, for example.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Players can\\\'t do anything after they finishing voting but before the "winning" permanent or permanents are exiled.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If there are no other creatures on the battlefield when the morbid ability triggers, the ability must target Morkrut Banshee itself.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Morkrut Banshee\'s morbid ability triggers only once, not once for each creature that has died this turn. If no creatures have died by the time it enters the battlefield, its ability won\'t trigger at all."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "As Victimize resolves, you must sacrifice a creature if able. You can\'t change your mind and choose not to sacrifice anything."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If one of the targeted creature cards is an illegal target (for instance, because it has left your graveyard before Victimize resolves), you\'ll still sacrifice a creature and put the other card onto the battlefield. If both are illegal targets, Victimize won\'t resolve. You won\'t sacrifice a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The creature you sacrifice isn\'t chosen until Victimize resolves. You can\'t return the creature you sacrifice because it will still be on the battlefield at the time targets are chosen."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You must choose two targets. You can\'t cast Victimize targeting only one creature card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Brago\'s last ability exiles and returns all the targets during the combat damage step, after combat damage is dealt. You can\'t target any creature that didn\'t survive combat."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you exile an Aura with Brago\'s last ability, the Aura\'s owner chooses what it will enchant as it comes back onto the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn\'t target anything (so it could be attached to an opponent\'s permanent with hexproof, for example), but the Aura\'s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. The Aura can\'t enter the battlefield enchanting a permanent that enters the battlefield at the same time. If the Aura can\'t legally be attached to anything, it remains exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'You may exile and return Brago using its own ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Compare Grenzo\'s power when the ability resolves with the power of the creature card in your graveyard to determine if you put it onto the battlefield. If Grenzo isn\'t on the battlefield at this time, use its last known power from when it was on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a replacement effect (such as that of Leyline of the Void) causes the card to be put from your library directly into exile, you\'ll put it onto the battlefield from exile if it\'s a creature card with appropriate power."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the card is a creature card with power less than or equal to Grenzo\'s power, it\'s put onto the battlefield from your graveyard, not from your library. Players can\'t attempt to exile it from your graveyard in response."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Any abilities of the lands sacrificed may modify or trigger on the creatures being sacrificed and on the cards being discarded. Abilities of the creatures won’t modify or trigger on the lands being sacrificed, but may modify or trigger on the cards being discarded.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Any abilities that trigger while Smallpox is resolving will wait to be put onto the stack until Smallpox is done resolving.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'As Smallpox resolves, first each player loses 1 life at the same time. Next, each player chooses a card in hand without revealing it, then all of the cards are discarded at the same time. Then starting with the player whose turn it is and proceeding in turn order, each player chooses a creature, knowing the choices made before them. All of the creatures are sacrificed at the same time, then finally repeat this process for lands.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Any permanent can be targeted by the second ability, not just one with counters on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Vampire Hexmage\'s ability can\'t target a permanent card in a zone other than the battlefield, such as a suspended card."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a creature may become lethal if you switch its power and toughness during that turn.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Effects that switch a creature’s power and toughness apply after all other effects, regardless of when those effects began to apply. For instance, if you target a 1/2 creature then give it +2/+0 later in the turn, it’s a 2/3 creature, not a 4/1 creature.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Switching a creature’s power and toughness twice (or any even number of times) effectively returns the creature to the power and toughness it had before any switches.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the chosen target is an illegal target by the time Orcish Cannonade tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You don’t draw a card, but you also don’t take 3 damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the target artifact or enchantment is an illegal target by the time Nature’s Claim tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. No player gains 4 life. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does gain 4 life.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Because damage remains marked on a creature until the cleanup step or an effect removes that damage, nonlethal damage dealt to creatures you control may become lethal if Mirari\'s Wake leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If tapping a land produces more than one type of mana, you choose one type that was produced and add one mana of that type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the mana produced by the land has any additional restrictions or riders, those restrictions or riders don\'t apply to the mana added by Mirari\'s Wake. You just get one mana of the appropriate type."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless.\'}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Activating the regeneration ability creates a replacement effect that acts like a shield, replacing the next time Spiritmonger would be destroyed that turn. This shield works against effects that try to destroy Spiritmonger or lethal damage that would be dealt to Spiritmonger.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Spiritmonger can regenerate even if it isn’t in combat, it’s already tapped, or it’s undamaged.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Spiritmonger’s last ability causes it to become only the chosen color. It will no longer be the colors it was previously.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'You can activate the regeneration ability even if Spiritmonger isn’t at risk of being destroyed.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Any ability that triggers whenever a card is cycled will trigger if you activate a forestcycling ability.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Forestcycling is a variant of the cycling ability. Unlike cycling (which allows you to draw a card), forestcycling allows you to search your library for a Forest card. The card you find can be a basic Forest or any land card with the Forest land type.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Exploration’s ability is cumulative with other effects that allow you to play additional lands, including ones created by other Explorations you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If Gamekeeper is no longer in your graveyard as its triggered ability resolves, you can’t choose to exile it. You won’t reveal cards from your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Piles may be empty.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Use the power of the creature from when it was last on the battlefield to determine how much life is gained.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'You must choose a legal target for each target required by Decimate. However, if a permanent has multiple card types, it may be chosen as the target for more than one instance of the word "target." For example, you could cast Decimate targeting an artifact creature, an enchantment, and a land.\'}]']
foreign_names: ["[{'name': 'もみ消し', 'text': '起動型能力１つか誘発型能力１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。（マナ能力は対象にできない。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「より強大な力がお粗末で非力な物体にぶつかっただけの事だ。どのような矛盾を期待していたのかね？」\\n――イーヴォ島の大魔導師、アズグリ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382797&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4ecffad-c199-437c-80b4-e77e4d94fbd1', 'multiverseId': 382797}, 'multiverseid': 382797}, {'name': '阻抑', 'text': '反击目标起动式或触发式异能。（法术力异能无法成为其目标。）', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「强劲力道遇上微渺物件。你觉得会产生怎样的吊诡？」\\n～伊弗斯岛大法术师厄齐桂', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382587&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a92c48c0-74e6-4e78-a3fe-74d32aee5195', 'multiverseId': 382587}, 'multiverseid': 382587}]", "[{'name': 'やじる悪鬼', 'text': '{2}{R}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それは可能なら攻撃する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デビル', 'flavor': '奴らの言語は断続的な鼻息と狂ったような叫びの耳障りな塊だが、その言わんとすることは極めて明確だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382703&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '217b1943-6ead-4d4c-940e-71ee25e82fcb', 'multiverseId': 382703}, 'multiverseid': 382703}, {'name': '诘难邪鬼', 'text': '{2}{R}：目标生物本回合若能攻击，则必须攻击。', 'type': '生物～魔鬼', 'flavor': '他们的语言虽只是吱叫鼻息与疯狂吼叫的不和谐音组合，但传达的讯息可鲜明无比。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382493&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2755e640-d822-4739-8ae4-ca4725897f78', 'multiverseId': 382493}, 'multiverseid': 382493}]", "[{'name': 'よじれた嫌悪者', 'text': '{B}：よじれた嫌悪者を再生する。\\n沼サイクリング {2} （{2}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから沼カードを１枚探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加える。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ミュータント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382809&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'caecba0b-10ff-4275-81f5-a8bd79e7f11d', 'multiverseId': 382809}, 'multiverseid': 382809}, {'name': '曲恶憎恨兽', 'text': '{B}：重生曲恶憎恨兽。\\n循环沼泽{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：从你的牌库中搜寻一张沼泽牌，展示该牌，并置于你手上。然后将你的牌库洗牌。）', 'type': '生物～灵俑／突变体', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382599&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b9f028a-a1a8-45b7-96fb-74ad0c4cafe4', 'multiverseId': 382599}, 'multiverseid': 382599}]", "[{'name': 'アカデミーの精鋭', 'text': 'アカデミーの精鋭は、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘはすべての墓地にあるインスタント・カードとソーサリー・カードの総数に等しい。\\n{2}{U}, アカデミーの精鋭の上から＋１/＋１カウンターを１個取り除く：カードを１枚引き、その後カードを１枚捨てる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382625&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87f2bcaf-f17c-4382-8309-2c0ea0f9e676', 'multiverseId': 382625}, 'multiverseid': 382625}, {'name': '学院精英', 'text': '学院精英进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物，X为所有坟墓场中瞬间牌和法术牌的数量加总。\\n{2}{U}，从学院精英上移去一个+1/+1指示物：抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。', 'type': '生物～人类／法术师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382415&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8fd6e288-2202-4e36-a227-2e32b717ba7b', 'multiverseId': 382415}, 'multiverseid': 382415}]", "[{'name': 'アジャニの陽光弾手', 'text': '絆魂（このクリーチャーがダメージを与えると、さらにあなたはその点数分のライフを得る。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 猫・クレリック', 'flavor': '「アジャニは行かねばならないところに行き、我々は彼の名の下に彼の土地を守る。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382631&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '461676f0-f65e-43ac-a1ec-f3009f72169a', 'multiverseId': 382631}, 'multiverseid': 382631}, {'name': '阿耶尼晖击僧', 'text': '系命（此生物所造成的伤害会让你获得等量的生命。）', 'type': '生物～猫／僧侣', 'flavor': '「阿耶尼会在最需要他的地方现身，而我们以其名立誓维护其领地安全。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382421&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf6d1714-e2a3-4b9b-94ba-e3cfe92e91e9', 'multiverseId': 382421}, 'multiverseid': 382421}]", "[{'name': 'エルフの逸脱者', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}{G}{G}を加える。\\n森サイクリング {2} （{2}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから森カードを１枚探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加える。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・ミュータント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382679&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2321744f-ffb6-4fe2-8740-b3b39f047e26', 'multiverseId': 382679}, 'multiverseid': 382679}, {'name': '畸变妖精', 'text': '{T}：加{G}{G}{G}到你的法术力池中。\\n循环树林{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：从你牌库中搜寻一张树林牌，展示该牌，并置于你手上。然后将你的牌库洗牌。）', 'type': '生物～妖精／突变体', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382469&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ec10ca2-2f00-45f2-a398-a9736aa6af53', 'multiverseId': 382469}, 'multiverseid': 382469}]", "[{'name': 'オークの連続砲撃', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。オークの連続砲撃はそれに２点のダメージ、あなたに３点のダメージを与える。\\nカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「焦げ助！傷背！火山弾を装填しろ。」\\n――オークの隊長、足引きずりのサッジ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382739&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5d3e9d5-cb65-438e-9856-f3654342cdcf', 'multiverseId': 382739}, 'multiverseid': 382739}, {'name': '半兽人炮轰', 'text': '半兽人炮轰对目标生物或牌手造成2点伤害，并对你造成3点伤害。\\n抓一张牌。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「阿卷！老疤！把下一发火弹上膛。」\\n～半兽人队长瘸腿索耶', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382529&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '16a45b37-2d21-44d9-991e-cc0c16559050', 'multiverseId': 382529}, 'multiverseid': 382529}]", "[{'name': 'カストーディの従者', 'text': '飛行\\n議決 ― カストーディの従者が戦場に出たとき、あなたから始めて各プレイヤーは、あなたの墓地にあるアーティファクト・カード１枚か、クリーチャー・カード１枚か、エンチャント・カード１枚に投票する。最多あるいは最多と同数の票を獲得した各カードをあなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット・クレリック', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382663&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '790cd14b-70ed-4fc3-8986-b1ecec80943b', 'multiverseId': 382663}, 'multiverseid': 382663}, {'name': '柩护扈从', 'text': '飞行\\n议定～当柩护扈从进战场时，由你开始，每位牌手各从你坟墓场投票选择一张神器、生物或结界牌。将票数最多或与他者同为最多的所有牌移回你手上。', 'type': '生物～精怪／僧侣', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382453&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da09fba8-8eca-45e0-a2ed-a3c98bd55685', 'multiverseId': 382453}, 'multiverseid': 382453}]", "[{'name': 'カストーディの霊魂縛り', 'text': 'カストーディの霊魂縛りは、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘは戦場に出ている他のクリーチャーの総数に等しい。\\n{2}{W}, カストーディの霊魂縛りの上から＋１/＋１カウンターを１個取り除く：飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382662&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9c75c57-f721-468b-9a30-bf20d2e8b2b4', 'multiverseId': 382662}, 'multiverseid': 382662}, {'name': '缚灵柩护', 'text': '缚灵柩护进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物，X为战场上其他生物的数量。\\n{2}{W}，从缚灵柩护上移去一个+1/+1指示物：将一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物放进战场。', 'type': '生物～人类／僧侣', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382452&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1b03c11-d0f3-458d-90ad-8cd6bca60cc0', 'multiverseId': 382452}, 'multiverseid': 382452}]", "[{'name': 'グリクシスの幻術師', 'text': '{T}：あなたがコントロールする土地１つを対象とする。それはターン終了時まで、あなたが選んだ１つの基本土地タイプになる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': '「簡単な話よ、本当に。見つからなけりゃ、殺されようがないんだから。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382699&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'abf4d1a0-174d-4119-bf3d-7cfcc6434e7e', 'multiverseId': 382699}, 'multiverseid': 382699}, {'name': '格利极幻影师', 'text': '{T}：选择一种基本地类别，目标由你操控的地成为该类别直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物～人类／法术师', 'flavor': '「道理真的很简单。只要他们找不到我们，就杀不了我们。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382489&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '882cd4c0-9210-4ea9-a921-3a84ecb4857d', 'multiverseId': 382489}, 'multiverseid': 382489}]", "[{'name': 'グレンゾの反論', 'text': '赤の４/４のオーガ・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。あなたから始めて各プレイヤーは、自分の左隣のプレイヤーがコントロールしているパーマネントの中からアーティファクト１つ、クリーチャー１体、土地１つを選ぶ。これにより選ばれた各パーマネントを破壊する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382698&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd77bdde8-8f2e-47ed-896a-107e058f0cce', 'multiverseId': 382698}, 'multiverseid': 382698}, {'name': '格伦佐的抗辩', 'text': '将一个4/4红色食人魔衍生生物放进战场。由你开始，每位牌手各从由其左手边牌手操控的永久物之中选择一个神器、一个生物和一个地。消灭所有该些永久物。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382488&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b6bfde51-081a-498c-9b38-27ed83ca935b', 'multiverseId': 382488}, 'multiverseid': 382488}]", "[{'name': 'グレンゾの殺し屋', 'text': '先制攻撃\\n廃位（このクリーチャーが最多あるいは最多と同点のライフを持つプレイヤーを攻撃するたび、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・ならず者', 'flavor': '「あの護衛どもは柔らけえからな。とがった短剣ならいつでも受け入れるだろうよ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382697&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd483eec8-4b5b-4678-98cf-d6730607166e', 'multiverseId': 382697}, 'multiverseid': 382697}, {'name': '格伦佐的割喉客', 'text': '先攻\\n义勇（每当此生物攻击生命最多或与他者同为最多的牌手时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）', 'type': '生物～鬼怪／浪客', 'flavor': '「他们的守卫懒散松懈，直教人想用锋利匕首捅上一刀。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382487&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a51063bb-79cb-4e61-bfbd-d39b17600e10', 'multiverseId': 382487}, 'multiverseid': 382487}]", "[{'name': 'コーの詠唱', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体と、他のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、あなたが選んだ発生源１つからその前者に与えられるすべてのダメージは、代わりにその後者に与えられる。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '太古からの脅威と戦うために、改変された聖なる儀式。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382714&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '60335e7e-1922-4e77-97f5-1be6e775598a', 'multiverseId': 382714}, 'multiverseid': 382714}, {'name': '寇族赞歌', 'text': '选择一个来源。于本回合中，该来源将对目标由你操控的生物造成之所有伤害，改为对另一个目标生物造成之。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '往昔的圣洁仪式如今已成为抵抗旧敌的祭礼。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382504&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9506837-3482-4bb2-8007-7219c2723e88', 'multiverseId': 382504}, 'multiverseid': 382504}]", "[{'name': 'セルヴァラの処罰者', 'text': '協議 ― セルヴァラの処罰者が戦場に出たとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。これにより公開された土地でないカード１枚につき、セルヴァラの処罰者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。その後、各プレイヤーはそれぞれカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382779&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cba25073-bdcd-4474-929f-3f45d21157da', 'multiverseId': 382779}, 'multiverseid': 382779}, {'name': '塞瓦拉的执法者', 'text': '论争～当塞瓦拉的执法者进战场时，每位牌手各展示其牌库顶牌。每以此法展示出一张非地牌，便在塞瓦拉的执法者上放置一个+1/+1指示物。然后每位牌手各抓一张牌。', 'type': '生物～妖精／战士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382569&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '549fc21d-4944-4857-a0ad-51125466e2bb', 'multiverseId': 382569}, 'multiverseid': 382569}]", "[{'name': 'セルヴァラの突撃', 'text': '協議 ― 各プレイヤーはそれぞれ自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。これにより公開された土地でないカード１枚につき、あなたは緑の３/３の象・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。その後、各プレイヤーはそれぞれカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'セルヴァラの到来には誰もが気付く。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382778&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb9ba1d2-91a8-49c6-afc1-9f747104e694', 'multiverseId': 382778}, 'multiverseid': 382778}, {'name': '塞瓦拉的冲锋', 'text': '论争～每位牌手各展示其牌库顶牌。每以此法展示出一张非地牌，你便将一个3/3绿色的象衍生生物放进战场。然后每位牌手各抓一张牌。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '塞瓦拉出现时都没法让人不知道。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382568&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ebd205fe-0c6f-4bc4-94f5-8135cea2f359', 'multiverseId': 382568}, 'multiverseid': 382568}]", "[{'name': 'ゾンビの大巨人', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・巨人', 'flavor': '「役立たずの脳の邪魔な部分を取り除くことは、いくつかの点において有益だ。機動性の向上、敵からの恐怖と嫌悪反応、そしてこと大型の種族においては、人員運搬用の空間にもなる。」\\n――死者の王、ザル・アシュール', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382834&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e4c005f-6e77-4832-8f53-6a591d7655e5', 'multiverseId': 382834}, 'multiverseid': 382834}, {'name': '巨硕灵俑', 'type': '生物～灵俑／巨人', 'flavor': '「把无用又占空间的脑部组织拿掉，能带来些好处：移动力略增，让敌人感到嫌恶与恐惧，并且若是大型样本，还能搭载乘员。」\\n～巫妖领主祝亚许', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382624&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71c18ac5-6c30-4766-9098-21eb6afc9e1e', 'multiverseId': 382624}, 'multiverseid': 382624}]", "[{'name': 'ダクの複製', 'text': 'あなたはダクの複製を、これが速攻と廃位を得ることを除いて、戦場に出ているいずれかのクリーチャーのコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。（このクリーチャーが最多あるいは最多と同点のライフを持つプレイヤーを攻撃するたび、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382665&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df4df168-66ee-4144-9f48-c9e466b0fd8c', 'multiverseId': 382665}, 'multiverseid': 382665}, {'name': '戴克的拟形妖', 'text': '你可以使戴克的拟形妖当成战场上任一生物的复制品来进入战场，但它额外获得敏捷与义勇异能。（每当它攻击生命最多或与他者同为最多的牌手时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）', 'type': '生物～变形兽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382455&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3704bbec-1d35-4d85-bd5a-6206a1df675f', 'multiverseId': 382455}, 'multiverseid': 382455}]", "[{'name': 'ダク・フェイデン', 'text': '＋１：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードを２枚引き、その後カードを２枚捨てる。\\n－２：アーティファクト１つを対象とし、それのコントロールを得る。\\n－６：あなたは「あなたがパーマネントを１つ以上対象とする呪文を１つ唱えるたび、それらのパーマネントのコントロールを得る。」を持つ紋章を得る。', 'type': 'プレインズウォーカー — ダク', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382664&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5295b5b0-0e43-4e29-b71d-f3591472e3cf', 'multiverseId': 382664}, 'multiverseid': 382664}, {'name': '戴克费登', 'text': '+1：目标牌手抓两张牌，然后弃两张牌。\\n-2：获得目标神器的操控权。\\n-6：你获得具有「每当你施放以一个或数个永久物为目标的咒语时，获得这些永久物的操控权」的徽记。', 'type': '鹏洛客～戴克', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382454&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9523a042-ea98-4f5e-9dd0-52c7aef7cfdd', 'multiverseId': 382454}, 'multiverseid': 382454}]", "[{'name': 'チフス鼠', 'text': '接死（これが何らかのダメージをクリーチャーに与えたら、それだけで破壊される。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ネズミ', 'flavor': 'ヘイヴングルで捕まった人さらいには、二つの選択肢が与えられる。投獄されるか、鼠取りになるかだ。 賢い奴は牢屋に行く。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382810&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8ab367b-06dd-4052-a9b9-ec179adbb3e7', 'multiverseId': 382810}, 'multiverseid': 382810}, {'name': '伤寒鼠', 'text': '死触（它对生物造成的任何数量伤害都足以消灭后者。）', 'type': '生物～老鼠', 'flavor': '在海温古被捕的绑架犯有两条路可选：在牢里关上多年，或是去当捕鼠人。聪明的就会选择进牢。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382600&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e342b46a-f43e-452a-90f4-b3a1e8fbd0dd', 'multiverseId': 382600}, 'multiverseid': 382600}]", "[{'name': 'テラストドン', 'text': 'テラストドンが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャーでないパーマネントを最大３つまで対象とする。あなたはそれらを破壊してもよい。これによりいずれかの墓地に置かれたパーマネント１つにつき、それのコントローラーは緑の３/３の象・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 象', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382802&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b6b9b3d-ae0d-4b36-b32b-77b866ac8c52', 'multiverseId': 382802}, 'multiverseid': 382802}, {'name': '撼地象', 'text': '当撼地象进战场时，你可以消灭至多三个目标非生物永久物。对每个以此法置入坟墓场的永久物而言，其操控者各将一个3/3绿色的象衍生生物放进战场。', 'type': '生物～象', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382592&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '39fd3229-2a68-412b-923e-0ea22dbb1ccf', 'multiverseId': 382592}, 'multiverseid': 382592}]", "[{'name': 'ディミーアのドッペルゲンガー', 'text': '{1}{U}{B}：いずれかの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを追放する。ディミーアのドッペルゲンガーはそのカードのコピーになるとともに、この能力を得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士', 'flavor': '「恐れるな。お前の命が償われないわけではない。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382671&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '223fc1ec-f650-4590-9f0b-93319cef996d', 'multiverseId': 382671}, 'multiverseid': 382671}, {'name': '底密尔化妖', 'text': '{1}{U}{B}：将目标生物牌从坟墓场放逐。底密尔化妖成为该牌的复制品，并获得此异能。', 'type': '生物～变形兽', 'flavor': '「别怕。你的一生并没白活。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382461&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd39f0b64-d91d-44bd-8854-5763acc295a3', 'multiverseId': 382461}, 'multiverseid': 382461}]", "[{'name': 'トカゲ人間の戦士', 'type': 'クリーチャー — トカゲ・戦士', 'flavor': '見た目に怯えてはいけない。牙と鉤爪を剥かれてからだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382717&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'af82e6b9-62a8-420d-9ac9-de926315cdfb', 'multiverseId': 382717}, 'multiverseid': 382717}, {'name': '蜥蜴战士', 'type': '生物～蜥蜴／战士', 'flavor': '别让它的外表吓着你了。它的爪子与利牙才是真正可怕的东西。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382507&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e3702cd-60be-451c-812d-955140082e4d', 'multiverseId': 382507}, 'multiverseid': 382507}]", "[{'name': 'トレストの密偵長、エドリック', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体があなたの対戦相手１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、それのコントローラーはカードを１枚引いてもよい。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・ならず者', 'flavor': '「情報元を明かすわけにはいかないが、お前の首の値段が高いのだけは保証する。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382677&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a36169e2-20df-498c-a898-35dfabe60f53', 'multiverseId': 382677}, 'multiverseid': 382677}, {'name': '崔斯特密探长埃卓克', 'text': '每当一个生物向你的任一对手造成战斗伤害时，其操控者可以抓一张牌。', 'type': '传奇生物～妖精／浪客', 'flavor': '「虽然我不能透露情报来源，但可以向你保证的是，你的脑袋很值钱。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382467&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd48bc49-87f0-4614-838b-6762e386e95c', 'multiverseId': 382467}, 'multiverseid': 382467}]", "[{'name': 'ドレイク街の遺棄者', 'text': 'ドレイク街の遺棄者は、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘはすべての墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの総数に等しい。\\n{2}{B}, ドレイク街の遺棄者から＋１/＋１カウンターを１個取り除く：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで－１/－１の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382674&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ba1b4ca-cb3d-40f6-881c-f7ad139282cd', 'multiverseId': 382674}, 'multiverseid': 382674}, {'name': '垂克镇遭忘者', 'text': '垂克镇遭忘者进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物，X为所有坟墓场中生物牌的数量。\\n{2}{B}，从垂克镇遭忘者上移去一个+1/+1指示物：目标生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物～灵俑', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382464&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '70fbc01c-eac7-473b-a202-a6f54e256aa5', 'multiverseId': 382464}, 'multiverseid': 382464}]", "[{'name': 'ナーリッドの群れ', 'text': '多重キッカー {1}{G}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{1}{G}を望む回数支払ってもよい。）\\nナーリッドの群れは、これがキッカーされた１回につき＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ビースト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382695&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ed3f106-b6cc-4c26-9cc6-497a36a5190c', 'multiverseId': 382695}, 'multiverseid': 382695}, {'name': '糙节兽群', 'text': '多重增幅{1}{G}（你施放此咒语时可以任意次数地额外支付{1}{G}。）\\n糙节兽群进战场时上面有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量为它增幅过的次数。', 'type': '生物～野兽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382485&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a5a5420-c85b-4442-abea-1aab245408a4', 'multiverseId': 382485}, 'multiverseid': 382485}]", "[{'name': 'ブレイゴの名代', 'text': '投票中、あなたは追加で票を１つ得る。（その票は別の選択もしくは同じ選択に投票してもよい。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー', 'flavor': 'フィオーラではいかなる案件も、ブレイゴ王の意見無くして決まることはない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382643&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9c52944-729c-4477-abaa-09586169a159', 'multiverseId': 382643}, 'multiverseid': 382643}, {'name': '布莱戈的代表', 'text': '投票时你可以额外多投票一次。（可以投票选择不同的选项或相同的选项。）', 'type': '生物～人类／参谋', 'flavor': '在布莱戈国王表态之前，翡欧拉境内诸般事物均不算有定论。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382433&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1820326e-f474-4d52-8c90-faf292ded873', 'multiverseId': 382433}, 'multiverseid': 382433}]", "[{'name': 'ブレイゴの好意', 'text': '秘策（この策略を統率領域に裏向きで置いた状態でゲームを始め、秘密裏にカード名を１つ指定する。あなたはいつでもこの策略を表向きにして、指定したカードの名前を公表してもよい。）\\nあなたが唱える指定した名前を持つ呪文は、それを唱えるためのコストが{1}少なくなる。', 'type': '策略', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382642&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0e4d189c-748b-490d-b105-de74e304182a', 'multiverseId': 382642}, 'multiverseid': 382642}, {'name': '布莱戈的恩惠', 'text': '秘案（开始游戏时此诡局牌面朝下地置于统帅区，并私下决定一个牌名。你随时可以将此诡局翻回正面并公布该名称。）\\n由你施放且具有该名称的咒语减少{1}来施放。', 'type': '诡局', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382432&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82ca8f49-7bcf-4519-87f5-7a1d604f0170', 'multiverseId': 382432}, 'multiverseid': 382432}]", "[{'name': 'ペラッカのワーム', 'text': 'トランプル\\nペラッカのワームが戦場に出たとき、あなたは７点のライフを得る。\\nペラッカのワームが死亡したとき、カードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ワーム', 'flavor': 'そいつは食いたいものを食う――動くものなら何でもだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382742&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b98ae5a-275b-47f2-8d7d-69fceb1617de', 'multiverseId': 382742}, 'multiverseid': 382742}, {'name': '皮拉卡亚龙', 'text': '践踏\\n当皮拉卡亚龙进战场时，你获得7点生命。\\n当皮拉卡亚龙死去时，抓一张牌。', 'type': '生物～亚龙', 'flavor': '他想吃什么就吃什么～也就是任何会动的东西。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382532&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40768ed4-4421-4fe0-9fda-c5a362fd520e', 'multiverseId': 382532}, 'multiverseid': 382532}]", "[{'name': 'ボールドウィアの威嚇者', 'text': '臆病者では戦士をブロックできない。\\n{R}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで臆病者になる。\\n{2}{R}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで戦士になる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 巨人・戦士', 'flavor': '「さあ、これでお前が誰だかみんなわかったろう。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382640&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55f24fe2-40b6-42ca-b730-300827cb37ef', 'multiverseId': 382640}, 'multiverseid': 382640}, {'name': '波维尔凶汉', 'text': '懦夫不能阻挡战士。\\n{R}：目标生物成为懦夫直到回合结束。\\n{2}{R}：目标生物成为战士直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物～巨人／战士', 'flavor': '「现在大家都知道你算个啥了。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382430&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '771608f8-15d6-4f38-8bdc-fae73d6759d4', 'multiverseId': 382430}, 'multiverseid': 382430}]", "[{'name': 'マナ噴出', 'text': 'あなたの対戦相手がコントロールするタップ状態の土地１つにつき、あなたのマナ・プールに{R}を加える。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '水銀海は辱めに対しては乱れ泡を立てる。ヴァルショクのシャーマンは微笑むのみ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382722&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '28585362-29f1-4e44-ae9d-9d273e191acd', 'multiverseId': 382722}, 'multiverseid': 382722}, {'name': '法术力喷发', 'text': '所有对手每操控一个已横置的地，便加{R}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '水银海因此侮辱而骚动起来；瓦许克祭师仅浅浅一笑。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382512&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9f279c2-0d36-4a20-a91c-05e1496fb0f2', 'multiverseId': 382512}, 'multiverseid': 382512}]", "[{'name': 'マルチェッサの使者', 'text': '呪禁（このクリーチャーは、対戦相手がコントロールする呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\n廃位（このクリーチャーが最多あるいは最多と同点のライフを持つプレイヤーを攻撃するたび、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者', 'flavor': '「黒薔薇様は雑草がお気に召さないのでね。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382724&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'acd8f496-ee2f-4288-afaf-2ef5a454231a', 'multiverseId': 382724}, 'multiverseid': 382724}, {'name': '玛切莎的密使', 'text': '辟邪（此生物不能成为由对手所操控之咒语或异能的目标。）\\n义勇（每当此生物攻击生命最多或与他者同为最多的牌手时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）', 'type': '生物～人类／浪客', 'flavor': '「黑蔷薇对废物绝不宽贷。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382514&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61c29d8e-5454-4c22-9cb6-f1887b277e66', 'multiverseId': 382514}, 'multiverseid': 382514}]", "[{'name': 'マルチェッサの密輸人', 'text': '廃位（このクリーチャーが最多あるいは最多と同点のライフを持つプレイヤーを攻撃するたび、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。）\\n{1}{U}{R}：あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで速攻を得るとともにこのターン、それはブロックされない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者', 'flavor': '「頭上にはお気を付けて……そして背後も。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382726&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8fc852c7-09ac-4a44-8b57-276f94a2461b', 'multiverseId': 382726}, 'multiverseid': 382726}, {'name': '玛切莎的走私犯', 'text': '义勇（每当此生物攻击生命最多或与他者同为最多的牌手时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\\n{1}{U}{R}：目标由你操控的生物获得敏捷异能直到回合结束，且本回合不能被阻挡。', 'type': '生物～人类／浪客', 'flavor': '「当心脑袋...提防身后。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382516&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a546dff-574a-4db9-83d9-87edaa4c15b6', 'multiverseId': 382516}, 'multiverseid': 382516}]", "[{'name': 'マルチェッサの浸透者', 'text': '廃位（このクリーチャーが最多あるいは最多と同点のライフを持つプレイヤーを攻撃するたび、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。）\\nマルチェッサの浸透者がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、カードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者', 'flavor': '「秘密はコインのように、簡単に盗める。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382725&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '85963326-8558-4c09-ab36-14aeea544953', 'multiverseId': 382725}, 'multiverseid': 382725}, {'name': '玛切莎的渗透者', 'text': '义勇（每当此生物攻击生命最多或与他者同为最多的牌手时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\\n每当玛切莎的渗透者对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，抓一张牌。', 'type': '生物～人类／浪客', 'flavor': '「刺探情报就如窃取钱币一般易如反掌。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382515&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78505062-7893-4e6c-a1e5-962875a0479f', 'multiverseId': 382515}, 'multiverseid': 382515}]", "[{'name': 'ミラディンの核', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。\\n{T}：ミラディンの核の上に蓄積カウンターを１個置く。\\n{T}, ミラディンの核の上から蓄積カウンターを１個取り除く：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382729&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63ab340a-6739-4c5b-83df-022d6b6e06cc', 'multiverseId': 382729}, 'multiverseid': 382729}, {'name': '秘罗地核心', 'text': '{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。\\n{T}：在秘罗地核心上放置一个充电指示物。\\n{T}，从秘罗地核心上移去一个充电指示物：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382519&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fc1bef78-2b66-4e02-8c72-b093ee548280', 'multiverseId': 382519}, 'multiverseid': 382519}]", "[{'name': 'ミラーリの目覚め', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたがマナを引き出す目的で土地を１つタップするたび、あなたのマナ・プールに、その土地が生み出したいずれかのタイプのマナ１点を加える。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '土地はまるでずっと乾ききっていたかのように、ミラーリの力を飲み込んだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382728&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd5165f7b-47a0-4399-aaa6-4129409354af', 'multiverseId': 382728}, 'multiverseid': 382728}, {'name': '映奇宝珠的余韵', 'text': '由你操控的生物得+1/+1。\\n每当你横置一个地以产生法术力时，加一点该地已产生的类别之法术力到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '大地暴烈地自宝珠汲取能量，仿佛亘古以来便未进滴水。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382518&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '134c36cf-7a7c-4bb3-87c1-0180bbb3b030', 'multiverseId': 382518}, 'multiverseid': 382518}]", "[{'name': 'ムッツィオの準備', 'text': '秘策（この策略を統率領域に裏向きで置いた状態でゲームを始め、秘密裏にカード名を１つ指定する。あなたはいつでもこの策略を表向きにして、指定したカードの名前を公表してもよい。）\\nあなたがコントロールする指定した名前を持つ各クリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターが追加で１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '策略', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382735&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff300d7a-0f9f-4487-8d49-b5333c267da5', 'multiverseId': 382735}, 'multiverseid': 382735}, {'name': '穆奇奥的整备', 'text': '秘案（开始游戏时此诡局牌面朝下地置于统帅区，并私下决定一个牌名。你随时可以将此诡局翻回正面并公布该名称。）\\n每个由你操控且具有该名称的生物进战场时上面额外有一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '诡局', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382525&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '104878c8-aa77-4337-9cb6-ec3f9bdde76e', 'multiverseId': 382525}, 'multiverseid': 382525}]", "[{'name': 'モークラットのバンシー', 'text': '陰鬱 ― モークラットのバンシーが戦場に出たとき、このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していた場合、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで－４/－４の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット', 'flavor': '「恨みを捨てなさい。さもなくば、殺したいほどの怒りに取り憑かれ、沼地を永遠にさまようことになりかねません。」\\n――アヴァシンの僧侶、ヒルディン', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382732&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4670e4c-f52e-46ac-9e54-aa8337ac0257', 'multiverseId': 382732}, 'multiverseid': 382732}, {'name': '穆坎女妖', 'text': '丧心～当穆坎女妖进战场时，若本回合有生物死去，则目标生物得-4/-4直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物～精怪', 'flavor': '「抛弃你的嫌隙，否则小心会落入抱着恨意永远在沼地徘徊的地步。」\\n～艾维欣僧侣西汀', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382522&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8afe8e91-5829-4f8e-98e3-b709465d3e6d', 'multiverseId': 382522}, 'multiverseid': 382522}]", "[{'name': 'ヤヴィマヤの火', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは速攻を持つ。\\nヤヴィマヤの火を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': 'ヤヴィマヤは戦いへの最短の道を照らし出す。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382687&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22c1ff60-7826-43d5-abf3-63d685fd04e6', 'multiverseId': 382687}, 'multiverseid': 382687}, {'name': '亚维马雅之火', 'text': '由你操控的生物具有敏捷异能。\\n牺牲亚维马雅之火：目标生物得+2/+2直到回合结束。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '亚维马雅照亮了通往战斗的捷径。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382477&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd07536a0-1f34-483f-b6dd-39e077b975aa', 'multiverseId': 382477}, 'multiverseid': 382477}]", "[{'name': 'ラッパの一吹き', 'text': '攻撃クリーチャーはターン終了時まで＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'ケルドの戦士には、戦いを始めるための合図は必要ない。彼らに必要なのは、戦いを止めるための合図だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382807&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '241b5bc4-310a-4a2d-bdca-742bf6d86f88', 'multiverseId': 382807}, 'multiverseid': 382807}, {'name': '号角震天', 'text': '进行攻击的生物得+2/+0直到回合结束。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '凯尔顿战士不需要施令进攻，但却需要停手的讯号。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382597&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c5ac534-d109-4be4-abdb-5079bfd50dad', 'multiverseId': 382597}, 'multiverseid': 382597}]", "[{'name': 'リスの巣', 'text': 'エンチャント（土地）\\nエンチャントされている土地は「{T}：緑の１/１のリス・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。」を持つ。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': '多くの者には見えない木の上では、騒がしく走り回る死が潜んでいる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382794&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1420a4b3-4edc-4636-b1e6-55fabd504850', 'multiverseId': 382794}, 'multiverseid': 382794}, {'name': '松鼠巢穴', 'text': '结附于地\\n所结附的地具有「{T}：将一个1/1绿色松鼠衍生生物放进战场。」', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': '树顶上视线未及之处，潜藏着絮聒而灵巧的杀机。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382584&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '14f174b9-ef3d-4a6b-a49b-a58ae73edd9e', 'multiverseId': 382584}, 'multiverseid': 382584}]", "[{'name': 'リリアナの死霊', 'text': '飛行\\nリリアナの死霊が戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手はそれぞれカードを１枚捨てる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スペクター', 'flavor': '「最高級の下僕は、私が何も言わなくても、何が必要かわかっているものさ。」\\n――リリアナ・ヴェス', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382716&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a44a2df-8490-42ab-9175-9d79fb34bd84', 'multiverseId': 382716}, 'multiverseid': 382716}, {'name': '莉莲娜仆幽灵', 'text': '飞行\\n当莉莲娜仆幽灵进战场时，每位对手各弃一张牌。', 'type': '生物～幽灵', 'flavor': '「最优秀的仆从不需我动口，就知道我要什么。」\\n～莉莲娜维斯', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382506&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '658bd166-2d16-46da-a9d8-504fb928d0fe', 'multiverseId': 382506}, 'multiverseid': 382506}]", "[{'name': 'ルーンの苦役者', 'text': 'ルーンの苦役者が死亡したとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': '学者たちは何世紀もの間タル・テリグの遺跡に頭を悩ませてきた。その秘密はルーンの刻まれたその頭の中にずっとあったのに。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382770&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '28522c00-57a3-4653-809e-00b7b717fd43', 'multiverseId': 382770}, 'multiverseid': 382770}, {'name': '符文随侍', 'text': '当符文随侍死去时，每位牌手各抓一张牌。', 'type': '神器生物～组构体', 'flavor': '塔帖立遗迹让学者思索数百年却找不到解答。其秘密一直就躲在个刻着符文的头里面。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382560&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '600bd061-c0a2-42b0-b070-cfd309ca7b47', 'multiverseId': 382560}, 'multiverseid': 382560}]", "[{'name': 'ヴィダルケンの宇宙儀', 'text': 'あなたは土地でないカードを、瞬速を持っているかのように唱えてもよい。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': 'この模型は五つ目の太陽を苦もなく組み込んである。それはまるですでにわかっていたかのように。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382818&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c64d04db-467f-44b4-a95f-9076da03be92', 'multiverseId': 382818}, 'multiverseid': 382818}, {'name': '维多肯星像仪', 'text': '你可以将非地牌视同具有闪现异能地来施放。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '此模型将第五太阳顺势纳入，彷佛设计时早已预见。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382608&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0baefbc3-3cbc-4518-9051-c7328ca88109', 'multiverseId': 382608}, 'multiverseid': 382608}]", "[{'name': '一石二鳥', 'text': '秘策（この策略を統率領域に裏向きで置いた状態でゲームを始め、秘密裏にカード名を１つ指定する。あなたはいつでもこの策略を表向きにして、指定したカードの名前を公表してもよい。）\\nあなたが指定した名前を持つインスタント呪文かソーサリー呪文を１つ唱えるたび、あなたはそれをコピーしてもよい。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。', 'type': '策略', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382673&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58be906d-eb18-4287-8542-b6c78aa9c115', 'multiverseId': 382673}, 'multiverseid': 382673}, {'name': '双重击打', 'text': '秘案（开始游戏时此诡局牌面朝下地置于统帅区，并私下决定一个牌名。你随时可以将此诡局翻回正面并公布该名称。）\\n每当你施放一个具有该名称的瞬间或法术咒语时，你可以复制之。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。', 'type': '诡局', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382463&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45e1e192-6a73-4eb8-9a0b-6698520d3128', 'multiverseId': 382463}, 'multiverseid': 382463}]", "[{'name': '上天の貿易風', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールするパーマネント１つと、あなたがコントロールしていないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それらをオーナーの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「風に凶運の臭いがする。結び目を確認しなさい。」\\n――オンドゥの僧侶、アニタン', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382628&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a522085c-4eb3-4ff6-874c-cf225e2aca35', 'multiverseId': 382628}, 'multiverseid': 382628}, {'name': '乙太贸易风', 'text': '将目标由你操控的永久物与目标不由你操控的永久物分别移回其拥有者手上。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「风中有不祥气味。快检查你的绳结。」\\n～昂度僧侣阿尼坦', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382418&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2401f262-b8df-44d1-b3a4-c4041b838487', 'multiverseId': 382418}, 'multiverseid': 382418}]", "[{'name': '不正利得', 'text': '不正利得を追放する。各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の手札を捨て、その後自分の墓地にあるカードを最大３枚まで自分の手札に戻す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'ウルザはそれを聖戦だと思っていた。しかし、ザンチャは強奪であることを知っていた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382708&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '66ba7e6a-e5cb-4efc-8d23-dd1e4f586bb5', 'multiverseId': 382708}, 'multiverseid': 382708}, {'name': '不当之利', 'text': '放逐不当之利。每位牌手各弃掉其手牌，然后将至多三张牌从其坟墓场移回其手上。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '克撒以为那是正义之军，珊迦知道那是抢劫。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382498&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1fd3f58c-1ae2-4070-a016-af4e37a7d676', 'multiverseId': 382498}, 'multiverseid': 382498}]", "[{'name': '不浄の契約', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーが死亡したとき、そのカードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': '悪魔との契約が墓場で終わることは滅多にない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382814&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e24ac2b0-8c55-4b70-9462-3da9e44f5581', 'multiverseId': 382814}, 'multiverseid': 382814}, {'name': '孽物契约', 'text': '结附于生物\\n当所结附的生物死去时，将该牌在你的操控下移回战场。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': '与恶魔签订的契约鲜少终结于坟墓。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382604&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bcf88ca2-a99b-4880-9632-42f37fc8a4ab', 'multiverseId': 382604}, 'multiverseid': 382604}]", "[{'name': '世界編み', 'text': '（この策略を統率領域に表向きに置いた状態でゲームを始める。）\\nあなたのカードプールにあるすべてのカードが、ゲーム開始時にあなたのライブラリーまたは統率領域に置かれているかぎり、あなたがコントロールする土地は「{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。', 'type': '策略', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382831&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d78804c-7500-4ab3-b9e5-a4e5d00dde64', 'multiverseId': 382831}, 'multiverseid': 382831}, {'name': '联世妙想', 'text': '（开始游戏时将此诡局牌面朝上地置于统帅区。）\\n只要你牌池中的所有牌游戏开始时均在你的牌库或统帅区中，由你操控的地便具有「{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。」', 'type': '诡局', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382621&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7cb8afb-bc8a-4734-8bf8-821d03d4f90b', 'multiverseId': 382621}, 'multiverseid': 382621}]", "[{'name': '中休み', 'text': 'このターンに与えられるすべての戦闘ダメージを軽減する。あなたは攻撃クリーチャー１体につき１点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「奴らに艦を横づけにされたら、おしまいよ。」とオアリムは警告した。クロウヴァクスはうなづいて答えた。「横づけにされなかったとしても……どうなるんだろう？」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382766&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51b3f62d-957d-44bd-873f-10f994960178', 'multiverseId': 382766}, 'multiverseid': 382766}, {'name': '缓兵', 'text': '于本回合中，防止将造成的所有战斗伤害。每有一个进行攻击的生物，你便获得1点生命。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「若他们上船我们便糟了。」欧琳警告着。寇维克斯颔首道：「若他们不上船...又会如何？」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382556&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd410ff8-92d3-4e3b-a4d3-f8f4c49efbc6', 'multiverseId': 382556}, 'multiverseid': 382556}]", "[{'name': '予想外の潜在力', 'text': '秘策（この策略を統率領域に裏向きで置いた状態でゲームを始め、秘密裏にカード名を１つ指定する。あなたはいつでもこの策略を表向きにして、指定したカードの名前を公表してもよい。）\\nあなたは任意のマナをいずれかの色のマナであるかのように支払って、指定した名前を持つ呪文を唱えてもよい。', 'type': '策略', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382813&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d408157-0371-490f-a714-f60a7d320f58', 'multiverseId': 382813}, 'multiverseid': 382813}, {'name': '意外潜能', 'text': '秘案（开始游戏时此诡局牌面朝下地置于统帅区，并私下决定一个牌名。你随时可以将此诡局翻回正面并公布该名称。）\\n你可以将法术力视同任意颜色的法术力来支付施放具有该名称之咒语的费用。', 'type': '诡局', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382603&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7fb9463-f8ae-405b-bdab-3a4ea369f7a3', 'multiverseId': 382603}, 'multiverseid': 382603}]", "[{'name': '代替案', 'text': '（この策略を統率領域に表向きに置いた状態でゲームを始める。）\\nゲーム開始に際して、追加の手札としてカードを７枚引く。マリガン開始前に、どれかの手札１組を残し、それ以外をあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。', 'type': '策略', 'flavor': '「次策を求めているのかね、友よ？」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382636&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5509d9da-8732-48c8-ba9c-1a07fb387c24', 'multiverseId': 382636}, 'multiverseid': 382636}, {'name': '后备计划', 'text': '（开始游戏时将此诡局牌面朝上地置于统帅区。）\\n于游戏开始时，额外抓一份七张牌的手牌。进行再调度前，留下其中一份手牌，并将其余的洗回你的牌库。', 'type': '诡局', 'flavor': '「在物色替代品吗，伙计？」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382426&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d5483bd-3fbb-4a50-9ca9-e8aad28523e6', 'multiverseId': 382426}, 'multiverseid': 382426}]", "[{'name': '停滞の監房', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、それのコントローラーのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\\n{3}{U}：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それに停滞の監房をつける。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': 'シミック団は実験物を貯蔵するための部屋を作った。アゾリウスはその部屋を有罪の者のために使っている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382795&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef908377-24e9-42e6-8a52-a64574009c53', 'multiverseId': 382795}, 'multiverseid': 382795}, {'name': '静态牢笼', 'text': '结附于生物\\n所结附的生物于其操控者的重置步骤中不能重置。\\n{3}{U}：将静态牢笼结附在目标生物上。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': '析米克的成员制造此种牢笼，好用来保存实验品。俄佐立的成员则用牢笼来监禁罪犯。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382585&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd3df2a61-275c-48b4-a72a-9aa7a18c4639', 'multiverseId': 382585}, 'multiverseid': 382585}]", "[{'name': '先見的設計家、ムッツィオ', 'text': '{3}{U}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーの一番上からＸ枚のカードを見る。Ｘはあなたがコントロールするアーティファクトの点数で見たマナ・コストのうちで最も大きい数に等しい。あなたはその中からアーティファクト・カードを１枚公開して戦場に出してもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・工匠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382734&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5173d34d-5236-49d0-b845-c4a0ade1c666', 'multiverseId': 382734}, 'multiverseid': 382734}, {'name': '创见构念师穆奇奥', 'text': '{3}{U}，{T}：检视你牌库顶的X张牌，X为由你操控的神器间最高之总法术力费用。你可以展示其中的一张神器牌，并将它放进战场。将其余的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底。', 'type': '传奇生物～人类／神器师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382524&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3241bd38-9429-408a-a20c-5701114f008c', 'multiverseId': 382524}, 'multiverseid': 382524}]", "[{'name': '分割判定', 'text': '議決 ― インスタント呪文またはソーサリー呪文を１つ対象として選ぶ。あなたから始めて各プレイヤーは「否定」または「複製」のいずれかに投票する。「否定」がより多くの票を得た場合、その呪文を打ち消す。「複製」がより多くの票を得た、あるいは票が同数だった場合、その呪文をコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382791&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '79bce8d0-fbe7-4969-a13d-993761f05f74', 'multiverseId': 382791}, 'multiverseid': 382791}, {'name': '两难决定', 'text': '议定～选择目标瞬间或法术咒语。由你开始，每位牌手各投票选择「拒斥」或「重制」。如果拒斥票数较多，则反击该咒语。如果重制票数较多或两者同为最多，则复制该咒语。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382581&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6323216c-e82a-463d-bbab-d5db3b4cc51e', 'multiverseId': 382581}, 'multiverseid': 382581}]", "[{'name': '剣を鍬に', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。それのコントローラーは、それのパワーに等しい点数のライフを得る。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'ごく小さい後悔の種が救済の花を咲かせる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382800&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1a094700-5cc6-49af-b8da-245f30de2fdd', 'multiverseId': 382800}, 'multiverseid': 382800}, {'name': '化剑为犁', 'text': '放逐目标生物。其操控者获得等同于其力量的生命。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '再小的悔恨种子也能开出救赎之花。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382590&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b2b1333-1d8a-408f-9daf-59f39231e7c1', 'multiverseId': 382590}, 'multiverseid': 382590}]", "[{'name': '勇壮の時', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋２/＋２の修整を受けるとともに絆魂を得る。（このクリーチャーがダメージを与えると、さらにそのコントローラーはその点数分のライフを得る。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「我が信仰は、牙や爪や意思無き飢えよりも強い。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382731&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '13768dec-f5bc-4e1b-8cea-b9974eb7fc73', 'multiverseId': 382731}, 'multiverseid': 382731}, {'name': '英勇一刻', 'text': '目标生物得+2/+2且获得系命异能直到回合结束。（此生物所造成的伤害会让其操控者获得等量的生命。）', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「我的信念强过尖牙利爪或无尽饥饿。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382521&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0047230d-3900-4f10-88d7-712efe524239', 'multiverseId': 382521}, 'multiverseid': 382521}]", "[{'name': '占骨術', 'text': '占骨術を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたの墓地にあるカードをＸ枚追放する。\\nあなたはカードをＸ枚引き、Ｘ点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '彼が惹かれた闇の宝に比べれば、彼の家族など安い代償であった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382784&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7e26a6c8-bcfa-4c5d-98a5-a1d194f199b9', 'multiverseId': 382784}, 'multiverseid': 382784}, {'name': '骸骨占卜', 'text': '从你坟墓场中放逐X张牌，以作为施放骸骨占卜的额外费用。\\n你抓X张牌并失去X点生命。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '家族遗骨不过是他召使这股黑暗赋力的小小代价。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382574&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '228c72dc-7c3d-4f24-a6ea-281959344e21', 'multiverseId': 382574}, 'multiverseid': 382574}]", "[{'name': '即応行動', 'text': '秘策（この策略を統率領域に裏向きで置いた状態でゲームを始め、秘密裏にカード名を１つ指定する。あなたはいつでもこの策略を表向きにして、指定したカードの名前を公表してもよい。）\\nあなたがコントロールする指定した名前を持つクリーチャーは速攻を持つ。', 'type': '策略', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382709&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ec028da-2a64-4a49-9b3d-636e8b88db7a', 'multiverseId': 382709}, 'multiverseid': 382709}, {'name': '事不宜迟', 'text': '秘案（开始游戏时此诡局牌面朝下地置于统帅区，并私下决定一个牌名。你随时可以将此诡局翻回正面并公布该名称。）\\n由你操控且具有该名称的生物具有敏捷异能。', 'type': '诡局', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382499&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e2c595a-503d-42a8-b379-5006c3bfe6bf', 'multiverseId': 382499}, 'multiverseid': 382499}]", "[{'name': '反射池', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、あなたがコントロールする土地が生み出すことのできるいずれかのタイプのマナ１点を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': 'それが映すのは、かつて在りし未来か、在り得ざる過去か？', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382762&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed6ab645-1bef-4a5f-9dca-3b0357b59a08', 'multiverseId': 382762}, 'multiverseid': 382762}, {'name': '映景明湖', 'text': '{T}：加一点法术力到你的法术力池中，其类别为由你操控的地能产生之任一类别。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '它会映照出曾经的未来，亦或不再的过往？', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382552&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ffbd156d-1dd2-4e1b-80d7-38953be56b14', 'multiverseId': 382552}, 'multiverseid': 382552}]", "[{'name': '反復分析', 'text': '秘策（この策略を統率領域に裏向きで置いた状態でゲームを始め、秘密裏にカード名を１つ指定する。あなたはいつでもこの策略を表向きにして、指定したカードの名前を公表してもよい。）\\nあなたが指定した名前を持つインスタント呪文かソーサリー呪文を１つ唱えるたび、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。', 'type': '策略', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382712&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '95128364-85e7-492c-bf63-6db3be0e4839', 'multiverseId': 382712}, 'multiverseid': 382712}, {'name': '反复分析', 'text': '秘案（开始游戏时此诡局牌面朝下地置于统帅区，并私下决定一个牌名。你随时可以将此诡局翻回正面并公布该名称。）\\n每当你施放一个具有该名称的瞬间或法术咒语时，你可以抓一张牌。', 'type': '诡局', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382502&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cca2f85a-5a3e-4197-b068-4187a1472726', 'multiverseId': 382502}, 'multiverseid': 382502}]", "[{'name': '取引仲介機', 'text': '取引仲介機を表向きの状態でドラフトする。\\nドラフト終了直後に、あなたのカードプールにあるカードを１枚公開してもよい。他の各プレイヤーは、自分のカードプールにあるカードを１枚、それと交換することを提案してもよい。あなたはいずれかの提案を１つ受け入れてもよい。\\n{T}：カードを１枚引き、その後カードを１枚捨てる。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382666&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '86902877-0b2e-42c3-881d-a349893903c3', 'multiverseId': 382666}, 'multiverseid': 382666}, {'name': '交易掮客', 'text': '交易掮客以牌面朝上的方式进行轮抽。\\n于轮抽结束的同时，你可以展示你牌池中的一张牌。每位其他牌手均可以用其牌池中的任一张牌提议与该牌交换。你可以接受任一项提议。\\n{T}：抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。', 'type': '神器生物～组构体', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382456&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'efc92af4-8879-4d1d-b552-be5e23a6d953', 'multiverseId': 382456}, 'multiverseid': 382456}]", "[{'name': '吠え群れの飢え', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\n陰鬱 ― このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していたなら、代わりにそれの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを３個置く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「狼男ってのは、捕食者の本能と人間の憎悪の邪悪な合いの子ね。」\\n――ケッシグの罠師、アレイナ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382705&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b925e404-8ae9-4091-bdf6-597adc989794', 'multiverseId': 382705}, 'multiverseid': 382705}, {'name': '嚎群饥欲', 'text': '在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n丧心～如果本回合有生物死去，则改为在该生物上放置三个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「狼人是掠食者本能与人类恨意的邪恶混合。」\\n～凯锡革布陷人阿雷娜', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382495&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a95759d0-ff5d-4d0c-9b94-ee3609c33a7f', 'multiverseId': 382495}, 'multiverseid': 382495}]", "[{'name': '吸血鬼の呪詛術士', 'text': '先制攻撃\\n吸血鬼の呪詛術士を生け贄に捧げる：パーマネント１つを対象とし、それの上に置かれているカウンターをすべて取り除く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・シャーマン', 'flavor': '血の狩りの興奮が失われてしまった彼女は、より目に見えない支配のしかたを求めた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382817&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c7900d28-7e47-4810-a30f-ae358bd686b1', 'multiverseId': 382817}, 'multiverseid': 382817}, {'name': '邪术吸血鬼', 'text': '先攻\\n牺牲邪术吸血鬼：移去目标永久物上的所有指示物。', 'type': '生物～吸血鬼／祭师', 'flavor': '当鲜血狩猎失去了刺激感，她便开始寻求不那么具象的支配方式。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382607&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d0e558b-0023-4e90-8144-8a07aac62691', 'multiverseId': 382607}, 'multiverseid': 382607}]", "[{'name': '吸魂', 'text': '吸魂は、他の各プレイヤーにそれぞれ２点のダメージを与える。あなたはこれにより与えたダメージに等しい点数のライフを得る。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'フェイジが餌食の生命力を奪う中、ジェスカの意識が一瞬目覚めた。しかしそれは、餌食の苦悶に接した愉悦に再びかき消されていった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382801&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '26b6371b-6bb0-42b3-ab34-7f7ea11eae4b', 'multiverseId': 382801}, 'multiverseid': 382801}, {'name': '吸魂', 'text': '吸魂对每位其他牌手各造成2点伤害。你获得等同于以此法所造成的伤害之生命。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '当菲姬畅饮他们的能量时，属于洁丝卡的遥远记忆轻颤了一下。而后受害者苦痛带来的欢愉让她再度浸溺其间。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382591&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef5f7c2d-8391-40c1-a55d-f060225af304', 'multiverseId': 382591}, 'multiverseid': 382591}]", "[{'name': '嘘か真か', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーの一番上から５枚のカードを公開する。対戦相手１人は、それらのカードを２つの束に分ける。一方の束をあなたの手札に加え、もう一方をあなたの墓地に置く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「何が重要かわかっているふりでもするがいい。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382685&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2aa099f3-c046-482a-8b40-9fa3a2f1331b', 'multiverseId': 382685}, 'multiverseid': 382685}, {'name': '真伪莫辨', 'text': '展示你牌库顶的五张牌。由任一对手将它们分成两堆。将其中一堆置于你手上，另一堆置入你的坟墓场。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「就试着假装你知道什么比较重要好了。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382475&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3874f2f9-44e2-4d6b-b8a8-0ccfa4042810', 'multiverseId': 382475}, 'multiverseid': 382475}]", "[{'name': '囁く歯車の隠密', 'text': '囁く歯車の隠密を表向きの状態でドラフトする。\\nドラフト中、あなたは囁く歯車の隠密を裏向きにしてもよい。そうしたなら、ドラフトで未開封または別のプレイヤーに見られていないいずれかのブースターパックを見る。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': '偵察は今日のため。計画は明日のため。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382826&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c6118891-205f-4091-874d-b31fe897fe35', 'multiverseId': 382826}, 'multiverseid': 382826}, {'name': '嗫语窥械', 'text': '嗫语窥械以牌面朝上的方式进行轮抽。\\n于轮抽中，你可以将嗫语窥械翻为牌面朝下。如果你如此作，则检视本轮抽中任意一包未打开的补充包或任意一包其他牌手目前并未检视的补充包。', 'type': '神器生物～组构体', 'flavor': '侦察当下。计划未来。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382616&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ac25fdd-f302-4373-8002-a74b77b9fe25', 'multiverseId': 382616}, 'multiverseid': 382616}]", "[{'name': '地下牢の管理人、グレンゾ', 'text': '地下牢の管理人、グレンゾは、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{2}：あなたのライブラリーの一番下のカードをあなたの墓地に置く。それが地下牢の管理人、グレンゾのパワー以下のパワーを持つクリーチャー・カードであった場合、それを戦場に出す。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・ならず者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382696&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8ed124f4-5b48-4c69-b630-0d90593f4841', 'multiverseId': 382696}, 'multiverseid': 382696}, {'name': '地牢典狱长格伦佐', 'text': '地牢典狱长格伦佐进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。\\n{2}：将你的牌库底牌置入你的坟墓场。如果该牌为生物牌，且其力量等于或小于格伦佐的力量，则将之放进战场。', 'type': '传奇生物～鬼怪／浪客', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382486&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4eb3aa74-c354-46c6-84eb-e9ffc78d9ef1', 'multiverseId': 382486}, 'multiverseid': 382486}]", "[{'name': '垂直落下', 'text': '飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「空にあるべきは風のみとしよう。」\\n――黄金森のドルイド、デジャーラ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382750&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a646f24-1a77-4911-bb22-ba8ef0d73ed4', 'multiverseId': 382750}, 'multiverseid': 382750}, {'name': '铅直落下', 'text': '消灭目标具飞行异能的生物。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「风该是天空唯一的主人。」\\n～金林德鲁伊笛贾拉', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382540&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'beca37a1-69f4-4e8d-819d-15c65d6d0c2e', 'multiverseId': 382540}, 'multiverseid': 382540}]", "[{'name': '夢の破れ目', 'text': '呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。それのコントローラーはカードを１枚引く。\\nカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「創造ってのは矛盾してるんだよ。反対側から生まれてくるんだから。」\\n――ミストメドウの魔女、オルカ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382675&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f1b84f4-b890-4fc4-ac75-01601556ca8b', 'multiverseId': 382675}, 'multiverseid': 382675}, {'name': '梦想破裂', 'text': '反击目标咒语。其操控者抓一张牌。\\n抓一张牌。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「创造本身就是个矛盾；它是从自己的对立面产生。」\\n～雾牧地巫师欧卡', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382465&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7bc993a4-4773-4b8f-8720-5127de9cf05c', 'multiverseId': 382465}, 'multiverseid': 382465}]", "[{'name': '大気の召使い', 'text': '飛行\\n{2}{U}：飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': '「風は力強いが、束の間の命だ。それは空から竜を追い落とし、その一方でどんなに狭い隙間も軽々と通り抜ける。」\\n――ジェスタス・ドレイヤ「元素と永遠と」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382630&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '13137eb9-7707-4c82-a974-1862b756b62a', 'multiverseId': 382630}, 'multiverseid': 382630}, {'name': '大气仆役', 'text': '飞行\\n{2}{U}：横置目标具飞行异能的生物。', 'type': '生物～元素', 'flavor': '「风强劲却无形。它能击落天空的龙，又能轻易钻过最小的裂缝。」\\n～杰特坠亚，《元素与永恒》', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382420&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd11fcac6-f7e1-4f2d-b202-1c2aed5dd20c', 'multiverseId': 382420}, 'multiverseid': 382420}]", "[{'name': '大量破壊', 'text': 'アーティファクト１つと、クリーチャー１体と、エンチャント１つと、土地１つを対象とし、それらを破壊する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '無秩序とはさまざまな形態で存在する――社会、個人、グルール……', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382670&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73b2255c-442b-4341-8821-b873fd57d392', 'multiverseId': 382670}, 'multiverseid': 382670}, {'name': '摧残', 'text': '消灭目标神器，目标生物，目标结界和目标地。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '无政府状态有很多种形式：社会，个人，古鲁...', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382460&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44d6a9c3-45c0-4150-9bbc-a096c4ad8999', 'multiverseId': 382460}, 'multiverseid': 382460}]", "[{'name': '天頂の鷹', 'text': '多重キッカー{1}{W}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{1}{W}を望む回数支払ってもよい。）\\n飛行\\n天頂の鷹は、これがキッカーされた１回につき＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 鳥', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382634&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92686ac2-4faf-4781-ae34-4da5d04f7d69', 'multiverseId': 382634}, 'multiverseid': 382634}, {'name': '峰顶翔鹰', 'text': '多重增幅{1}{W}（你施放此咒语时可以任意次数地额外支付{1}{W}。）\\n飞行\\n峰顶翔鹰进战场时上面有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量为它增幅过的次数。', 'type': '生物～鸟', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382424&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c6eab3d-3f04-43e1-9de7-2ba2b58b6dca', 'multiverseId': 382424}, 'multiverseid': 382424}]", "[{'name': '奈落の統治', 'text': '各プレイヤーはそれぞれクリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。飛行を持つ黒のＸ/Ｘのデーモン・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。Ｘはこれにより生け贄に捧げられたクリーチャーのパワーの合計に等しい。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382763&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '371f5dfc-7ded-4a08-bcf9-a6de1276c803', 'multiverseId': 382763}, 'multiverseid': 382763}, {'name': '深渊统治', 'text': '每位牌手各牺牲一个生物。将一个X/X黑色，具飞行异能的恶魔衍生生物放进战场，X为以此法牺牲之生物的力量总和。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382553&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd098de85-b033-44da-aeb2-62c00c3ff017', 'multiverseId': 382553}, 'multiverseid': 382553}]", "[{'name': '好都合な宣言', 'text': '（この策略を統率領域に表向きに置いた状態でゲームを始める。）\\nあなたのデッキの最小サイズは５減少する。', 'type': '策略', 'flavor': '「慈善心に富む議会は、貴殿が情実に値する人物であることを認めたようだ。彼らは、この件が貴殿の仲間たちから妬みを買わないことを望んでいる。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382626&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b78c258f-189f-4785-89c4-3e1aa856e89d', 'multiverseId': 382626}, 'multiverseid': 382626}, {'name': '昭告先机', 'text': '（开始游戏时将此诡局牌面朝上地置于统帅区。）\\n你的套牌张数下限减少五张。', 'type': '诡局', 'flavor': '「议会念善，特准你占优越之势。冀此不至招致妒羡。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382416&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d94f699-b169-49c3-b9ea-9d96a1513bce', 'multiverseId': 382416}, 'multiverseid': 382416}]", "[{'name': '孔の歩哨', 'text': '防衛\\n{1}{R}, {T}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。孔の歩哨はそのプレイヤーに、あなたがコントロールする防衛を持つクリーチャーの総数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': '「ゼンディカーは大脅威に対して自らを要塞化し、空と海と石から成る衛兵を作り出した。」\\n――「戦争日誌」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382819&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b5f6e18-7ccc-4506-aacb-4c3c238ca80a', 'multiverseId': 382819}, 'multiverseid': 382819}, {'name': '孔穴哨兵', 'text': '守军\\n{1}{R}，{T}：孔穴哨兵对目标牌手造成伤害，其数量等同于由你操控且具守军异能的生物数量。', 'type': '生物～元素', 'flavor': '「赞迪卡因最大威胁而武装自己，利用天空、海洋与石头作成哨兵。」\\n～《战场札记》', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382609&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dca6708b-11e3-408e-852f-f4dbe96c30e1', 'multiverseId': 382609}, 'multiverseid': 382609}]", "[{'name': '宿命の旅人', 'text': '宿命の旅人が死亡したとき、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士', 'flavor': '彼は目的地に着くまで決して休まないことを誓った。 それがどれだけ正しいことなのかはわかっていない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382672&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '880ac40f-6617-4f4f-9c99-a3caebe3be68', 'multiverseId': 382672}, 'multiverseid': 382672}, {'name': '注亡旅人', 'text': '当注亡旅人死去时，将一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物放进战场。', 'type': '生物～人类／士兵', 'flavor': '他发誓在抵达旅程终点之前绝不停息。他不知道自己说得那么准。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382462&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee260383-f041-41c3-a703-42093dbc80d8', 'multiverseId': 382462}, 'multiverseid': 382462}]", "[{'name': '小悪疫', 'text': '各プレイヤーはそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、カードを１枚捨て、クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げ、土地を１つ生け贄に捧げる。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '幾ばくかを取り去れば、反逆が起こりえる。全てを取り去れば、抑圧も宿命として受け入れられる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382787&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ced6f79-ad9d-4e80-a080-22f6265a151d', 'multiverseId': 382787}, 'multiverseid': 382787}, {'name': '小片毒疹', 'text': '每位牌手失去1点生命，弃一张牌，牺牲一个生物，然后牺牲一个地。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '夺走一些东西，有可能激起反抗。夺走一切东西，受压迫者会认命。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382577&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '13c84236-ae62-4c9d-a3bf-e983cfe3fc0a', 'multiverseId': 382577}, 'multiverseid': 382577}]", "[{'name': '屈辱', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'ソリンの邪魔をする者の多くは、「何千年も生きた吸血鬼にとって邪魔」という突発的かつ致命的な症例に見舞われる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382733&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee83ec70-3485-4ddc-bc36-80f7403def66', 'multiverseId': 382733}, 'multiverseid': 382733}, {'name': '羞愧', 'text': '消灭目标生物或结界。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '许多让索霖碍事的人，很快就有了遇上千年吸血鬼注定的结局。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382523&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '073a5550-da70-4350-8cb0-b77560d4be8d', 'multiverseId': 382523}, 'multiverseid': 382523}]", "[{'name': '屍術の渇き', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382737&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa24caee-fd80-4108-bf87-d96aaee8c3db', 'multiverseId': 382737}, 'multiverseid': 382737}, {'name': '死灵式渴求', 'text': '结附于生物\\n每当所结附的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，你可以将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382527&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25f69ddc-e6b9-4847-b497-c05fdd1f7805', 'multiverseId': 382527}, 'multiverseid': 382527}]", "[{'name': '帰還した探検者、セルヴァラ', 'text': '協議 ― {T}：各プレイヤーはそれぞれ自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。これにより公開された土地でないカード１枚につき、あなたのマナ・プールに{G}を加えるとともにあなたは１点のライフを得る。その後、各プレイヤーはそれぞれカードを１枚引く。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・スカウト', 'flavor': '「高層都市の気まぐれによって苦しめられることを下層地は認めない。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382777&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e50504bf-c9b1-43f4-9d81-3d8e2541cd33', 'multiverseId': 382777}, 'multiverseid': 382777}, {'name': '复还探险家塞瓦拉', 'text': '论争～{T}：每位牌手各展示其牌库顶牌。每以此法展示出一张非地牌，便加{G}到你的法术力池中，且你获得1点生命。然后每位牌手各抓一张牌。', 'type': '传奇生物～妖精／斥候', 'flavor': '「下城受够了上城颐指气使之苦，渴望改换一新。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382567&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '519b947f-1d33-4505-bc24-b596a9370108', 'multiverseId': 382567}, 'multiverseid': 382567}]", "[{'name': '平和の徘徊者', 'text': '平和の徘徊者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは３点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': '「消え去りし者が彼方から我々の戦いを助けるために送ってきたものに違いありません。」\\n――シルヴォクのシャーマン、ケスラ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382741&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56ff9668-c63c-4224-bfd4-2984ba13e5fd', 'multiverseId': 382741}, 'multiverseid': 382741}, {'name': '和平神行客', 'text': '当和平神行客进战场时，你获得3点生命。', 'type': '神器生物～组构体', 'flavor': '「这必定是消失的一代从彼方送来，好助我们渡过此劫。」\\n～希沃克祭师凯丝拉', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382531&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '083f3d47-f34e-4f08-9a3a-568159f06f3f', 'multiverseId': 382531}, 'multiverseid': 382531}]", "[{'name': '幽体の照明灯', 'text': '{T}：プレイヤーを１人選ぶ。そのプレイヤーは自分のマナ・プールに好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '最初の灯りは、ギルドパクトに署名するために参じた使者にとって贈り物であり、協力の印である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382789&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a9ad7f9-f8fe-450e-9ede-52889e815416', 'multiverseId': 382789}, 'multiverseid': 382789}, {'name': '光谱探照灯', 'text': '{T}：选择一位牌手。该牌手加一点法术力到他的法术力池中，其颜色由他选择。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '第一批探照灯是赠送给前来签署十会盟的密使，象征着合作无间。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382579&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db4558fe-c00c-4ded-9585-49713865a4fa', 'multiverseId': 382579}, 'multiverseid': 382579}]", "[{'name': '強制の門', 'text': '議決 ― あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたから始めて各プレイヤーは「殺戮」または「忠誠」のいずれかに投票する。「殺戮」がより多くの票を得た場合、強制の門を生け贄に捧げ、すべての土地でないパーマネントを破壊する。「忠誠」がより多くの票を得た、あるいは票が同数だった場合、カードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382651&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0517b6c-cc6e-48da-9c43-69b041b69cf9', 'multiverseId': 382651}, 'multiverseid': 382651}, {'name': '胁迫通道', 'text': '议定～在你的维持开始时，由你开始，每位牌手各投票选择「杀戮」或「俸禄」。若杀戮票数较多，则牺牲胁迫通道并消灭所有非地永久物。若俸禄票数较多或两者同为最多，则抓一张牌。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382441&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b410ba7-319f-4ad9-858a-9be0d780a9c4', 'multiverseId': 382441}, 'multiverseid': 382441}]", "[{'name': '強迫的な研究', 'text': 'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードを３枚引く。その後、そのプレイヤーは土地カードを１枚捨てないかぎり、カードを２枚捨てる。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「溶けた青銅が四、ふむ……固形の水銀が一、ふむふむ……で、なんじゃと？」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382656&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df3948ca-5a9c-438c-9287-f2d19fc93ae4', 'multiverseId': 382656}, 'multiverseid': 382656}, {'name': '强制探寻', 'text': '目标牌手抓三张牌。然后除非该牌手从其手上弃掉一张地牌，否则他弃两张牌。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '「四份融解青铜，有了...一份冰冻水银，有了，有了...还需要什么？」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382446&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a8cbdecd-15bf-4bc2-98eb-cc7965d99f13', 'multiverseId': 382446}, 'multiverseid': 382446}]", "[{'name': '形勢一変', 'text': 'あなたの対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャーは、ターン終了時まで－２/－０の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「精神無き軍勢など来るに任せろ。天賦の力を見せてやる。」\\n――ニューロックの非正規兵、ヴァリル', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382808&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '622b181a-3b26-4e10-9c26-ae8cb4c7974e', 'multiverseId': 382808}, 'multiverseid': 382808}, {'name': '扭转局势', 'text': '由对手操控的生物得-2/-0直到回合结束。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「教他们没有心智的部队放马过来，尝尝智者的厉害。」\\n～纽若克游击队员帆利', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382598&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2396411-c765-4dc4-a3f4-f4e530c8b166', 'multiverseId': 382598}, 'multiverseid': 382598}]", "[{'name': '微光角の鹿', 'text': '警戒\\n微光角の鹿が戦場に出たとき、他のパーマネント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 大鹿', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382694&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e424e2c-2d43-4987-ad59-fd8f8d086603', 'multiverseId': 382694}, 'multiverseid': 382694}, {'name': '烁野麋鹿', 'text': '警戒\\n当烁野麋鹿进战场时，放逐另一个目标永久物。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将所放逐的牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。', 'type': '生物～麋鹿', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382484&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b9b0ad8-fe81-45b1-9607-fed53d1513bd', 'multiverseId': 382484}, 'multiverseid': 382484}]", "[{'name': '怒れる革命家', 'text': '廃位（このクリーチャーが最多あるいは最多と同点のライフを持つプレイヤーを攻撃するたび、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': 'すべての権利が投票によって奪われた後に残るのは、怒りだけである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382681&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f6ce98f0-1418-4db1-b6eb-1402eadbeade', 'multiverseId': 382681}, 'multiverseid': 382681}, {'name': '盛怒革命者', 'text': '义勇（每当此生物攻击生命最多或与他者同为最多的牌手时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）', 'type': '生物～人类／战士', 'flavor': '所有权利均被票选褫夺，唯存满腔怒火。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382471&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bcbdc37f-89b7-44a1-bd48-1c157f2c088c', 'multiverseId': 382471}, 'multiverseid': 382471}]", "[{'name': '急使の鷹', 'text': '飛行、警戒', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 鳥', 'flavor': 'オルゾフはラヴニカに点在する有料路や関所を回避するために、鷹を伝令に使い始めた。それはすぐに最も儲かる事業になった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382660&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed7ee46d-672d-4ac7-9aaa-66ddfe8bed50', 'multiverseId': 382660}, 'multiverseid': 382660}, {'name': '讯使翔鹰', 'text': '飞行，警戒', 'type': '生物～鸟', 'flavor': '欧佐夫开始用老鹰来当作信差，好避开散布拉尼卡全境的收费道路与桥梁。这项服务很快便成为该公会最赚钱的生意。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382450&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4660a1eb-349b-48a9-94d8-b21a8a795b40', 'multiverseId': 382450}, 'multiverseid': 382450}]", "[{'name': '悲劇的な過ち', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで－１/－１の修整を受ける。\\n陰鬱 ― このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していたなら、代わりにそれはターン終了時まで－13/－13の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '死の扉でぐずぐずしていることは、招き入れられる危険を冒すことだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382804&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ea318db-1c78-4206-9b31-e14f0ca25f70', 'multiverseId': 382804}, 'multiverseid': 382804}, {'name': '悲剧失足', 'text': '目标生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。\\n丧心～如果本回合有生物死去，则改为该生物得-13/-13直到回合结束。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '若徘徊于死亡门口，小心会给请进去。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382594&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '89a693f9-881c-46d4-8eb4-36c10c0d793e', 'multiverseId': 382594}, 'multiverseid': 382594}]", "[{'name': '感染性の恐怖', 'text': '感染性の恐怖が攻撃するたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ２点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ホラー', 'flavor': 'グリクシスの歴史の中で、誰かが老いて死んだことなど一度も無い。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382710&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05880c6f-92f9-4e4a-b090-2c0264c9bab0', 'multiverseId': 382710}, 'multiverseid': 382710}, {'name': '播疫惊惧兽', 'text': '每当播疫惊惧兽攻击时，每位对手各失去2点生命。', 'type': '生物～灵俑／惊惧兽', 'flavor': '有史以来，格利极从没人因衰老而过世。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382500&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20b011eb-ca7b-4db6-a4df-49c8d6ba59f1', 'multiverseId': 382500}, 'multiverseid': 382500}]", "[{'name': '戦いの熾天使、バサンドラ', 'text': '飛行\\nプレイヤーは戦闘中に呪文を唱えられない。\\n{R}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それは可能なら攻撃する。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': '「鞭が真実を語るときに、なぜ魔術師のつぶやきに耳を傾けねばならんのだ？」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382638&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f583ddfe-a0d0-49c3-bb9d-e546220d0b5f', 'multiverseId': 382638}, 'multiverseid': 382638}, {'name': '战斗炽天使芭珊卓', 'text': '飞行\\n牌手在战斗中不能施放咒语。\\n{R}：目标生物本回合若能攻击，则必须攻击。', 'type': '传奇生物～天使', 'flavor': '「既然鞭子能道出真相，又何必聆听法师的含糊话语？」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382428&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b921b4f-5c4c-4807-9cf2-a18088a98583', 'multiverseId': 382428}, 'multiverseid': 382428}]", "[{'name': '戦争売りの戦車', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが防衛を持っているかぎり、それは防衛を持たないかのように攻撃できる。\\n装備 {3}({3}：あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、これをつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': '攻撃は最大の防御。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382825&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71d5aa09-078b-4fdc-9a98-047fe68a4c9e', 'multiverseId': 382825}, 'multiverseid': 382825}, {'name': '战争贩子战车', 'text': '佩带此武具的生物得+2/+2。\\n只要佩带此武具的生物具有守军异能，它能视同不具守军异能地进行攻击。\\n佩带{3}（{3}：装备在目标由你操控的生物上。佩带的时机视同法术。）', 'type': '神器～武具', 'flavor': '最佳的防御就是有效的攻击。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382615&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ffefa4ad-7015-4b49-a3ae-db5c876d57e2', 'multiverseId': 382615}, 'multiverseid': 382615}]", "[{'name': '打開', 'text': 'カードを４枚引き、その後あなたの手札からカードをＸ枚選び、残りのカードを捨てる。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'アイデアがまるで押し寄せるように次々に浮かんできて、そのすべてを留めることはとてもできなかった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382645&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9eb6f522-502e-4247-b20f-f6ef475cf1f8', 'multiverseId': 382645}, 'multiverseid': 382645}, {'name': '重大突破', 'text': '抓四张牌，然后从你手上选择X张牌，并弃掉其他的牌。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '点子如暴雨卷来，根本无法全数记下。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382435&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '10c3de7a-219e-40c0-afce-dbefd85a398e', 'multiverseId': 382435}, 'multiverseid': 382435}]", "[{'name': '抑えきれない怒り', 'text': '瞬速（あなたはこの呪文を、あなたがインスタントを唱えられるときならいつでも唱えてよい。）\\nエンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受けるとともに、可能なら毎ターン攻撃する。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382812&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '59ca78f0-2606-442b-86e1-35f4c4cb5e0d', 'multiverseId': 382812}, 'multiverseid': 382812}, {'name': '脱缰怒火', 'text': '闪现（你可以于你能够施放瞬间的时机下施放此咒语。）\\n结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+2/+2且每回合若能攻击，则必须攻击。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382602&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e11bf9fe-3eac-4519-8d43-294542ff70a0', 'multiverseId': 382602}, 'multiverseid': 382602}]", "[{'name': '捕食者の雄叫び', 'text': '緑の２/２の狼・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\\n陰鬱 ― このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していたなら、代わりに緑の２/２の狼・クリーチャー・トークンを３体戦場に出す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「ムッツィオに言わせれば、私の主張には実効性が無いらしい。」\\n――下層地のレインジャー、セルヴァラ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382753&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c38102d0-71b1-44e7-83d6-6adc963c7c04', 'multiverseId': 382753}, 'multiverseid': 382753}, {'name': '掠食者嚎叫', 'text': '将一个2/2绿色的狼衍生生物放进战场。\\n丧心～如果本回合有生物死去，则改为将三个2/2绿色的狼衍生生物放进战场。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「穆奇奥竟说我的论据还不够尖锐。」\\n～下城护林者塞瓦拉', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382543&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '510b094a-3de8-4cac-8efc-1903c1ba2ae6', 'multiverseId': 382543}, 'multiverseid': 382543}]", "[{'name': '探検者の望遠鏡', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。それが土地カードである場合、あなたはそれをタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。\\n装備 {1}({1}：あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、これをつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382683&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a70749ae-7503-41dc-acaa-f31a0fea3a6a', 'multiverseId': 382683}, 'multiverseid': 382683}, {'name': '探险家望远镜', 'text': '每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，检视你的牌库顶牌。若该牌是地牌，你可以将它横置进战场。\\n佩带{1}（{1}：装备在由你操控的目标生物上。佩带的时机视同法术。）', 'type': '神器～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382473&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2329bfe1-e4c5-405b-9206-374af7df307c', 'multiverseId': 382473}, 'multiverseid': 382473}]", "[{'name': '旅人の外套', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n旅人の外套が戦場に出るに際し、土地タイプを１つ選ぶ。\\n旅人の外套が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーはその選ばれた土地タイプの土地渡りを持つ。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382805&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c35ddee1-a65a-4902-ab5a-d481703ccdfc', 'multiverseId': 382805}, 'multiverseid': 382805}, {'name': '旅人斗篷', 'text': '结附于生物\\n于旅人斗篷进战场时，选择一种地类别。\\n当旅人斗篷进战场时，抓一张牌。\\n所结附的生物具有该类别的地行者异能。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382595&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c8c181bc-afb0-4c59-84e1-6d25f57154ca', 'multiverseId': 382595}, 'multiverseid': 382595}]", "[{'name': '暗殺', 'text': 'タップ状態のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「これが戦争の勝ち方だ――軍隊の兵士じゃなく、ここぞという場所のナイフ一本でいいのさ。」\\n――凄腕の暗殺者、ユリン', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382635&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1cd8532-5d45-476e-90ec-952592bb79f0', 'multiverseId': 382635}, 'multiverseid': 382635}, {'name': '行刺', 'text': '消灭目标已横置的生物。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '「战争就是这样赢的～不需兵士千万，只消刀锋一舞。」\\n～皇家刺客尤霖', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382425&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7166ec91-20d8-446b-8d01-bca68454557c', 'multiverseId': 382425}, 'multiverseid': 382425}]", "[{'name': '暴君の選択', 'text': '議決 ― あなたから始めて各プレイヤーは「死」または「拷問」のいずれかに投票する。「死」がより多くの票を得た場合、各対戦相手はそれぞれクリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。「拷問」がより多くの票を得た、あるいは票が同数だった場合、各対戦相手はそれぞれ４点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382811&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eeb52ddb-11b7-4809-bf89-85b3f6a52bd3', 'multiverseId': 382811}, 'multiverseid': 382811}, {'name': '暴君抉择', 'text': '议定～由你开始，每位牌手各投票选择「死亡」或「折磨」。如果死亡票数较多，则每位对手各牺牲一个生物。如果折磨票数较多或两者同为最多，则每位对手各失去4点生命。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382601&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '280e5cdd-4716-4de2-a9a9-20766e67af25', 'multiverseId': 382601}, 'multiverseid': 382601}]", "[{'name': '暴走の先導', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーの一番上から５枚のカードを見る。あなたはその中から望む枚数のクリーチャー・カードを公開してもよい。そうしたなら、公開したカードをあなたの手札に加える。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382715&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd9f95d54-739d-40e5-aaf0-e52d041f91b7', 'multiverseId': 382715}, 'multiverseid': 382715}, {'name': '引领狂奔', 'text': '检视你牌库顶的五张牌。你可以展示其中任意数量的生物牌，并将所展示的牌置于你手上。将其余的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382505&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d5ff6a6-21fd-486c-8a15-d97d96a95aa5', 'multiverseId': 382505}, 'multiverseid': 382505}]", "[{'name': '松明の悪鬼', 'text': '{R}, 松明の悪鬼を生け贄に捧げる：アーティファクト１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デビル', 'flavor': '小悪魔はあらゆる部屋を火で飾りなおす。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382803&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aef3d5fe-9af4-4224-b26e-bee5f5ed03fb', 'multiverseId': 382803}, 'multiverseid': 382803}, {'name': '火炬邪鬼', 'text': '{R}，牺牲火炬邪鬼：消灭目标神器。', 'type': '生物～魔鬼', 'flavor': '魔鬼用火焰重新装饰每个房间。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382593&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '470947b1-36e7-431f-a32e-29ed7c4a60ba', 'multiverseId': 382593}, 'multiverseid': 382593}]", "[{'name': '板金鎧の海うろつき', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ビースト', 'flavor': 'ニューロックはもつれた電線を水銀海の海面のすぐ下に沈めた。海うろつきが一匹かかれば、軍隊一つの鎧と盾がまかなえるのだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382748&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd2e30d5-6766-481f-b13c-7cc0772d3234', 'multiverseId': 382748}, 'multiverseid': 382748}, {'name': '板甲海行客', 'type': '生物～野兽', 'flavor': '纽若克人在水银海底下埋藏纠结缆绳。捕获一个海行客，就能让整个部队不缺铠甲与盾牌。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382538&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e573be1-f7d3-45aa-8458-bce156f9087f', 'multiverseId': 382538}, 'multiverseid': 382538}]", "[{'name': '柱平原の雄牛', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 雄牛', 'flavor': '「その石頭の図体の上で腹を空かせた蚤が千代に栄えんことを、この雌牛め！」\\n――ゴーマ・ファーダの遊牧民、ブルース・タール', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382745&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4dcaec56-3ec3-438f-9ed7-aed8f23d894b', 'multiverseId': 382745}, 'multiverseid': 382745}, {'name': '柱坪牛', 'type': '生物～牛', 'flavor': '「愿饥饿的跳蚤在你难以梳理的皮毛中世代繁衍，臭牛！」\\n～哥马法达游牧人布斯陶', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382535&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2f52b315-3e91-4362-92f5-71268b67609e', 'multiverseId': 382535}, 'multiverseid': 382535}]", "[{'name': '桜族の長老', 'text': '桜族の長老を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地カードを１枚探し、それをタップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 蛇・シャーマン', 'flavor': '死んだ戦士は木の苗と共に埋められ、死して後に森の一部となるのだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382771&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4440eaeb-9260-41ef-b12e-b1b1aeabe1f4', 'multiverseId': 382771}, 'multiverseid': 382771}, {'name': '樱宗长老', 'text': '牺牲樱宗长老：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，并将之横置进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。', 'type': '生物～蛇／祭师', 'flavor': '殉身战士埋骨苗木之下，即使亡故后仍是树林一份子。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382561&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '24d2855b-3a28-4324-a8d7-90c0c3c24c7f', 'multiverseId': 382561}, 'multiverseid': 382561}]", "[{'name': '棘のショッカー', 'text': 'トランプル、速攻\\n棘のショッカーがプレイヤー１人にダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは手札のカードをすべて捨て、その後その枚数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 昆虫', 'flavor': '熱狂的なシャーマンは、未来の運命を垣間見ることを願い、望んでショッカーを受け入れる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382637&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c735b4e-a3cd-49be-a3c1-3b4e693147fa', 'multiverseId': 382637}, 'multiverseid': 382637}, {'name': '带刺电击虫', 'text': '践踏，敏捷\\n每当带刺电击虫对任一牌手造成伤害时，该牌手弃掉所有手牌，然后抓等量的牌。', 'type': '生物～昆虫', 'flavor': '一些热情祭师自愿让电击虫螫刺，希望能藉此瞥视未来运势。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382427&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1867236-e7da-4fa9-8c9f-4d640c192316', 'multiverseId': 382427}, 'multiverseid': 382427}]", "[{'name': '森の賢人', 'text': '{T}：クリーチャー・カード名を１つ指定する。あなたのライブラリーの一番上から４枚のカードを公開し、それらの中からその名前を持つすべてのカードをあなたの手札に加える。残りをあなたの墓地に置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382829&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0bbd500-6ac9-4b20-8d18-160db04e9b7b', 'multiverseId': 382829}, 'multiverseid': 382829}, {'name': '树木贤哲', 'text': '{T}：说出一个生物牌的名称。展示你牌库顶的四张牌，并将其中所有该名称的牌置于你手上。将其余的牌置入你的坟墓场。', 'type': '生物～人类／德鲁伊', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382619&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a476a8fe-c1b3-4f6a-baa2-53dea86684eb', 'multiverseId': 382619}, 'multiverseid': 382619}]", "[{'name': '森蔦のエレメンタル', 'text': 'トランプル\\n協議 ― 森蔦のエレメンタルが攻撃するたび、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。これにより公開された土地でないカード１枚につき、あなたがコントロールする攻撃クリーチャーはターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。その後、各プレイヤーはそれぞれカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382830&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e196fb9e-35c3-4003-804d-b5605e334db7', 'multiverseId': 382830}, 'multiverseid': 382830}, {'name': '木藤元素', 'text': '践踏\\n论争～每当木藤元素攻击时，每位牌手各展示其牌库顶牌。每以此法展示出一张非地牌，由你操控且进行攻击的生物便得+1/+1直到回合结束。然后每位牌手各抓一张牌。', 'type': '生物～元素', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382620&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '092cc987-fd52-4329-8d09-86af48202941', 'multiverseId': 382620}, 'multiverseid': 382620}]", "[{'name': '楽園の秘密', 'text': '秘策（この策略を統率領域に裏向きで置いた状態でゲームを始め、秘密裏にカード名を１つ指定する。あなたはいつでもこの策略を表向きにして、指定したカードの名前を公表してもよい。）\\nあなたがコントロールする指定した名前を持つクリーチャーは「{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。', 'type': '策略', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382776&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7071306-929b-4fae-9716-618706b47737', 'multiverseId': 382776}, 'multiverseid': 382776}, {'name': '天堂奥秘', 'text': '秘案（开始游戏时此诡局牌面朝下地置于统帅区，并私下决定一个牌名。你随时可以将此诡局翻回正面并公布该名称。）\\n由你操控且具有该名称的生物具有「{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。」', 'type': '诡局', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382566&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51bed856-9cc7-4720-aff2-07ed35ca27a0', 'multiverseId': 382566}, 'multiverseid': 382566}]", "[{'name': '権力への嘆願', 'text': '議決 ― あなたから始めて各プレイヤーは「時間」または「知識」のいずれかに投票する。「時間」がより多くの票を得た場合、あなたはこのターンの後に追加のターンを行う。「知識」がより多くの票を得た、あるいは票が同数だった場合、カードを３枚引く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382749&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5df1b0e-0d2d-40ea-9a40-2a50a09d39bb', 'multiverseId': 382749}, 'multiverseid': 382749}, {'name': '祈求权力', 'text': '议定～由你开始，每位牌手各投票选择「时间」或「知识」。如果时间票数较多，则在本回合后进行额外的一个回合。如果知识票数较多或两者同为最多，则抓三张牌。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382539&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '01053000-16cc-453d-93e9-19e41e2f4664', 'multiverseId': 382539}, 'multiverseid': 382539}]", "[{'name': '権力行使', 'text': '（この策略を統率領域に表向きに置いた状態でゲームを始める。）\\nあなたが開始プレイヤーとなる。開始プレイヤーとなりうるプレイヤーが複数いる場合、それらのプレイヤーの中から１人を無作為に選ぶ。', 'type': '策略', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382752&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd46aed29-cdaf-458b-b9c7-81a9ceb8f78a', 'multiverseId': 382752}, 'multiverseid': 382752}, {'name': '权力争斗', 'text': '（开始游戏时将此诡局牌面朝上地置于统帅区。）\\n你是先手牌手。如果有多位牌手将为先手牌手，则从中随机选择一位。', 'type': '诡局', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382542&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1424708e-e675-4740-8440-ff5ca3b75ef5', 'multiverseId': 382542}, 'multiverseid': 382542}]", "[{'name': '歩哨の出動', 'text': '（この策略を統率領域に表向きに置いた状態でゲームを始める。）\\nあなたの最初のアップキープの開始時に、防衛を持つ無色の１/１の構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。', 'type': '策略', 'flavor': '「こいつは珍しいな。盗みがいのある手強い警備だ。」\\n――ダク・フェイデン', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382780&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e53fb862-ce9a-4d6b-9e93-62bfc0762ece', 'multiverseId': 382780}, 'multiverseid': 382780}, {'name': '速遣哨兵', 'text': '（开始游戏时将此诡局牌面朝上地置于统帅区。）\\n在第一个维持开始时，将一个1/1无色，具守军异能的组构体衍生神器生物放进战场。', 'type': '诡局', 'flavor': '「真少见。就连守卫都值得一偷。」\\n～戴克费登', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382570&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4623b1cf-9f5b-442e-8d2f-d42f766bd1f9', 'multiverseId': 382570}, 'multiverseid': 382570}]", "[{'name': '歪んだ爪の変成者', 'text': '瞬速（あなたはこの呪文を、あなたがインスタントを唱えられるときならいつでも唱えてよい。）\\n飛行\\n歪んだ爪の変成者が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とし、ターン終了時まで、それのパワーとタフネスを入れ替える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 鳥・ウィザード', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382661&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd4bc2ae1-b2d0-48c0-b456-fdf4c22b58b7', 'multiverseId': 382661}, 'multiverseid': 382661}, {'name': '钩爪易质师', 'text': '闪现（你可以于你能够施放瞬间的时机下施放此咒语。）\\n飞行\\n当钩爪易质师进战场时，将目标生物之力量与防御力互换直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物～鸟／法术师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382451&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29cc3240-88a6-4165-8988-09dc43aa0d7c', 'multiverseId': 382451}, 'multiverseid': 382451}]", "[{'name': '歯止め', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時までプロテクション（あなたが選んだ色１色）を得る。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「完璧なる恩寵と神聖の時間が一瞬でもあれば、それで十分だ。」\\n――レオニンの長老、カル・リオール', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382796&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5ae0f2a-2e1d-4cd7-b07d-b24df20de593', 'multiverseId': 382796}, 'multiverseid': 382796}, {'name': '挡开', 'text': '选择一种颜色，目标生物获得反该色保护异能直到回合结束。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「只消片刻完美恩典与圣洁光辉便已足够。」\\n～狮族长老卡里奥', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382586&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf411537-1ed5-4d6d-a380-ab067dcf1d82', 'multiverseId': 382586}, 'multiverseid': 382586}]", "[{'name': '歯車式スパイ', 'text': '歯車式スパイをドラフトするに際し、これを公開する。あなたは次にこのブースターパックからドラフトされたカードを見てもよい。\\n飛行', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 鳥・構築物', 'flavor': 'パリアノの創造物は、隣人を陥れるための企みを練るための機会を多分に与えてくれる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382654&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '194d9c91-63d8-4ef7-bd87-a7298ec57ea0', 'multiverseId': 382654}, 'multiverseid': 382654}, {'name': '齿轮探子', 'text': '于你抽选齿轮探子时展示之。你可以检视下一张从本补充包中抽选的牌。\\n飞行', 'type': '神器生物～鸟／组构体', 'flavor': '帕兰诺造物能提供诸多良机，足以藉此设计搞垮邻人。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382444&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17565f84-ddec-4b33-ae07-a1c69004e770', 'multiverseId': 382444}, 'multiverseid': 382444}]", "[{'name': '歯車式司書', 'text': '歯車式司書を表向きの状態でドラフトする。\\nあなたがカードをドラフトするに際し、そのブースターパックからさらに１枚カードをドラフトしてもよい。そうしたなら、歯車式司書をそのブースターパックに入れる。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': 'なぜ、答えを待つのか？', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382653&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '356255b6-b208-4e67-a8e9-1ce5d4979f49', 'multiverseId': 382653}, 'multiverseid': 382653}, {'name': '齿轮图书管理员', 'text': '齿轮图书管理员以牌面朝上的方式进行轮抽。\\n于你抽选牌时，你可以从该补充包中额外抽选一张牌。如果你如此作，则将齿轮图书管理员置于该补充包中。', 'type': '神器生物～组构体', 'flavor': '为什么要空等答案？', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382443&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55e9cf3c-ddb9-491f-be15-8b589f1836ba', 'multiverseId': 382443}, 'multiverseid': 382443}]", "[{'name': '歯車式掘削者', 'text': '歯車式掘削者を表向きの状態でドラフトする。\\nあなたがカードをドラフトするに際し、それを裏向きの状態でドラフトから取り除いてもよい。（それらのカードはあなたのカードプールには含まれない。）\\n歯車式掘削者は、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘはあなたが「歯車式掘削者」という名前のカードによってドラフトから除外したカードの総数に等しい。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382652&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a545be7-d722-4f33-bdef-16f07bbae0a1', 'multiverseId': 382652}, 'multiverseid': 382652}, {'name': '齿轮碾磨兽', 'text': '齿轮碾磨兽以牌面朝上的方式进行轮抽。\\n于你抽选牌时，你可以将该牌面朝下地移出轮抽。（该些牌不属于你的牌池。）\\n齿轮碾磨兽进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物，X为你以名称为齿轮碾磨兽的牌移出轮抽之所有牌的数量。', 'type': '神器生物～组构体', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382442&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2796d0c3-1c01-4699-88ea-27c5f46f982a', 'multiverseId': 382442}, 'multiverseid': 382442}]", "[{'name': '歯車式足跡追い', 'text': '歯車式足跡追いをドラフトするに際し、これを公開し、これを渡したプレイヤーの名前を記録する。\\n歯車式足跡追いは可能なら毎ターン攻撃する。\\n歯車式足跡追いは、「歯車式足跡追い」という名前のカードによって記録したプレイヤーを可能なら毎ターン攻撃する。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 猟犬・構築物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382655&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8450603d-959a-4204-9f0e-5401676fec9b', 'multiverseId': 382655}, 'multiverseid': 382655}, {'name': '齿轮追猎犬', 'text': '于你抽选齿轮追猎犬时展示之，并记下将其传给你的牌手。\\n齿轮追猎犬每回合若能攻击，则必须攻击。\\n齿轮追猎犬每回合若能攻击你替名称为齿轮追猎犬之牌记下的各牌手之一，则必须攻击该牌手。', 'type': '神器生物～猎犬／组构体', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382445&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a140ad27-9e70-4ad3-8e5c-905984cf2ec7', 'multiverseId': 382445}, 'multiverseid': 382445}]", "[{'name': '死の収穫の儀式', 'text': '陰鬱 ― 各終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していた場合、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '「パリアノに足を踏み入れた者はすべて、別の者が権力を得るための策謀の捨て駒となるの。」\\n――黒薔薇のマルチェッサ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382668&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '605886b7-bd33-4296-bca5-c4a314fdc261', 'multiverseId': 382668}, 'multiverseid': 382668}, {'name': '掠亡仪式', 'text': '丧心～在每个结束步骤开始时，若本回合有生物死去，你可以抓一张牌。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '「帕兰诺城中的每一个人都是他者篡权大局中的一枚棋子。」\\n～黑蔷薇玛切莎', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382458&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '24771813-3e9a-42c9-896b-85297bc8d18f', 'multiverseId': 382458}, 'multiverseid': 382458}]", "[{'name': '死裂の剣', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが死亡するたび、あなたはあなたの手札にあるクリーチャー・カードを1枚戦場に出し、それに死裂の剣をつけてもよい。\\n装備 {2}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382669&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7d991de-de0c-4ce9-be83-327962b508a8', 'multiverseId': 382669}, 'multiverseid': 382669}, {'name': '归魂剑', 'text': '佩带此武具的生物得+2/+2。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物死去时，你可以将一张生物牌从你手上放进战场，并将归魂剑装备于其上。\\n佩带{2}', 'type': '神器～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382459&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b86a3f07-8b85-40d8-b118-4d01d68b7dc4', 'multiverseId': 382459}, 'multiverseid': 382459}]", "[{'name': '死鍛冶のシャーマン', 'text': '多重キッカー {R}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{R}を望む回数支払ってもよい。）\\n死鍛冶のシャーマンが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。死鍛冶のシャーマンはそのプレイヤーに、これがキッカーされた回数の２倍に等しい点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — オーガ・シャーマン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382667&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e4a4f25-c455-451f-91d0-ecabc3566f29', 'multiverseId': 382667}, 'multiverseid': 382667}, {'name': '锻亡祭师', 'text': '多重增幅{R}（你施放此咒语时可以任意次数地额外支付{R}。）\\n当锻亡祭师进战场时，它对目标牌手造成伤害，其数量等同于它已增幅次数的两倍。', 'type': '生物～食人魔／祭师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382457&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '59435be8-12ac-47dc-9765-7a0acbad3918', 'multiverseId': 382457}, 'multiverseid': 382457}]", "[{'name': '残響する勇気', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それと、そのクリーチャーと同じ名前を持つ他のすべてのクリーチャーはターン終了時まで＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '一粒の種子が、成長の突風を解き放つ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382676&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '958ec356-4022-4d64-89cd-b66ee0947179', 'multiverseId': 382676}, 'multiverseid': 382676}, {'name': '勇气回响', 'text': '目标生物及所有与其同名的其他生物得+2/+2直到回合结束。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '激起急速成长的一颗种子。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382466&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b68208b-9459-4030-9be7-c852f56618e4', 'multiverseId': 382466}, 'multiverseid': 382466}]", "[{'name': '気高き院僧', 'text': '警戒\\n平地サイクリング {2} （{2}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから平地カードを１枚探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加える。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック・兵士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382738&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0983e91-f15b-4cac-9a21-a86c7814026f', 'multiverseId': 382738}, 'multiverseid': 382738}, {'name': '尊贵圣殿骑士', 'text': '警戒\\n循环平原{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：从你的牌库中搜寻一张平原牌，展示该牌，并置于你手上。然后将你的牌库洗牌。）', 'type': '生物～人类／僧侣／士兵', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382528&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3c2ed546-9a00-4231-8915-f5274a51bd3b', 'multiverseId': 382528}, 'multiverseid': 382528}]", "[{'name': '水面の巻物守り', 'text': '防衛\\nあなたの手札の最大枚数は１増える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': '巻物守りは大書庫の入り口から一吋と動かなかった。大峨とその主の鬼が水面院を襲ったときですら。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382727&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '95b7bc23-767f-42ea-a747-a28035a60c0c', 'multiverseId': 382727}, 'multiverseid': 382727}, {'name': '水面院卷轴护卫', 'text': '守军\\n你的手牌上限增加一张。', 'type': '生物～人类／法术师', 'flavor': '卷轴护卫从不离开大书院门口半步，即使食人魔与其邪鬼主子横扫水面院时亦然。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382517&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eaf170f9-486e-415a-a6bb-818c45d42271', 'multiverseId': 382517}, 'multiverseid': 382517}]", "[{'name': '永遠王、ブレイゴ', 'text': '飛行\\n永遠王、ブレイゴがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたがコントロールする土地でないパーマネントを望む数だけ対象とし、それらを追放する。その後、それらのカードをそれぞれのオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — スピリット', 'flavor': '「我の統治は、死の後も続く。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382641&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78ac3706-4bc3-4a0e-8874-44d9448bfcf3', 'multiverseId': 382641}, 'multiverseid': 382641}, {'name': '不朽国王布莱戈', 'text': '飞行\\n当不朽国王布莱戈对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，放逐任意数量目标由你操控的非地永久物，然后将这些牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。', 'type': '传奇生物～精怪', 'flavor': '「吾乃永世国王，肉身纵逝，皇权长存。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382431&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46b68f82-9664-421f-9001-70ba1641acd5', 'multiverseId': 382431}, 'multiverseid': 382431}]", "[{'name': '沈黙の調停者', 'text': '各戦闘では、２体以上のクリーチャーでは攻撃できない。\\n各戦闘では、２体以上のクリーチャーではブロックできない。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': '学者によれば、あらゆる世界には、正義をなさしめる何者かの手で生み出された調停者がいるとのことだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382782&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e0c930e1-c354-46dc-a229-afbada177f0d', 'multiverseId': 382782}, 'multiverseid': 382782}, {'name': '沉静仲裁者', 'text': '每次战斗中，进行攻击的生物不能多于一个。\\n每次战斗中，进行阻挡的生物不能多于一个。', 'type': '神器生物～组构体', 'flavor': '学者认为不知名的势力创造了仲裁者，以在每个世界奉行正义之道。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382572&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'beb89427-1eb2-489a-9497-fcddddace290', 'multiverseId': 382572}, 'multiverseid': 382572}]", "[{'name': '泥地の吸血鬼', 'text': '多重キッカー {1}{B}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{1}{B}を望む回数支払ってもよい。）\\n沼渡り\\n泥地の吸血鬼は、これがキッカーされた１回につき＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ならず者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382757&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bf56df2c-54fa-413d-b501-e18fe1ca4e6b', 'multiverseId': 382757}, 'multiverseid': 382757}, {'name': '湿沼吸血鬼', 'text': '多重增幅{1}{B}（你施放此咒语时可以任意次数地额外支付{1}{B}。）\\n沼泽行者\\n湿沼吸血鬼进战场时上面有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量为它增幅过的次数。', 'type': '生物～吸血鬼／浪客', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382547&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0051d2ad-ee07-406c-99c6-5396402b7328', 'multiverseId': 382547}, 'multiverseid': 382547}]", "[{'name': '活力の覆い', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールする各クリーチャーをそれぞれ再生する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '自然魔道士の中には、ドミナリアにいまだ渦巻く時間のエネルギーを知らずに力とするものがいる。彼らが癒しの魔術と思っているものは、実際は時間を操作しているのだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382833&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '853cd067-a3e8-49ce-ad28-959f5343da40', 'multiverseId': 382833}, 'multiverseid': 382833}, {'name': '活力覆庇', 'text': '重生每个由你操控的生物。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '有些自然法师无意间受到多明纳里亚暂时盘桓的能量之眷顾。他们以为这是医疗法术，实际上却是操作时间的技巧。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382623&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe2f2e70-18df-4a09-96fa-6bab24189bed', 'multiverseId': 382623}, 'multiverseid': 382623}]", "[{'name': '流動石の刀身', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n{R}：エンチャントされているクリーチャーはターン終了時まで＋１/－１の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': '「黄金の洞窟に行き当たったエルフの寓話を忘れなさるな。一番大きな魂を取ろうとして、その重さに押しつぶされて死んでしまったという話をね。」\\n――カーン', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382691&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7235c28-3bf5-4d85-b714-0896fc5a17e8', 'multiverseId': 382691}, 'multiverseid': 382691}, {'name': '液石剑', 'text': '结附于生物\\n{R}：所结附的生物得+1/-1直到回合结束。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': '「记住那个妖精进山洞挖金块的寓言。她想带走最大的一块，结果却因为过重而摔死了。」\\n～卡恩', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382481&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd531d2bf-5d43-4bf6-be2b-1f87cc63f928', 'multiverseId': 382481}, 'multiverseid': 382481}]", "[{'name': '流砂', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。\\n{T}, 流砂を生け贄に捧げる：飛行を持たない攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで－１/－２の修整を受ける。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': 'すべての死に神話的な意味や偶像的栄光があるわけではない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382758&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a6f280e4-3dad-4944-affd-939529b31394', 'multiverseId': 382758}, 'multiverseid': 382758}, {'name': '流沙', 'text': '{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。\\n{T}，牺牲流沙：目标进行攻击、且不具飞行异能的生物得-1/-2直到回合结束。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '并非所有死亡都刻划着神秘意义与莫大光荣。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382548&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b419882-b89f-4fca-b780-f55b6ecadd4c', 'multiverseId': 382548}, 'multiverseid': 382548}]", "[{'name': '海辺のレインジャー', 'text': '飛行\\n島サイクリング {2} （{2}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから島カードを１枚探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加える。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 鳥・兵士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382781&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'baf491c1-1da1-4195-b597-65bf49d97a49', 'multiverseId': 382781}, 'multiverseid': 382781}, {'name': '沿岸巡逻人', 'text': '飞行\\n循环海岛{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：从你的牌库中搜寻一张海岛牌，展示该牌，并置于你手上。然后将你的牌库洗牌。）', 'type': '生物～鸟／士兵', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382571&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43e03dbf-ff85-453f-a6af-bf805aa90b72', 'multiverseId': 382571}, 'multiverseid': 382571}]", "[{'name': '清純な天使', 'text': '飛行\\n清純な天使がアンタップ状態であるかぎり、これはプロテクション（アーティファクト）とプロテクション（すべての色）を持つ。\\nあなたが呪文を１つ唱えるたび、あなたは清純な天使をアンタップしてもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382755&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48fbe415-6c3d-4fe8-85c3-093678e11016', 'multiverseId': 382755}, 'multiverseid': 382755}, {'name': '纯净天使', 'text': '飞行\\n只要纯净天使未横置，它便具有反神器保护与反五色保护。\\n每当你施放一个咒语时，你可以重置纯净天使。', 'type': '生物～天使', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382545&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ff42029-6701-4f78-b75b-9860650eb4a9', 'multiverseId': 382545}, 'multiverseid': 382545}]", "[{'name': '渦まく知識', 'text': 'カードを３枚引き、その後あなたの手札にあるカードを２枚、あなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'あるかなきかの光明を求め、彼女の精神はミジウム球配列によって思考場の深みへと誘われた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382644&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '499f7f78-e22a-4563-a37f-7cc0b3c5c200', 'multiverseId': 382644}, 'multiverseid': 382644}, {'name': '脑力激荡', 'text': '抓三张牌，然后从你手上将两张牌以任意顺序置于你的牌库顶。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '整排的米捷球助她的心灵深探思想领域，寻访其间智慧灵光。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382434&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '88c0c3f8-90d1-4826-9ffc-0a2c6ade0695', 'multiverseId': 382434}, 'multiverseid': 382434}]", "[{'name': '火の力', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは「{T}：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。このクリーチャーはそれに１点のダメージを与える。」を持つ。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': '燃えがらは、自分たちの炎が「鎮める者」と呼んでいるものに奪われたと信じている。今や、炎を使うすべての者は彼らの必死の怒りの的となっている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382751&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1725547e-070c-42d4-85ee-c297e931c9d9', 'multiverseId': 382751}, 'multiverseid': 382751}, {'name': '火焰之力', 'text': '结附于生物\\n所结附的生物具有「{T}：此生物对目标生物或牌手造成1点伤害。」', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': '烬身相信该族的火焰是给称作熄焰者的人所偷走。所有还挥舞着火光的人都会招致他们盲目的愤怒。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382541&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20dd3e2a-984f-4acf-8674-85547e605add', 'multiverseId': 382541}, 'multiverseid': 382541}]", "[{'name': '火山の流弾', 'text': '火山の流弾は打ち消されない。\\n火山の流弾は各クリーチャーと各プレイヤーに、それぞれ２点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「どうやれば空から逃げ切れるというのだ？」\\n――ナヤの太陽の種撒き、ヘイドラン', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382821&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '254714de-0c87-4348-b153-a1865660c05c', 'multiverseId': 382821}, 'multiverseid': 382821}, {'name': '火山落尘', 'text': '火山落尘不能被反击。\\n火山落尘对每个生物和每位牌手各造成2点伤害。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「我们怎么可能逃得过天空？」\\n～纳雅日种群亥真', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382611&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cbbaad73-cb83-4849-b65c-03fd526d3f26', 'multiverseId': 382611}, 'multiverseid': 382611}]", "[{'name': '火炎職人', 'text': '{1}, {T}：防衛を持つ無色の１/１の構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\\n{T}, 防衛を持つクリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。火炎職人はそれに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠', 'flavor': '共謀できない者は、創造する。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382689&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '137cc095-a9ca-4f33-9b3c-46776eb9d902', 'multiverseId': 382689}, 'multiverseid': 382689}, {'name': '炎铸匠', 'text': '{1}，{T}：将一个1/1无色，具守军异能的组构体衍生神器生物放进战场。\\n{T}，牺牲一个具守军异能的生物：炎铸匠对目标生物或牌手造成1点伤害。', 'type': '生物～人类／神器师', 'flavor': '欠权谋者多创力。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382479&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e2bba1f-8b65-4b25-ad1c-96db0f209575', 'multiverseId': 382479}, 'multiverseid': 382479}]", "[{'name': '炎の覆い', 'text': 'クリーチャーを最大３体まで対象とする。炎の覆いはそれらに、それぞれ１点のダメージを与える。このターン、それらではブロックできない。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「我々の紅蓮術士では奴らを殺せはしないが、必要なだけの時間は稼いでくれる。」\\n――「戦争日誌」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382832&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1fea57d8-1207-4f0a-b0bf-a6a690f7de86', 'multiverseId': 382832}, 'multiverseid': 382832}, {'name': '火焰包覆', 'text': '火焰包覆对至多三个目标生物各造成1点伤害。这些生物本回合不能进行阻挡。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '「我军烈焰术士的火焰也许不足以杀掉他们，但足以为我们争取时间。」\\n～《战场札记》', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382622&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e77d43a-2986-4291-a201-0e90dd26d07f', 'multiverseId': 382622}, 'multiverseid': 382622}]", "[{'name': '炎叫びの杖', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは二段攻撃を持つ。（それは先制攻撃と通常の戦闘ダメージの両方を与える。）\\n装備 {2} （{2}：あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、これをつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382688&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a3ab2453-d9da-4eb0-a1a3-71fc368754d3', 'multiverseId': 382688}, 'multiverseid': 382688}, {'name': '鸣火杖', 'text': '佩带此武具的生物具有连击异能。（它能造成先攻与普通战斗伤害。）\\n佩带{2}（{2}：装备在目标由你操控的生物上。佩带的时机视同法术。）', 'type': '神器～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382478&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0631ebb2-bc7f-4452-b050-6b593982c526', 'multiverseId': 382478}, 'multiverseid': 382478}]", "[{'name': '点火隊', 'text': '点火隊は、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘは戦場に出ているタップ状態の土地の総数に等しい。\\n{2}{R}, 点火隊の上から＋１/＋１カウンターを１個取り除く：土地１つを対象とする。それはターン終了時まで赤の４/４のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382707&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27c903f3-e1c7-40c2-a175-0b5b020da931', 'multiverseId': 382707}, 'multiverseid': 382707}, {'name': '纵火队', 'text': '纵火队进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物，X为战场上已横置之地的数量。\\n{2}{R}，从纵火队上移去一个+1/+1指示物：目标地成为4/4红色元素生物直到回合结束。它仍然是地。', 'type': '生物～鬼怪／战士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382497&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6112c058-afce-4976-8cd6-cb502f4f13c6', 'multiverseId': 382497}, 'multiverseid': 382497}]", "[{'name': '無形の美徳', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー・トークンは、＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに警戒を持つ。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '生きていた時は、彼らは農夫や領主や巾着切りや僧侶といった烏合の衆だ。死んでからは、彼らは真義に基づき一つになる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382711&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2200f126-f6f9-4de6-a363-63afb7f64b66', 'multiverseId': 382711}, 'multiverseid': 382711}, {'name': '无形美善', 'text': '由你操控的衍生生物得+1/+1且具有警戒异能。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '他们生时是各式各样的成员：农夫，地主，扒手，僧侣。他们死后则结合成单一的仁爱趋力。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382501&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7dcf8c1b-d82c-4249-8bee-42916c93e3d5', 'multiverseId': 382501}, 'multiverseid': 382501}]", "[{'name': '無情の碑出告', 'text': '{T}：無情の碑出告は各プレイヤーにそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーのライフの総量の端数を切り捨てた半分に等しい点数のダメージを与える。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — オーガ・シャーマン', 'flavor': '碑出告は12体もの鬼と血の誓いを結び続けていた。彼が触れれば岩は焼け焦げ、彼が物言えば都市は焼き尽くされた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382702&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '184054ea-fc69-457b-b974-05b3e7d988b5', 'multiverseId': 382702}, 'multiverseid': 382702}, {'name': '无情碑出告', 'text': '{T}：无情碑出告对每位牌手各造成伤害，其数量等同于该牌手总生命的一半，小数点后舍去。', 'type': '传奇生物～食人魔／祭师', 'flavor': '碑出告与许多邪鬼订立血誓。只消轻触，坚石为之焦烂；只须一言，城池就此焚毁。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382492&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7cee01dc-4f6a-4385-a1cd-852b47171380', 'multiverseId': 382492}, 'multiverseid': 382492}]", "[{'name': '無謀な悪意', 'text': '黒でないクリーチャー２体を対象とし、それらを破壊する。あなたは５点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「嘘も拷問。って言わなかったか？」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382761&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0fb1cee9-7ad5-44cc-b414-124f41ee1b42', 'multiverseId': 382761}, 'multiverseid': 382761}, {'name': '鲁莽恶行', 'text': '消灭两个目标非黑色的生物。你失去5点生命。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「为达目的，宁愿卑劣；或更等而下之。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382551&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9740e7e8-7390-4a3c-a8b2-25b4a32aeada', 'multiverseId': 382551}, 'multiverseid': 382551}]", "[{'name': '無謀な識者', 'text': '{T}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードを１枚引き、その後カードを１枚捨てる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': '「良い山師は、砂から金をふるい分けられなくちゃいかん。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382760&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '10ebe392-8d44-4ae9-984d-57d8e30c9cb0', 'multiverseId': 382760}, 'multiverseid': 382760}, {'name': '鲁莽学者', 'text': '{T}：目标牌手抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。', 'type': '生物～人类／法术师', 'flavor': '「再好的探矿人都得从砂中淘金。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382550&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3f5f9130-c4ec-46eb-95c9-c9292e12624d', 'multiverseId': 382550}, 'multiverseid': 382550}]", "[{'name': '燃えがらの壁', 'text': '防衛\\n燃えがらの壁がブロックしたとき、ターン終了時に、これを破壊する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 壁', 'flavor': '「焼けた肉の臭いが、何時間も谷に残ったさ。」\\n――オネイアンの軍曹', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382650&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f54b7d42-2aa7-425a-bc60-b441921969b7', 'multiverseId': 382650}, 'multiverseid': 382650}, {'name': '煤墙', 'text': '守军\\n当煤墙进行阻挡，在战斗结束时将其消灭。', 'type': '生物～墙', 'flavor': '「皮肉烤熟的味道在山谷间飘荡了好几个小时。」\\n～欧尼亚士官', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382440&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '59cd7582-6d6f-4dc6-a49e-82519c9223de', 'multiverseId': 382440}, 'multiverseid': 382440}]", "[{'name': '燃えたぎる炎の血族', 'text': '燃えたぎる炎の血族がエンチャントされているかぎり、これは＋２/＋２の修整を受けるとともにトランプルと「{R}：燃えたぎる炎の血族はターン終了時まで＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。」を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・戦士', 'flavor': '炎の血族はいつだって手ごわいが、そこに魔術による火が加わると、その強さは軍団を壊滅するまでになる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382690&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3bb36542-a585-4703-b8e3-f6a64b677642', 'multiverseId': 382690}, 'multiverseid': 382690}, {'name': '火光炎身', 'text': '只要火光炎身上面结附了灵气，它便得+2/+2，具有践踏异能，且具有「{R}：火光炎身得+1/+0直到回合结束。」', 'type': '生物～元素／战士', 'flavor': '炎身十分强悍，而若为其添加术法火焰，就更使其万夫莫敌。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382480&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ccc7a57-5dfc-4b7c-9cbd-3fa2e31c5ed9', 'multiverseId': 382480}, 'multiverseid': 382480}]", "[{'name': '燃え投げの小悪魔', 'text': '燃え投げの小悪魔が死亡したとき、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。燃え投げの小悪魔はそれに３点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デビル', 'flavor': 'ゴブリンの創意工夫、悪魔の堕落、羊の知性。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382746&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '42000c9b-808f-487b-a5f7-126ff92334e7', 'multiverseId': 382746}, 'multiverseid': 382746}, {'name': '燃沥青魔鬼', 'text': '当燃沥青魔鬼死去时，它对目标生物或牌手造成3点伤害。', 'type': '生物～魔鬼', 'flavor': '鬼怪的才智，恶魔的邪恶，以及羔羊的痛苦。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382536&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b6ecfa23-2794-4c0c-ad0d-0be623d03bbd', 'multiverseId': 382536}, 'multiverseid': 382536}]", "[{'name': '犠牲', 'text': 'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード２枚を対象とする。クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。そうしたなら、それらのカードをタップ状態で戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「死ぬがいい。お前の惨めな命でも、私に大いなる恵みを与えることを知りながらな。」\\n――死者の王、ザル・アシュール', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382820&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b474b86-7c75-4398-b66a-bfef71e2d0ac', 'multiverseId': 382820}, 'multiverseid': 382820}, {'name': '生体活祭', 'text': '选择两张目标在你坟墓场中的生物牌。牺牲一个生物。如果你如此作，则将所选择的牌横置移回战场。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '「去死吧。知道你这悲惨的一生能为我换回莫大回报，你也死得明白。」\\n～巫妖领主祝亚许', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382610&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '42639bee-1c8e-4214-8273-f1a4fc2397bc', 'multiverseId': 382610}, 'multiverseid': 382610}]", "[{'name': '狂気の祭壇', 'text': 'クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、自分のライブラリーの一番上から、生け贄に捧げられたクリーチャーのパワーに等しい枚数のカードを自分の墓地に置く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '「お前が狂気になるわけではない。狂気にしてくれと哀願するようになるのさ。」\\n――ヴォルラス', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382632&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd382e0d-c79f-41f7-b62b-a812e0925170', 'multiverseId': 382632}, 'multiverseid': 382632}, {'name': '痴呆祭坛', 'text': '牺牲一个生物：目标牌手将其牌库顶若干牌置入其坟墓场，其数量等同于所牺牲之生物的力量。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '「这不是说你将要疯狂，而是你会盼望发狂。」\\n～瓦拉司', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382422&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7200d78f-117d-40d0-945f-05d39ee2689a', 'multiverseId': 382422}, 'multiverseid': 382422}]", "[{'name': '狼茨の精霊', 'text': '多重キッカー {G}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{G}を望む回数支払ってもよい。）\\n狼茨の精霊が戦場に出たとき、これがキッカーされた１回につき、緑の２/２の狼・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382828&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '005f64e1-eaa5-41aa-87f2-212ea65b9655', 'multiverseId': 382828}, 'multiverseid': 382828}, {'name': '狼荆元素', 'text': '多重增幅{G}（你施放此咒语时可以任意次数地额外支付{G}。）\\n当狼荆元素进战场时，它每增幅过一次，便将一个2/2绿色的狼衍生生物放进战场。', 'type': '生物～元素', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382618&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '260c68a7-528b-4c5e-b85b-e9de5d76610b', 'multiverseId': 382618}, 'multiverseid': 382618}]", "[{'name': '猟場番', 'text': '猟場番が死亡したとき、あなたはこれを追放してもよい。そうしたなら、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から、クリーチャー・カードが公開されるまでカードを公開する。そのカードを戦場に出し、これにより公開された他のすべてのカードをあなたの墓地に置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382693&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4529ae24-7748-4aef-b854-a231c69da3a9', 'multiverseId': 382693}, 'multiverseid': 382693}, {'name': '猎场看守人', 'text': '当猎场看守人死去时，你可以将它放逐。若你如此做，则从你的牌库顶开始展示牌，直到你展示出一张生物牌为止。将该牌放进战场，并将以此法展示的其他牌置入你的坟墓场。', 'type': '生物～妖精', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382483&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b6fc054-887c-46b9-92a4-56d1cec7bce6', 'multiverseId': 382483}, 'multiverseid': 382483}]", "[{'name': '獲得の工作員', 'text': '獲得の工作員を表向きの状態でドラフトする。\\nブースターパックからカードをドラフトする代わりに、あなたはそのブースターパックのカードすべてを一度にドラフトしてもよい。そうしたなら、獲得の工作員を裏向きにし、このドラフト・ラウンドの残りの間カードをドラフトすることができない。（あなたに回されたブースター・パックを見ることはできる。）', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382629&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd3f6550d-d174-4076-8206-9c9c799e30d7', 'multiverseId': 382629}, 'multiverseid': 382629}, {'name': '征收密探', 'text': '征收密探以牌面朝上的方式进行轮抽。\\n你于抽选某包补充包中的牌时，可以改为一次一张地抽选该包补充包中的所有牌，而非只抽选其中一张牌。如果你如此作，则将征收密探翻为牌面朝下，且你在本轮抽圈次余下时段不能抽选牌。（你可以检视传给你的补充包。）', 'type': '神器生物～组构体', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382419&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0ebd552a-a2f2-4805-9662-3ca2f2151e2f', 'multiverseId': 382419}, 'multiverseid': 382419}]", "[{'name': '玉座の災い魔', 'text': '飛行\\n廃位（このクリーチャーが最多あるいは最多と同点のライフを持つプレイヤーを攻撃するたび、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。）\\n玉座の災い魔が各ターン最初に攻撃するたび、これが最多あるいは最多と同点のライフを持つプレイヤーを攻撃している場合、すべての攻撃クリーチャーをアンタップする。このフェイズの後に、追加の戦闘フェイズを加える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドラゴン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382773&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b6f374c-ce6f-4b24-9a7d-d7bd9cf66d93', 'multiverseId': 382773}, 'multiverseid': 382773}, {'name': '王座祸害', 'text': '飞行\\n义勇（每当此生物攻击生命最多或与他者同为最多的牌手时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\\n每当王座祸害进行每回合中第一次攻击时，若其攻击的是生命最多或与他者同为最多的牌手，则重置所有进行攻击的生物。在此阶段后，额外多出一个战斗阶段。', 'type': '生物～龙', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382563&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd77a152-cef3-4df0-8b08-c7dfecd5f747', 'multiverseId': 382563}, 'multiverseid': 382563}]", "[{'name': '甲鱗のワーム', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ワーム', 'flavor': 'このワームは非常に大きくなるため、鱗一枚で人間の住居の屋根が作れる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382772&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7901d2fd-6687-430e-8f53-30d51d11670d', 'multiverseId': 382772}, 'multiverseid': 382772}, {'name': '锐鳞亚龙', 'type': '生物～亚龙', 'flavor': '亚龙愈长愈大，光是一片鳞甲便可让人当成住家屋顶。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382562&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45fe1ca3-33a9-406b-96c2-e7243de6cf80', 'multiverseId': 382562}, 'multiverseid': 382562}]", "[{'name': '疑いなき権威', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n疑いなき権威が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーはプロテクション（クリーチャー）を持つ。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': 'ギデオンが第９地区を浄化した後、ボロス団に挑む暗黒街のボスはいなくなった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382815&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca7890a8-8210-4c26-b57a-5811a8fa2678', 'multiverseId': 382815}, 'multiverseid': 382815}, {'name': '至上权威', 'text': '结附于生物\\n当至上权威进战场时，抓一张牌。\\n所结附的生物具有反生物保护异能。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': '基定整肃第九区之后，再没有哪个帮派头目对波洛斯不敬。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382605&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c1c1603-7049-42a5-b96f-dcbc508a2b84', 'multiverseId': 382605}, 'multiverseid': 382605}]", "[{'name': '病に倒れたルサルカ', 'text': '{B}, クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで－１/－１の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット', 'flavor': '「彼女を見るがいい。かつては満ち溢れるほど無垢だった。死はこんなにも絞りつくしてしまうのだ……不足分をね。」\\n――サヴラ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382747&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2dc2eb78-9e39-4b68-ba47-9048a5d4cbe3', 'multiverseId': 382747}, 'multiverseid': 382747}, {'name': '病殁怨魂', 'text': '{B}，牺牲一个生物：目标生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物～精怪', 'flavor': '「瞧瞧她，曾是如此无邪。死亡最在行的，就是挤干这种...缺陷。」\\n～撒芙儿', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382537&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1de61a9-874a-405d-9ca8-fb0562f6e17e', 'multiverseId': 382537}, 'multiverseid': 382537}]", "[{'name': '真の武勇', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それは好きな数のクリーチャーをブロックできる。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '父の教えだ。「一撃に対して盾を上げることは訓練でできるが、その盾の隙間を埋めるのは勇気だ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382816&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f165330-4a47-43ec-b63a-80ceb0af6e07', 'multiverseId': 382816}, 'multiverseid': 382816}, {'name': '骁勇具现', 'text': '目标生物本回合能阻挡任意数量的生物。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「我父亲教过我，『训练让你举起盾牌防身，但勇气能填补盾牌的空隙。』」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382606&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '009c6da5-44fa-4bf2-9ab6-b89e26062bb7', 'multiverseId': 382606}, 'multiverseid': 382606}]", "[{'name': '真価の宗匠', 'text': '飛行\\n議決 ― 真価の宗匠が戦場に出たとき、あなたから始めて各プレイヤーは「恩寵」または「糾弾」のいずれかに投票する。「恩寵」がより多くの票を得た場合、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の墓地にある各クリーチャー・カードを戦場に戻す。「糾弾」がより多くの票を得た、あるいは票が同数だった場合、真価の宗匠以外のすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382720&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a73b3a93-dfc2-40ce-8ec3-c8b66abad4ba', 'multiverseId': 382720}, 'multiverseid': 382720}, {'name': '品格范师', 'text': '飞行\\n议定～当品格范师进战场时，由你开始，每位牌手各投票选择「恩典」或「定罪」。若恩典票数较多，则每位牌手各将其坟墓场中所有生物牌移回战场。若定罪票数较多或两者同为最多，则消灭品格范师以外的所有生物。', 'type': '生物～天使', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382510&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f71da0c0-7c5f-4cf9-bf72-c5c1554e549f', 'multiverseId': 382510}, 'multiverseid': 382510}]", "[{'name': '知識の探求者', 'text': '知識の探求者をドラフトするに際し、これを公開する。知識の探求者をドラフトした後に、ブースターパックを１つドラフトに加えてもよい。（あなたの次のピックはそのブースターからとなる。それを次のプレイヤーに渡し、それはこのドラフト・ラウンドにドラフトされる。）', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': '各巻には驚きが詰め込まれている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382718&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f54b1a58-2b1d-4840-95ee-541052179fe3', 'multiverseId': 382718}, 'multiverseid': 382718}, {'name': '觅识械', 'text': '于你抽选觅识械时展示之。你抽选觅识械之后，你可以将一包补充包加入轮抽。（你的下一次选牌将从该补充包中抽选。将其传给下一位牌手，该补充包会在本轮抽圈次中进行轮抽。）', 'type': '神器生物～组构体', 'flavor': '开卷有喜。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382508&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51b22ac3-5bf4-4e15-8d03-880f99962d0d', 'multiverseId': 382508}, 'multiverseid': 382508}]", "[{'name': '破滅的な行為', 'text': '{X}, 破滅的な行為を生け贄に捧げる：点数で見たマナ・コストがＸ以下の各アーティファクトと各エンチャントと各クリーチャーを破壊する。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '「さあヨーグモス」と、フレイアリーズは爆弾を仕掛けながらつぶやいた。「裏切りの報いを受けるときがきたわよ」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382743&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb84973f-945d-49a9-a9cd-2413a98eb32f', 'multiverseId': 382743}, 'multiverseid': 382743}, {'name': '毒契', 'text': '{X}，牺牲毒契：消灭所有总法术力费用等于或小于X的神器、生物和结界。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '「约格莫夫，」妃雅丽兹设定炸弹时轻轻地说：「现在你将为自己的背信忘义付出代价。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382533&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ac72930-ac90-4345-9e87-e9116067a697', 'multiverseId': 382533}, 'multiverseid': 382533}]", "[{'name': '硫黄の流弾', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。硫黄の流弾はそれに３点のダメージを与える。\\n陰鬱 ― このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していたなら、代わりに硫黄の流弾は５点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382646&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11719307-38df-4549-a1b6-dee0b24fe2ae', 'multiverseId': 382646}, 'multiverseid': 382646}, {'name': '硫磺射击', 'text': '硫磺射击对目标生物或牌手造成3点伤害。\\n丧心～如果本回合有生物死去，则改为硫磺射击对该目标生物或牌手造成5点伤害。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382436&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53c03d0c-e783-4f5d-8399-8364c7644d29', 'multiverseId': 382436}, 'multiverseid': 382436}]", "[{'name': '硫黄の渦', 'text': '各プレイヤーのアップキープの開始時に、硫黄の渦はそのプレイヤーに２点のダメージを与える。\\nプレイヤーがライフを得る場合、代わりにそのプレイヤーはライフを得ない。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382799&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ec14e661-c883-4641-8b5d-c4888fb68621', 'multiverseId': 382799}, 'multiverseid': 382799}, {'name': '硫磺旋风', 'text': '在每位牌手的维持开始时，硫磺旋风对该牌手造成2点伤害。\\n如果牌手将获得生命，则改为该牌手未获得生命。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382589&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e2661c1d-798d-42c6-8f4f-514a333f98de', 'multiverseId': 382589}, 'multiverseid': 382589}]", "[{'name': '祭壇の刈り取り', 'text': '祭壇の刈り取りを唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。\\nカードを２枚引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「大丈夫、お前の死からなるべく多く学べるようにするからな。」\\n――髑髏の占い師、ゴーガル', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382633&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '75f27cd6-751f-4926-b356-9ee50f5f5a4c', 'multiverseId': 382633}, 'multiverseid': 382633}, {'name': '祭坛夺命', 'text': '牺牲一个生物，以作为施放祭坛夺命的额外费用。\\n抓两张牌。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「别担心，我们会尽力从你的死亡取得大量情报。」\\n～颅骨卜算师苟古', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382423&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4d0755d-302b-4cc0-b22f-7f274f343b77', 'multiverseId': 382423}, 'multiverseid': 382423}]", "[{'name': '秘宝の破壊', 'text': 'アーティファクトかエンチャント１つと、他のアーティファクトかエンチャント最大１つまでを対象とし、それらを破壊する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '遺跡は数多くある。だが、かつてはもっと多かった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382765&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62786918-371b-4697-bee6-db945b133080', 'multiverseId': 382765}, 'multiverseid': 382765}, {'name': '破坏遗宝', 'text': '消灭目标神器或结界，以及至多另一个目标神器或结界。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '到处都有遗迹，但以前数量更多。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382555&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6375a844-5e1a-455d-a190-718354c649bf', 'multiverseId': 382555}, 'multiverseid': 382555}]", "[{'name': '秘密の召喚', 'text': '秘策（この策略を統率領域に裏向きで置いた状態でゲームを始め、秘密裏にカード名を１つ指定する。あなたはいつでもこの策略を表向きにして、指定したカードの名前を公表してもよい。）\\nあなたが指定した名前を持つクリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたのライブラリーからその名前を持つカードを望む枚数探してもよい。そうしたなら、それらを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': '策略', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382775&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1d2f0f5-ab0f-4f1f-b95b-a06cf856ddb3', 'multiverseId': 382775}, 'multiverseid': 382775}, {'name': '隐秘召唤', 'text': '秘案（开始游戏时此诡局牌面朝下地置于统帅区，并私下决定一个牌名。你随时可以将此诡局翻回正面并公布该名称。）\\n每当一个具有该名称的生物在你操控下进战场时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻任意数量具有该名称的牌，展示这些牌，将它们置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。', 'type': '诡局', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382565&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '75be607c-1ab7-4a7c-9a0c-3ae16c3832dd', 'multiverseId': 382565}, 'multiverseid': 382565}]", "[{'name': '空のスピリット', 'text': '飛行、先制攻撃', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット', 'flavor': '「音楽の調べのようなものよ。覚えるのは簡単だけど、捕まえることはできないのよ。」\\n――ウェザーライトの戦士、ミリー', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382786&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e8c71909-c17d-45da-92c1-44e07bb460dc', 'multiverseId': 382786}, 'multiverseid': 382786}, {'name': '天空精怪', 'text': '飞行，先攻', 'type': '生物～精怪', 'flavor': '「她就像缕缕乐音般，易留于人心却无法触及。」\\n～晴空号的米丽', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382576&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8fc4c6dd-89e8-4ddf-b188-83a9049cc028', 'multiverseId': 382576}, 'multiverseid': 382576}]", "[{'name': '突進するサイ', 'text': '突進するサイは、２体以上のクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — サイ', 'flavor': '「好きなものに向かって猛進するのは悪いことかね？そっと忍び寄るなんて、猫かゴブリンのやることだろうが。」\\n――ウェザーライトのターンガース', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382648&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f858d394-1fca-4f91-ba85-719dbc22ae67', 'multiverseId': 382648}, 'multiverseid': 382648}, {'name': '冲锋犀牛', 'text': '冲锋犀牛不能被一个以上的生物阻挡。', 'type': '生物～犀牛', 'flavor': '「要做就去做，有啥不对的？只有猫和鬼怪才会偷偷摸摸地。」\\n～晴空号的坦格尔斯', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382438&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61f42973-65be-48ec-aa0d-e0124f01d03d', 'multiverseId': 382438}, 'multiverseid': 382438}]", "[{'name': '総くずれ', 'text': 'あなたが総くずれを唱えるためにさらに{2}を支払うならば、あなたは総くずれを、あなたがインスタントを唱えられるときならいつでも唱えてよい。\\nすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。それらは再生できない。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「これで終わりだ。私が求めるのは、この程度のものではない。」\\n――大修道士、エリシュ・ノーン', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382769&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '94e5d993-1e29-4b4b-8c96-0a2daa665c8a', 'multiverseId': 382769}, 'multiverseid': 382769}, {'name': '溃不成军', 'text': '如果你施放溃不成军时多支付{2}，你便可以于你能够施放瞬间的时机下施放它。\\n消灭所有生物。它们不能重生。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '「到此为止。我的眼光远比这广大。」\\n～大修道士艾蕾侬', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382559&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7660152-b387-41a7-a8f3-29803d1de79b', 'multiverseId': 382559}, 'multiverseid': 382559}]", "[{'name': '群れの護衛', 'text': '防衛\\n群れの護衛がブロックするたび、あなたは３点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 猫・モンク', 'flavor': '「短気な幼子でも、怒りに剣を持ち上げることぐらいできるさ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382754&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c9a3f141-c35a-4a41-a78d-963a6bd02ce0', 'multiverseId': 382754}, 'multiverseid': 382754}, {'name': '狮群守护者', 'text': '守军\\n每当狮群守护者阻挡时，你获得3点生命。', 'type': '生物～猫／修行僧', 'flavor': '「每个热血冲昏头的小子都能仗愤使剑。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382544&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30cb0736-12a1-4800-90de-915ec0b73e16', 'multiverseId': 382544}, 'multiverseid': 382544}]", "[{'name': '義務の誓約', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、警戒を持ち、あなたやあなたがコントロールするプレインズウォーカーを攻撃できない。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': '「忠誠ってのは尊敬から来るものである方がいいね。魔法じゃなくて。ただ、やらなきゃいけないことをやる奴は必要なんだよね。」\\n――巨大なるカーリア', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382822&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf9882f3-54fe-47f6-a3ce-a99fa6a4f62a', 'multiverseId': 382822}, 'multiverseid': 382822}, {'name': '义务之誓约', 'text': '结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+2/+2，具有警戒异能，且不能攻击你或由你操控的鹏洛客。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': '「虽然我理想中的忠诚是尊敬他人的真心，而非受制魔法的假意，但有时只能不得已而为之。」\\n～穹境的卡莉雅', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382612&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '70b6628d-c7d6-4649-a58c-c3b2d37b45fd', 'multiverseId': 382612}, 'multiverseid': 382612}]", "[{'name': '背信のオーガ', 'text': '廃位（このクリーチャーが最多あるいは最多と同点のライフを持つプレイヤーを攻撃するたび、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。）\\nライフを３点支払う：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}を加える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — オーガ・シャーマン', 'flavor': '「何かを為すには、代償が必要だ。特に革命はな。」\\n――地下牢の管理人、グレンゾ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382806&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'caafc4e7-f14f-4547-b2e4-0ced98841f41', 'multiverseId': 382806}, 'multiverseid': 382806}, {'name': '背信食人魔', 'text': '义勇（每当此生物攻击生命最多或与他者同为最多的牌手时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\\n支付3点生命：加{R}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '生物～食人魔／祭师', 'flavor': '「万物皆有价，尤其是革命。」\\n～地牢典狱长格伦佐', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382596&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8d4718cf-1eed-4fdd-a4af-9e11bdf5e721', 'multiverseId': 382596}, 'multiverseid': 382596}]", "[{'name': '胞子頭の蜘蛛', 'text': '到達（このクリーチャーは飛行を持つクリーチャーをブロックできる。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 蜘蛛', 'flavor': '「ほとんど動かないけど、いいかい、そいつの巣につかまったら、永遠の時間をかけてあんたを捕まえにくるよ。」\\n――ジョラーガの狩人、サイダー', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382793&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7e9a8e56-2e9a-48f1-9cfd-19695badc141', 'multiverseId': 382793}, 'multiverseid': 382793}, {'name': '菇顶蜘蛛', 'text': '延势（此生物能阻挡具飞行异能的生物。）', 'type': '生物～蜘蛛', 'flavor': '「他们不太移动，但话说回来，如果你让网给缠住了，他可有得是时间到你身边去。」\\n～玖瑞加猎人赛妲', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382583&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '566d0f77-7926-4a8d-830e-5eda231c2c7b', 'multiverseId': 382583}, 'multiverseid': 382583}]", "[{'name': '自然の要求', 'text': 'アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは４点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「時間と疲れを知らぬ自然の咢が、いずれ我々をすべて飲み込むであろう。」\\n――オムゥの工匠、シルダーク', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382736&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b0470bf-1b09-4983-b19a-702444747459', 'multiverseId': 382736}, 'multiverseid': 382736}, {'name': '还诸自然', 'text': '消灭目标神器或结界。其操控者获得4点生命。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「大自然永无止境的胃口总有一天会将我们全数吞噬。」\\n～欧穆城神器师西尔达', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382526&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8864cb34-4286-452b-8875-84d7d9558e08', 'multiverseId': 382526}, 'multiverseid': 382526}]", "[{'name': '自然発火', 'text': '自然発火を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。\\n自然発火は各クリーチャーにそれぞれ３点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「熱い戦い」っていうのは、普通は比喩でそう言うんだがね。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382792&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '318caa50-bddf-4b77-a513-a4c61e736f9a', 'multiverseId': 382792}, 'multiverseid': 382792}, {'name': '生体自燃', 'text': '牺牲一个生物，以作为施放生体自燃的额外费用。\\n生体自燃对每个生物各造成3点伤害。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「如火如荼」通常是种隐喻。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382582&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '850e216a-30cb-44b7-b081-29df1ac013cf', 'multiverseId': 382582}, 'multiverseid': 382582}]", "[{'name': '要塞の規律', 'text': '各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分がコントロールするクリーチャー１体につき１点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'アーボーグでは、新たな反乱の扇動者は、最後には血の海に沈むことになっている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382798&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ecffe5d8-9afe-43d4-b0cf-742d3e24308a', 'multiverseId': 382798}, 'multiverseid': 382798}, {'name': '城塞纪律', 'text': '每位牌手各失去若干生命，其数量等同于他所操控的生物数量。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '在乌尔博格，每场叛乱的煽动者身上都沾满前次叛乱者的鲜血。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382588&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0da4b38a-a0a0-4362-86cb-e50bfae8fe76', 'multiverseId': 382588}, 'multiverseid': 382588}]", "[{'name': '覚醒石のガーゴイル', 'text': '防衛、飛行\\n{1}{W}：このターン、あなたがコントロールする防衛を持つクリーチャーは、防衛を持たないかのように攻撃してよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ガーゴイル', 'flavor': '脈打つ叫び声は、鉄や御影石や隷属の束縛を吹き飛ばす。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382824&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8d405d5c-7b6e-4945-9c7e-347b4232d76b', 'multiverseId': 382824}, 'multiverseid': 382824}, {'name': '醒岩石像鬼', 'text': '守军，飞行\\n{1}{W}：本回合中，由你操控且具守军异能的生物能视同不具守军异能地进行攻击。', 'type': '生物～石像鬼', 'flavor': '其尖鸣脉动能松动钢铁、花岗岩与束缚。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382614&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48b167b8-1e25-4361-b134-342e1bd4c70e', 'multiverseId': 382614}, 'multiverseid': 382614}]", "[{'name': '覚醒舞い', 'text': '陰鬱 ― 覚醒舞いが戦場に出たとき、このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していた場合、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン', 'flavor': 'それは古えの屍術の形式で、わずかなスカーブ師やグール呼びのみしか為しえない入神の巫術と儀式に踏み込んでいる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382823&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd29cf64e-8202-455c-aa58-a3a86519e61e', 'multiverseId': 382823}, 'multiverseid': 382823}, {'name': '醒夜舞者', 'text': '丧心～当醒夜舞者进战场时，若本回合有生物死去，将一个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物放进战场。', 'type': '生物～人类／祭师', 'flavor': '她运用死灵术的古老形式，其间的祭师出神与仪式超出多数尸嵌家或尸鬼牧者的理解能力。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382613&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f93750a8-e898-412a-9624-614bdf416573', 'multiverseId': 382613}, 'multiverseid': 382613}]", "[{'name': '触れられざる者フェイジ', 'text': '触れられざる者フェイジが戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれをあなたの手札から唱えていなかった場合、あなたはこのゲームに敗北する。\\n触れられざる者フェイジがいずれかのクリーチャーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのクリーチャーを破壊する。それは再生できない。\\n触れられざる者フェイジがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーはこのゲームに敗北する。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — アバター・ミニオン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382744&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '037e21d8-8c36-4ade-8116-204919ef8a78', 'multiverseId': 382744}, 'multiverseid': 382744}, {'name': '不可近的菲姬', 'text': '当不可近的菲姬进战场时，若你并非从你手上施放之，你输掉这盘游戏。\\n每当菲姬对任一生物造成战斗伤害时，消灭该生物。它不能重生。\\n每当菲姬对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手输掉这盘游戏。', 'type': '传奇生物～圣者／奴仆', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382534&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c8245c2-4e73-4b32-8933-2daecd90a937', 'multiverseId': 382534}, 'multiverseid': 382534}]", "[{'name': '誘発', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをアンタップする。このターン、それは可能ならブロックする。\\nカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「始末のつけられない喧嘩は売らないことだ。」\\n――議会の守衛、パドリル', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382756&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1625e8c-a877-4480-b8a9-58c40f99bc50', 'multiverseId': 382756}, 'multiverseid': 382756}, {'name': '激起', 'text': '重置目标不由你操控的生物。该生物本回合若能进行阻挡，则必须阻挡。\\n抓一张牌。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '「千万别挑起你打不完的仗。」\\n～议会守护者帕迪尔', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382546&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '09b0c8b8-b514-456a-b3ad-cf38f7384025', 'multiverseId': 382546}, 'multiverseid': 382546}]", "[{'name': '誤った指図', 'text': 'あなたは、誤った指図のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、あなたの手札にある青のカードを１枚、追放してもよい。\\n単一の対象を持つ呪文１つを対象とし、それの対象を変更する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382730&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee26141d-f49c-4d33-84af-55ecb164c7d1', 'multiverseId': 382730}, 'multiverseid': 382730}, {'name': '方向错误', 'text': '你可以从你手上放逐一张蓝色牌，而不支付方向错误的法术力费用。\\n为仅指定单一目标的目标咒语更改目标。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382520&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5320904-aa51-4213-b595-4e1d6b7a982a', 'multiverseId': 382520}, 'multiverseid': 382520}]", "[{'name': '議会の守衛', 'text': '議決 ― 議会の守衛が戦場に出たとき、あなたから始めて各プレイヤーは青、黒、赤、緑のいずれかに投票する。議会の守衛は最多あるいは最多と同数の票を獲得した各色に対するプロテクションを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 巨人・兵士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382658&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '072ab517-06cd-44da-bf8f-e2a81628519e', 'multiverseId': 382658}, 'multiverseid': 382658}, {'name': '议会守护者', 'text': '议定～当议会守护者进战场时，由你开始，每位牌手各投票选择「蓝色」、「黑色」、「红色」或「绿色」。议会守护者获得票数最多或与他者同为最多的所有颜色之反色保护异能。', 'type': '生物～巨人／士兵', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382448&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1f7c24b9-2241-483d-aa97-27808621c21a', 'multiverseId': 382448}, 'multiverseid': 382448}]", "[{'name': '議会の採決', 'text': '議決 ― あなたから始めて各プレイヤーは、あなたがコントロールしていない土地でないパーマネント１つに投票する。最多あるいは最多と同数の票を獲得した各パーマネントを追放する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'その権限が脅かされたとき、議会は統一された見解をもって声明を出す。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382659&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2fe33f4b-fafc-4560-abfc-1f207995d805', 'multiverseId': 382659}, 'multiverseid': 382659}, {'name': '众议裁定', 'text': '议定～由你开始，每位牌手各投票选择一个不由你操控的非地永久物。放逐票数最多或与他者同为最多的所有永久物。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '当议会威权受到挑战时，其间众口会以同声回敬。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382449&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82f967e4-9478-4978-8d58-3d4128375b88', 'multiverseId': 382449}, 'multiverseid': 382449}]", "[{'name': '護衛のゼンディコン', 'text': 'エンチャント（土地）\\nエンチャントされている土地は防衛を持つ白の２/６の壁・クリーチャーである。それは土地でもある。\\nエンチャントされている土地が死亡したとき、そのカードをオーナーの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382701&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd2380919-d27c-432d-8e2c-616fa9424462', 'multiverseId': 382701}, 'multiverseid': 382701}, {'name': '守卫赞迪肯', 'text': '结附于地\\n所结附的地是2/6白色，具守军异能的墙生物。它仍然是地。\\n当所结附的地死去时，将该牌移回其拥有者手上。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382491&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dadf0800-c38d-4ca3-b176-3c95d0799e2d', 'multiverseId': 382491}, 'multiverseid': 382491}]", "[{'name': '象の導き', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーが死亡したとき、緑の３/３の象・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': '自然の力は単なる力を超える。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382678&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45d6113a-a0fc-4814-a176-7ec9206febd4', 'multiverseId': 382678}, 'multiverseid': 382678}, {'name': '象灵引领', 'text': '结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+3/+3。\\n当所结附的生物死去时，将一个3/3绿色的象衍生生物放进战场。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': '大自然的力量比强者活得更久。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382468&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cd7314ed-e239-4280-a99b-cd1ba7bba24b', 'multiverseId': 382468}, 'multiverseid': 382468}]", "[{'name': '走り回るトカゲ', 'text': '多重キッカー {1}{R}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{1}{R}を望む回数支払ってもよい。）\\n速攻\\n走り回るトカゲは、これがキッカーされた１回につき＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — トカゲ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382785&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5cd2d908-fbe0-4a9d-9dca-1aeebd9203a4', 'multiverseId': 382785}, 'multiverseid': 382785}, {'name': '掠行蜥蜴', 'text': '多重增幅{1}{R}（你施放此咒语时可以任意次数地额外支付{1}{R}。）\\n敏捷\\n掠行蜥蜴进战场时上面有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量为它增幅过的次数。', 'type': '生物～蜥蜴', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382575&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11c5b8ee-c3c5-4218-9dd2-f7f271bd8227', 'multiverseId': 382575}, 'multiverseid': 382575}]", "[{'name': '踏査', 'text': 'あなたの各ターンに、あなたは追加の土地を１つプレイしてもよい。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '「未知への旅の中でのみ、我々は不可能を見つけることができるのだ。」\\n――放浪者シルール', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382682&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04b9e497-5a86-4f44-a375-ab482f4a47c4', 'multiverseId': 382682}, 'multiverseid': 382682}, {'name': '探险', 'text': '你在自己的每个回合中可以额外使用一个地。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '「我们只有进入未知之境，才能发现不可能之事。」\\n～云游法师希禄', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382472&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c3ce2356-68c3-47b0-8568-b8c9eb2db6d1', 'multiverseId': 382472}, 'multiverseid': 382472}]", "[{'name': '運河浚渫機', 'text': '運河浚渫機を表向きの状態でドラフトする。\\n各プレイヤーは各ブースターパックの最後のカードを、「運河浚渫機」という名前のカードをドラフトしたプレイヤーに渡す。\\n{T}：あなたの墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382647&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a6ab137-9069-4390-b146-3692805daa6f', 'multiverseId': 382647}, 'multiverseid': 382647}, {'name': '运河疏浚械', 'text': '运河疏浚械以牌面朝上的方式进行轮抽。\\n每位牌手将每包补充包中的最后一张牌传给抽选了名称为运河疏浚械之牌的任一牌手。\\n{T}：将目标牌从你坟墓场置于你的牌库底。', 'type': '神器生物～组构体', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382437&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7fb8b969-eb95-4229-8a87-5b000151e08f', 'multiverseId': 382437}, 'multiverseid': 382437}]", "[{'name': '遠吠えする狼', 'text': '遠吠えする狼が戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたのライブラリーから「遠吠えする狼」という名前のカードを最大３枚まで探してもよい。その後、それらを公開してあなたの手札に加える。そうしたなら、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 狼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382704&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c34e33de-96c7-4c15-9def-604f3f8ab5b9', 'multiverseId': 382704}, 'multiverseid': 382704}, {'name': '嚎叫野狼', 'text': '当嚎叫野狼进战场时，你可以从你牌库中搜寻至多三张名称为嚎叫野狼的牌，展示这些牌，并将它们置于你手上。若你如此作，则将你的牌库洗牌。', 'type': '生物～狼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382494&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '106fea51-6ff5-4eb4-9136-03da34d96ed2', 'multiverseId': 382494}, 'multiverseid': 382494}]", "[{'name': '遺恨の番人', 'text': 'プレイヤーが投票を完了するたび、あなたと異なる選択に投票した各プレイヤーは２点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ウィザード', 'flavor': '「お前の反逆は記録した。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382700&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd824ddcf-0070-4260-81d5-90b7a13d596e', 'multiverseId': 382700}, 'multiverseid': 382700}, {'name': '铭怨师', 'text': '每当所有牌手完成投票时，每位投票选择了你未投票之选项的对手各失去2点生命。', 'type': '生物～灵俑／法术师', 'flavor': '「你的反抗已记录在案。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382490&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53ece166-9cdb-4e05-8cd4-5cfa35f63eda', 'multiverseId': 382490}, 'multiverseid': 382490}]", "[{'name': '銀筋毛の狐', 'text': '{1}{W}, 銀筋毛の狐を生け贄に捧げる：エンチャント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 狐', 'flavor': '「狩りでは気をつけるんだよ。賢くてちっこい動物がお前さんの結界を盗んで、お前を狼男の巣まで引っぱってったりするからね。」\\n――ガツタフの産婆、ブリッタ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382783&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c71080a9-e0c4-487d-a697-34767c4780a1', 'multiverseId': 382783}, 'multiverseid': 382783}, {'name': '银奔狐', 'text': '{1}{W}，牺牲银奔狐：放逐目标结界。', 'type': '生物～狐', 'flavor': '「请小心行猎。聪明的小野物会偷走你的守护，将你引入狼人的巢穴。」\\n～卡兹特产婆布黎塔', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382573&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44eb6fdb-d5ec-4b2e-b7ea-a8a9e7fc1a37', 'multiverseId': 382573}, 'multiverseid': 382573}]", "[{'name': '銅角笛の斥候', 'text': '銅角笛の斥候が攻撃するたび、あなたがコントロールする他の各クリーチャーをそれぞれアンタップする。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・スカウト', 'flavor': 'ヴィリジアンの復活者たちの主張によれば、ファングレンの蹴爪の音の方が大きいかもしれないが、ヴォラックの角の方がより正確で、より感動的な音を奏でるそうだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382657&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bee9da9d-659f-43d6-a616-9edf8cb09592', 'multiverseId': 382657}, 'multiverseid': 382657}, {'name': '铜号斥候', 'text': '每当铜号斥候攻击时，重置由你操控的所有其他生物。', 'type': '生物～妖精／斥候', 'flavor': '方壬刺制品的声音也许比较响亮，但中兴暗碧族宣称博锐兽角制品所发出的音符更加真实而激励人心。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382447&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '74fb4942-ebac-4af9-b983-80fa26f8ccfb', 'multiverseId': 382447}, 'multiverseid': 382447}]", "[{'name': '鏡の大魔術師', 'text': '{T}, 鏡の大魔術師を生け贄に捧げる：対戦相手１人を対象とし、そのプレイヤーとライフの総量を交換する。この能力は、あなたのアップキープの間にのみ起動できる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': '「しかと見よ！その敵の姿を、その持つすべてを。己の妬みに身を任せ、それを奪うのだ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382721&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e2461ab-52ed-4b77-a3bf-a9e5b233685f', 'multiverseId': 382721}, 'multiverseid': 382721}, {'name': '崇镜贤者', 'text': '{T}，牺牲崇镜贤者：与目标对手交换总生命。你只可以于你的维持中起动此异能。', 'type': '生物～人类／法术师', 'flavor': '「看好了！这是敌人的样子，以及她拥有的东西。依妒忌行事，全部接收下来吧。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382511&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '788dbbe4-4dfd-4336-9c66-c98fca0ffa24', 'multiverseId': 382511}, 'multiverseid': 382511}]", "[{'name': '闇からの摘出', 'text': '各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分のライブラリーの一番上から２枚のカードを自分の墓地に置く。その後、いずれかの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚をあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '上で混乱を引き起こしたいのなら、時には下を見ることも必要である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382684&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20710748-a576-4309-ac80-0c8ae2a15f0c', 'multiverseId': 382684}, 'multiverseid': 382684}, {'name': '黯域掘力', 'text': '每位牌手各将其牌库顶的两张牌置入其坟墓场。然后你将任一坟墓场中的一张生物牌在你的操控下放进战场。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '如果想在上面搞破坏，有时最好先低头看一看。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382474&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ec90ba2-179b-4326-95c3-036a48b40142', 'multiverseId': 382474}, 'multiverseid': 382474}]", "[{'name': '隠れ潜む自動機械', 'text': '隠れ潜む自動機械をドラフトするに際し、これを公開し、隠れ潜む自動機械を含めてこのドラフト・ラウンドにドラフトしたカードの枚数を記録する。\\n隠れ潜む自動機械は、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘは「隠れ潜む自動機械」という名前のカードによって記録した数のうち最大の数に等しい。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382719&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cd88d8e0-a7bf-44ba-93a4-846fdc4f2645', 'multiverseId': 382719}, 'multiverseid': 382719}, {'name': '伏击机械兽', 'text': '于你抽选伏击机械兽时展示之，并记下本轮抽圈次中包括伏击机械兽在内你已抽选的牌数。\\n伏击机械兽进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物，X为你替名称为伏击机械兽之牌记下的各数字间之最大值。', 'type': '神器生物～组构体', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382509&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba030765-6880-47e2-8536-6c0750363a51', 'multiverseId': 382509}, 'multiverseid': 382509}]", "[{'name': '集魂者', 'text': '飛行\\n飛行を持つクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、集魂者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 鳥・兵士', 'flavor': '「彼らの精霊は風と共に歩み、我が魂を満たす。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382788&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0d1d17a9-47dd-4e98-9324-dac8aa0a5acc', 'multiverseId': 382788}, 'multiverseid': 382788}, {'name': '捕灵手', 'text': '飞行\\n每当一个具飞行异能的生物死去时，在捕灵手上放置一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物～鸟／士兵', 'flavor': '「他们的灵魂伴风随行，充盈我心。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382578&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '26c1e3c3-4877-4d54-af40-7392dcc4400c', 'multiverseId': 382578}, 'multiverseid': 382578}]", "[{'name': '雑食のハイドラ', 'text': '雑食のハイドラが対戦相手１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、雑食のハイドラはその点数に等しい点数のダメージを、他の各対戦相手にそれぞれ与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ハイドラ', 'flavor': '「我々はハイドラから学ぶべきなのだ。それは何も特別扱いせぬ。すべてを等しく飲み込むのだ。」\\n――上座ドルイド、サラス', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382706&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '15574f6f-22d2-4205-a81f-2434b391eed1', 'multiverseId': 382706}, 'multiverseid': 382706}, {'name': '杂食多头龙', 'text': '每当杂食多头龙向任一对手造成战斗伤害时，它向每位其他对手各造成等量的伤害。', 'type': '生物～多头龙', 'flavor': '「我们应该学习多头龙。它从不挑食，平等地吞噬一切。」\\n～德鲁伊长者思拉兹', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382496&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e4e82e0f-7b32-4afa-a64e-a8e837f73aa2', 'multiverseId': 382496}, 'multiverseid': 382496}]", "[{'name': '電位式巨大戦車', 'text': '電位式巨大戦車は可能なら毎ターン攻撃する。\\n電位式巨大戦車はあなたのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\\n他のクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、電位式巨大戦車をアンタップする。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 巨大戦車', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382692&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dfc21207-295e-4bd1-920c-59d80423eed2', 'multiverseId': 382692}, 'multiverseid': 382692}, {'name': '电流攻城巨车', 'text': '电流攻城巨车每回合若能攻击，则必须攻击。\\n电流攻城巨车于你的重置步骤中不能重置。\\n每当另一个生物死去时，重置电流攻城巨车。', 'type': '神器生物～攻城巨车', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382482&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5037bb66-e352-4df8-939f-280d6e74684d', 'multiverseId': 382482}, 'multiverseid': 382482}]", "[{'name': '霊気探知機', 'text': '霊気探知機をドラフトするに際し、これを公開する。あなたが次にドラフトしたカードを公開し、その名前を記録する。\\n霊気探知機が戦場に出たとき、あなたの手札およびライブラリーから、「霊気探知機」という名前のカードをドラフトした際に記録した名前を持つカードを１枚探してもよい。あなたはそれをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。あなたがこれによりあなたのライブラリーからカードを探した場合、それを切り直す。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382627&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c58b2a14-6725-459c-bf4b-621b2a017724', 'multiverseId': 382627}, 'multiverseid': 382627}, {'name': '乙太探寻客', 'text': '于你抽选乙太探寻客时展示之。展示你抽选的下一张牌并记下其名称。\\n当乙太探寻客进战场时，你可以从你手上和／或牌库中搜寻一张牌，其名称须为你于抽选名称为乙太探寻客之牌时记下的各名称之一。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。如果你以此法搜寻了你的牌库，则将它洗牌。', 'type': '神器生物～组构体', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382417&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d916a8a-60d8-4d77-8da1-83e0937f4322', 'multiverseId': 382417}, 'multiverseid': 382417}]", "[{'name': '霊都の灯籠', 'text': '{3}：いずれかの墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とし、それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番下に置く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '霊都の鉱山の石から彫られた灯籠は、失われた魂の道を照らすとのことだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382764&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc884b9b-7dec-45ad-995c-819c30108d30', 'multiverseId': 382764}, 'multiverseid': 382764}, {'name': '灵都宫灯', 'text': '{3}：将目标牌从任一坟墓场置于其拥有者的牌库底。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '据说以灵都矿脉出产之神秘石材刻成的宫灯，能够指引游魂明路。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382554&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '98615051-1424-43ab-be49-7406f86db1cf', 'multiverseId': 382554}, 'multiverseid': 382554}]", "[{'name': '順風', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールする飛行を持つクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '絶滅して久しいと思われたグリフの群れは、アヴァシンの帰還と共に再び姿を現した。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382686&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87b95e28-284e-447c-8971-6193f981ad65', 'multiverseId': 382686}, 'multiverseid': 382686}, {'name': '眷顾之风', 'text': '由你操控且具飞行异能的生物得+1/+1。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '原以为早已灭绝的骏鹭，随着艾维欣的回归成群重现。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382476&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6295ed57-563f-4ded-97d4-b6c4eb976604', 'multiverseId': 382476}, 'multiverseid': 382476}]", "[{'name': '領域の探求者', 'text': '領域の探求者は、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘはすべてのプレイヤーの手札にあるカードの総数に等しい。\\n{2}{G}, 領域の探求者の上から＋１/＋１カウンターを１個取り除く：あなたのライブラリーから土地カードを１枚探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・スカウト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382759&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '85ff1440-5a04-4c4e-a97f-ea7886bb868b', 'multiverseId': 382759}, 'multiverseid': 382759}, {'name': '觅境斥候', 'text': '觅境斥候进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物，X为所有牌手手牌的总数。\\n{2}{G}，从觅境斥候上移去一个+1/+1指示物：从你的牌库中搜寻一张地牌，展示该牌，并将它置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。', 'type': '生物～妖精／斥候', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382549&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd2f90fca-d54d-4426-b0f8-d16012c41205', 'multiverseId': 382549}, 'multiverseid': 382549}]", "[{'name': '風の踊り手', 'text': '飛行\\n{T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで飛行を得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — フェアリー', 'flavor': '「私の手を取って、風の音楽と共に踊りましょう。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382827&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0ff88379-e9e5-49fc-92dc-e2f73ebc266e', 'multiverseId': 382827}, 'multiverseid': 382827}, {'name': '风舞者', 'text': '飞行\\n{T}：目标生物获得飞行异能直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物～仙灵', 'flavor': '「牵上我的手，踏着风鸣节拍一同起舞。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382617&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '26717d73-b639-483e-96d6-972025db34d3', 'multiverseId': 382617}, 'multiverseid': 382617}]", "[{'name': '飛び回る玻璃凧', 'text': '飛行\\n飛び回る玻璃凧がいずれかのターンに初めて呪文や能力の対象になるたび、その呪文や能力を打ち消す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット', 'flavor': '稲妻が閃き、すさまじい音が響き渡った。その時玻璃は砕け散ったが、生き物は無傷だった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382713&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e87623a0-8b22-4998-a15f-b9a4dbf056c9', 'multiverseId': 382713}, 'multiverseid': 382713}, {'name': '高飞玻璃鸢', 'text': '飞行\\n每当高飞玻璃鸢在一回合中首度成为咒语或异能的目标时，反击该咒语或异能。', 'type': '生物～精怪', 'flavor': '箭势如电，随后是一阵似玻璃碎裂的巨响，但那飞物却完好如初。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382503&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9bb51ca2-f282-4e79-a957-dd3bc887b497', 'multiverseId': 382503}, 'multiverseid': 382503}]", "[{'name': '飛び地の精鋭', 'text': '多重キッカー {1}{U}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{1}{U}を望む回数支払ってもよい。）\\n島渡り\\n飛び地の精鋭は、これがキッカーされた１回につき＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — マーフォーク･兵士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382680&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '785ee08d-31cf-48da-86c1-d638137886fd', 'multiverseId': 382680}, 'multiverseid': 382680}, {'name': '围境精兵', 'text': '多重增幅{1}{U}（你施放此咒语时可以任意次数地额外支付{1}{U}。）\\n海岛行者\\n围境精兵进战场时上面有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量为它增幅过的次数。', 'type': '生物～人鱼／士兵', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382470&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4bf81c0a-4bdf-4880-bc3c-fc473843e608', 'multiverseId': 382470}, 'multiverseid': 382470}]", "[{'name': '高層都市パリアノ', 'text': '高層都市パリアノをドラフトするに際し、これを公開する。あなたの右隣のプレイヤーは色を１色選び、あなたは別の色を１色選び、その後あなたの左隣のプレイヤーがさらに別の色を１色選ぶ。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、「高層都市パリアノ」という名前のカードをドラフトした際に選ばれた色のうちの１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': '伝説の土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382740&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6bbf1e7f-d33f-4010-b7c9-47650f357bb1', 'multiverseId': 382740}, 'multiverseid': 382740}, {'name': '上城帕兰诺', 'text': '于你抽选上城帕兰诺时展示之。你右手边的牌手选择一种颜色，你选择另一种颜色，然后你左手边的牌手再选择另外一种颜色。\\n{T}：加一点法术力到你的法术力池中，其颜色为于你抽选名称为上城帕兰诺之牌时被选中的各颜色之一。', 'type': '传奇地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382530&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd069bf52-2024-47c3-bb6e-1993335adb85', 'multiverseId': 382530}, 'multiverseid': 382530}]", "[{'name': '魂の目覚め', 'text': '協議 ― 各プレイヤーはそれぞれ自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。これにより公開された土地でないカード１枚につき、あなたは飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。その後、各プレイヤーはそれぞれカードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「我らは覚えている。我らは立ち上がる。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382768&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '777364d0-c993-435b-9003-e2558f03a1cc', 'multiverseId': 382768}, 'multiverseid': 382768}, {'name': '扰醒灵魂', 'text': '论争～每位牌手各展示其牌库顶牌。每以此法展示出一张非地牌，你便将一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物放进战场。然后每位牌手各抓一张牌。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '「我们铭记。我们起身。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382558&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4616e06b-f1d4-43de-95cf-f04ef5e2b9a7', 'multiverseId': 382558}, 'multiverseid': 382558}]", "[{'name': '魂売り', 'text': '魂売りがクリーチャー１体にダメージを与えるたび、魂売りの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\n{B}：魂売りを再生する。\\n{G}：魂売りは、ターン終了時まであなたが選んだ１色の色になる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ビースト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382790&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e88b843-d461-4004-9752-14cc066c6877', 'multiverseId': 382790}, 'multiverseid': 382790}, {'name': '心灵贩子', 'text': '每当心灵贩子对任一生物造成伤害时，在心灵贩子上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n{B}：重生心灵贩子。\\n{G}：选择一种颜色，心灵贩子成为该色直到回合结束。', 'type': '生物～野兽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382580&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f001e4a-0e34-4409-bac3-763e90991c52', 'multiverseId': 382580}, 'multiverseid': 382580}]", "[{'name': '鳴き叫ぶウミタカ', 'text': '飛行\\n鳴き叫ぶウミタカが戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたのライブラリーから「鳴き叫ぶウミタカ」という名前のカードを１枚探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。そうしたなら、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 鳥', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382774&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '57752f8a-410b-4bbb-a039-b749fd95f529', 'multiverseId': 382774}, 'multiverseid': 382774}, {'name': '尖鸣海鹰', 'text': '飞行\\n当尖鸣海鹰进战场时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张名称为尖鸣海鹰的牌，展示该牌，并将它置于你手上。若你如此作，则将你的牌库洗牌。', 'type': '生物～鸟', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382564&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a43494b-0a8f-4b5b-8a8a-7cb8c97e8e11', 'multiverseId': 382564}, 'multiverseid': 382564}]", "[{'name': '黎明をもたらす者レイヤ', 'text': '飛行\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれを戦場に戻してもよい。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': '「私の許し無く死すことはありません。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382767&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b0d1406-58b4-439f-85fe-972e895e58c3', 'multiverseId': 382767}, 'multiverseid': 382767}, {'name': '黎明使者蕾亚', 'text': '飞行\\n在你的维持开始时，你可以将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。', 'type': '传奇生物～天使', 'flavor': '「在我答应之前，你还没死。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382557&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '19bd331b-a590-451b-af94-1521e128b981', 'multiverseId': 382557}, 'multiverseid': 382557}]", "[{'name': '黒焦げ牙のクーガー', 'text': '{R}：黒焦げ牙のクーガーはターン終了時まで＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n山サイクリング {2} （{2}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから山カードを１枚探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加える。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 猫・ビースト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382649&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c595074a-f2c4-486a-bf18-fb85e4eed288', 'multiverseId': 382649}, 'multiverseid': 382649}, {'name': '乌牙山狮', 'text': '{R}：乌牙山狮得+1/+0直到回合结束。\\n循环山脉{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：从你的牌库中搜寻一张山脉牌，展示该牌，并置于你手上。然后将你的牌库洗牌。）', 'type': '生物～猫／野兽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382439&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2c6fb8a-728e-4f3e-9273-4d198c2e4e19', 'multiverseId': 382439}, 'multiverseid': 382439}]", "[{'name': '黒薔薇のマルチェッサ', 'text': '廃位（このクリーチャーが最多あるいは最多と同点のライフを持つプレイヤーを攻撃するたび、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。）\\nあなたがコントロールする他のクリーチャーは廃位を持つ。\\nあなたがコントロールする＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれたクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのカードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382723&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '464d3786-491d-4b57-95bf-7285569ae5d7', 'multiverseId': 382723}, 'multiverseid': 382723}, {'name': '黑蔷薇玛切莎', 'text': '义勇（每当此生物攻击生命最多或与他者同为最多的牌手时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\\n由你操控的其他生物具有义勇异能。\\n每当一个由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物死去，在下一个结束步骤开始时将该牌在你的操控下移回战场。', 'type': '传奇生物～人类／法术师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382513&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82197f75-c82c-4c49-8a28-a20fd50bfc41', 'multiverseId': 382513}, 'multiverseid': 382513}]", "[{'name': '黒薔薇の一片', 'text': '議決 ― あなたから始めて各プレイヤーは「身体疾患」または「精神疾患」のいずれかに投票する。「身体疾患」がより多くの票を得た場合、あなたの対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャーは、ターン終了時まで－２/－２の修整を受ける。「精神疾患」がより多くの票を得た、あるいは票が同数だった場合、各対戦相手はそれぞれカードを２枚捨てる。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382639&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '69b3f273-5198-46cd-9eea-f65890449766', 'multiverseId': 382639}, 'multiverseid': 382639}, {'name': '黑蔷薇之刺', 'text': '议定～由你开始，每位牌手各投票选择「染疾」或「癫狂」。如果染疾票数较多，则由对手操控的生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。如果癫狂票数较多或两者同为最多，则每位对手各弃两张牌。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382429&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb9c4abb-6097-4f2f-8dd8-985965305e23', 'multiverseId': 382429}, 'multiverseid': 382429}]"]
printings: ['10E', '2ED', '2X2', '2XM', '30A', '3ED', '40K', '4BB', '4ED', '5DN', '5ED', '6ED', '7ED', '8ED', '9ED', 'A25', 'AFC', 'AFR', 'ANB', 'APC', 'ARC', 'ATH', 'AVR', 'BBD', 'BFZ', 'BOK', 'BRB', 'BRC', 'BRR', 'BTD', 'C13', 'C14', 'C15', 'C16', 'C17', 'C18', 'C19', 'C20', 'C21', 'CED', 'CEI', 'CHK', 'CLB', 'CLU', 'CM1', 'CM2', 'CMA', 'CMD', 'CMM', 'CMR', 'CN2', 'CNS', 'CON', 'CST', 'DBL', 'DD2', 'DDC', 'DDD', 'DDF', 'DDG', 'DDH', 'DDI', 'DDJ', 'DDK', 'DDL', 'DDM', 'DDN', 'DDO', 'DDP', 'DDQ', 'DDR', 'DDS', 'DDT', 'DDU', 'DIS', 'DKA', 'DMC', 'DMR', 'DST', 'DVD', 'E01', 'E02', 'ELD', 'EMA', 'EVE', 'EXO', 'F01', 'F04', 'F05', 'F09', 'FBB', 'FRF', 'FUT', 'G06', 'G09', 'GK1', 'GK2', 'GN3', 'GNT', 'GPT', 'GVL', 'HA3', 'HA5', 'HBG', 'HOP', 'ICE', 'IKO', 'IMA', 'INV', 'ISD', 'J13', 'J19', 'J21', 'J22', 'JMP', 'JUD', 'JVC', 'KHC', 'KLD', 'KLR', 'KTK', 'LCC', 'LEA', 'LEB', 'LEG', 'LGN', 'LRW', 'LTC', 'M10', 'M11', 'M12', 'M13', 'M14', 'M15', 'M19', 'M20', 'M21', 'MBS', 'MD1', 'ME2', 'ME4', 'MED', 'MH1', 'MH2', 'MIC', 'MID', 'MKC', 'MM2', 'MM3', 'MMA', 'MMQ', 'MOC', 'MOR', 'MP2', 'MRD', 'NCC', 'NEC', 'NEM', 'ODY', 'OLEP', 'OLGC', 'ONC', 'ONS', 'ORI', 'OTC', 'OTP', 'P07', 'P10', 'P10E', 'P30A', 'PAL03', 'PC2', 'PCA', 'PCLB', 'PCMD', 'PCNS', 'PD3', 'PDCI', 'PGPX', 'PIP', 'PJAS', 'PJJT', 'PJSE', 'PLST', 'PM19', 'POR', 'PPRO', 'PRES', 'PRM', 'PRNA', 'PS11', 'PSAL', 'PSUS', 'PTC', 'PZ1', 'PZ2', 'RAV', 'RIX', 'RNA', 'ROE', 'RVR', 'SCD', 'SCG', 'SCH', 'SHM', 'SIS', 'SLD', 'SLP', 'SOI', 'SOK', 'SOM', 'SPG', 'SS1', 'STA', 'STH', 'SUM', 'TD0', 'TD2', 'THB', 'TMP', 'TOR', 'TPR', 'TSB', 'TSP', 'TSR', 'UDS', 'UMA', 'USG', 'V13', 'VIS', 'VMA', 'VOC', 'W16', 'WC00', 'WC01', 'WC02', 'WC03', 'WC04', 'WC97', 'WC98', 'WHO', 'WOC', 'WOT', 'WTH', 'WWK', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNC']
original_text: ['(Start the game with this conspiracy face up in the command zone.)\\nAs long as every card in your card pool started the game in your library or in the command zone, lands you control have "{T}: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool."', '(Start the game with this conspiracy face up in the command zone.)\\nAt the beginning of the first upkeep, put a 1/1 colorless Construct artifact creature token with defender onto the battlefield.', '(Start the game with this conspiracy face up in the command zone.)\\nDraw an additional hand of seven cards as the game begins. Before taking mulligans, shuffle all but one of your hands into your library.', '(Start the game with this conspiracy face up in the command zone.)\\nYou are the starting player. If multiple players would be the starting player, one of those players is chosen at random.', '(Start the game with this conspiracy face up in the command zone.)\\nYour minimum deck size is reduced by five.', '+1: Target player draws two cards, then discards two cards.\\n-2: Gain control of target artifact.\\n-6: You get an emblem with "Whenever you cast a spell that targets one or more permanents, gain control of those permanents."', 'Academy Elite enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it, where X is the number of instant and sorcery cards in all graveyards.\\n{2}{U}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Academy Elite: Draw a card, then discard a card.', 'Add {R} to your mana pool for each tapped land your opponents control.', 'All damage that would be dealt this turn to target creature you control by a source of your choice is dealt to another target creature instead.', "As an additional cost to cast Altar's Reap, sacrifice a creature.\\nDraw two cards.", 'As an additional cost to cast Skeletal Scrying, exile X cards from your graveyard.\\nYou draw X cards and you lose X life.', 'As an additional cost to cast Spontaneous Combustion, sacrifice a creature.\\nSpontaneous Combustion deals 3 damage to each creature.', 'As long as Flaring Flame-Kin is enchanted, it gets +2/+2, has trample, and has "{R}: Flaring Flame-Kin gets +1/+0 until end of turn."', "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, Sulfuric Vortex deals 2 damage to that player.\\nIf a player would gain life, that player gains no life instead.", 'Attacking creatures get +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Brimstone Volley deals 3 damage to target creature or player.\\nMorbid — Brimstone Volley deals 5 damage to that creature or player instead if a creature died this turn.', "Charging Rhino can't be blocked by more than one creature.", 'Choose two target creature cards in your graveyard. Sacrifice a creature. If you do, return the chosen cards to the battlefield tapped.', "Counter target activated or triggered ability. (Mana abilities can't be targeted.)", 'Counter target spell. Its controller draws a card.\\nDraw a card.', "Cowards can't block Warriors.\\n{R}: Target creature becomes a Coward until end of turn.\\n{2}{R}: Target creature becomes a Warrior until end of turn.", 'Creature tokens you control get +1/+1 and have vigilance.', 'Creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nWhenever you tap a land for mana, add one mana to your mana pool of any type that land produced.', 'Creatures you control have haste.\\nSacrifice Fires of Yavimaya: Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control with flying get +1/+1.', 'Creatures your opponents control get -2/-0 until end of turn.', 'Custodi Soulbinders enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it, where X is the number of other creatures on the battlefield.\\n{2}{W}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Custodi Soulbinders: Put a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying onto the battlefield.', 'Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', "Defender, flying\\n{1}{W}: Creatures you control with defender can attack this turn as though they didn't have defender.", 'Defender\\nWhen Cinder Wall blocks, destroy it at end of combat.', 'Defender\\nWhenever Pride Guardian blocks, you gain 3 life.', 'Defender\\nYour maximum hand size is increased by one.', 'Defender\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Vent Sentinel deals damage to target player equal to the number of creatures with defender you control.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment and up to one other target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment. Its controller gains 4 life.', 'Destroy target artifact, target creature, target enchantment, and target land.', 'Destroy target creature or enchantment.', 'Destroy target creature with flying.', 'Destroy target tapped creature.', 'Destroy two target nonblack creatures. You lose 5 life.', 'Dethrone (Whenever this creature attacks the player with the most life or tied for most life, put a +1/+1 counter on it.)', 'Dethrone (Whenever this creature attacks the player with the most life or tied for most life, put a +1/+1 counter on it.)\\nOther creatures you control have dethrone.\\nWhenever a creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it dies, return that card to the battlefield under your control at the beginning of the next end step.', 'Dethrone (Whenever this creature attacks the player with the most life or tied for most life, put a +1/+1 counter on it.)\\nPay 3 life: Add {R} to your mana pool.', "Dethrone (Whenever this creature attacks the player with the most life or tied for most life, put a +1/+1 counter on it.)\\nWhenever Marchesa's Infiltrator deals combat damage to a player, draw a card.", "Dethrone (Whenever this creature attacks the player with the most life or tied for most life, put a +1/+1 counter on it.)\\n{1}{U}{R}: Target creature you control gains haste until end of turn and can't be blocked this turn.", "Draft Agent of Acquisitions face up.\\nInstead of drafting a card from a booster pack, you may draft each card in that booster pack, one at a time. If you do, turn Agent of Acquisitions face down and you can't draft cards for the rest of this draft round. (You may look at booster packs passed to you.)", 'Draft Canal Dredger face up.\\nEach player passes the last card from each booster pack to a player who drafted a card named Canal Dredger.\\n{T}: Put target card from your graveyard on the bottom of your library.', "Draft Cogwork Grinder face up.\\nAs you draft a card, you may remove it from the draft face down. (Those cards aren't in your card pool.)\\nCogwork Grinder enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it, where X is the number of cards you removed from the draft with cards named Cogwork Grinder.", 'Draft Cogwork Librarian face up.\\nAs you draft a card, you may draft an additional card from that booster pack. If you do, put Cogwork Librarian into that booster pack.', 'Draft Deal Broker face up.\\nImmediately after the draft, you may reveal a card in your card pool. Each other player may offer you one card in his or her card pool in exchange. You may accept any one offer.\\n{T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.', 'Draft Whispergear Sneak face up.\\nDuring the draft, you may turn Whispergear Sneak face down. If you do, look at any unopened booster pack in the draft or any booster pack not being looked at by another player.', 'Drakestown Forgotten enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it, where X is the number of creature cards in all graveyards.\\n{2}{B}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Drakestown Forgotten: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Draw four cards, then choose X cards in your hand and discard the rest.', 'Draw three cards, then put two cards from your hand on top of your library in any order.', 'Each player loses 1 life for each creature he or she controls.', 'Each player loses 1 life, discards a card, sacrifices a creature, then sacrifices a land.', 'Each player puts the top two cards of his or her library into his or her graveyard. Then put a creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control.', 'Each player sacrifices a creature. Put an X/X black Demon creature token with flying onto the battlefield, where X is the total power of the creatures sacrificed this way.', "Enchant creature\\nAs Traveler's Cloak enters the battlefield, choose a land type.\\nWhen Traveler's Cloak enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\nEnchanted creature has landwalk of the chosen type.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.\\n{3}{U}: Attach Stasis Cell to target creature.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2, has vigilance, and can't attack you or a planeswalker you control.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3.\\nWhen enchanted creature dies, put a 3/3 green Elephant creature token onto the battlefield.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has "{T}: This creature deals 1 damage to target creature or player."', 'Enchant creature\\nWhen Unquestioned Authority enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\nEnchanted creature has protection from creatures.', 'Enchant creature\\nWhen enchanted creature dies, return that card to the battlefield under your control.', 'Enchant creature\\nWhenever enchanted creature deals combat damage to a player, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Enchant creature\\n{R}: Enchanted creature gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Enchant land\\nEnchanted land has "{T}: Put a 1/1 green Squirrel creature token onto the battlefield."', "Enchant land\\nEnchanted land is a 2/6 white Wall creature with defender. It's still a land.\\nWhen enchanted land dies, return that card to its owner's hand.", "Equipped creature gets +2/+2.\\nAs long as equipped creature has defender, it can attack as though it didn't have defender.\\nEquip {3} ({3}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", 'Equipped creature gets +2/+2.\\nWhenever equipped creature dies, you may put a creature card from your hand onto the battlefield and attach Deathrender to it.\\nEquip {2}', 'Equipped creature has double strike. (It deals both first-strike and regular combat damage.)\\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Exile Ill-Gotten Gains. Each player discards his or her hand, then returns up to three cards from his or her graveyard to his or her hand.', 'Exile target creature. Its controller gains life equal to its power.', 'First strike\\nDethrone (Whenever this creature attacks the player with the most life or tied for most life, put a +1/+1 counter on it.)', 'First strike\\nSacrifice Vampire Hexmage: Remove all counters from target permanent.', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nEnchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and attacks each turn if able.', "Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nFlying\\nWhen Crookclaw Transmuter enters the battlefield, switch target creature's power and toughness until end of turn.", 'Flying, first strike', 'Flying, vigilance', 'Flying\\nAs long as Pristine Angel is untapped, it has protection from artifacts and from all colors.\\nWhenever you cast a spell, you may untap Pristine Angel.', 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', "Flying\\nDethrone (Whenever this creature attacks the player with the most life or tied for most life, put a +1/+1 counter on it.)\\nWhenever Scourge of the Throne attacks for the first time each turn, if it's attacking the player with the most life or tied for most life, untap all attacking creatures. After this phase, there is an additional combat phase.", 'Flying\\nIslandcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for an Island card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.)', "Flying\\nPlayers can't cast spells during combat.\\n{R}: Target creature attacks this turn if able.", "Flying\\nWhen Brago, King Eternal deals combat damage to a player, exile any number of target nonland permanents you control, then return those cards to the battlefield under their owner's control.", "Flying\\nWhen Liliana's Specter enters the battlefield, each opponent discards a card.", 'Flying\\nWhen Screaming Seahawk enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a card named Screaming Seahawk, reveal it, and put it into your hand. If you do, shuffle your library.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Jetting Glasskite becomes the target of a spell or ability for the first time in a turn, counter that spell or ability.', 'Flying\\nWhenever a creature with flying dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Soulcatcher.', 'Flying\\nWill of the council — When Custodi Squire enters the battlefield, starting with you, each player votes for an artifact, creature, or enchantment card in your graveyard. Return each card with the most votes or tied for most votes to your hand.', 'Flying\\nWill of the council — When Magister of Worth enters the battlefield, starting with you, each player votes for grace or condemnation. If grace gets more votes, each player returns each creature card from his or her graveyard to the battlefield. If condemnation gets more votes or the vote is tied, destroy all creatures other than Magister of Worth.', 'Flying\\n{2}{U}: Tap target creature with flying.', 'Flying\\n{T}: Target creature gains flying until end of turn.', "Galvanic Juggernaut attacks each turn if able.\\nGalvanic Juggernaut doesn't untap during your untap step.\\nWhenever another creature dies, untap Galvanic Juggernaut.", "Grenzo, Dungeon Warden enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{2}: Put the bottom card of your library into your graveyard. If it's a creature card with power less than or equal to Grenzo's power, put it onto the battlefield.", "Hexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\\nDethrone (Whenever this creature attacks the player with the most life or tied for most life, put a +1/+1 counter on it.)", 'Hidden agenda (Start the game with this conspiracy face down in the command zone and secretly name a card. You may turn this conspiracy face up any time and reveal the chosen name.)\\nCreatures you control with the chosen name have "{T}: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool."', 'Hidden agenda (Start the game with this conspiracy face down in the command zone and secretly name a card. You may turn this conspiracy face up any time and reveal the chosen name.)\\nCreatures you control with the chosen name have haste.', 'Hidden agenda (Start the game with this conspiracy face down in the command zone and secretly name a card. You may turn this conspiracy face up any time and reveal the chosen name.)\\nEach creature you control with the chosen name enters the battlefield with an additional +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Hidden agenda (Start the game with this conspiracy face down in the command zone and secretly name a card. You may turn this conspiracy face up any time and reveal the chosen name.)\\nSpells with the chosen name you cast cost {1} less to cast.', 'Hidden agenda (Start the game with this conspiracy face down in the command zone and secretly name a card. You may turn this conspiracy face up any time and reveal the chosen name.)\\nWhenever a creature with the chosen name enters the battlefield under your control, you may search your library for any number of cards with that name, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle your library.', 'Hidden agenda (Start the game with this conspiracy face down in the command zone and secretly name a card. You may turn this conspiracy face up any time and reveal the chosen name.)\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell with the chosen name, you may copy it. You may choose new targets for the copy.', 'Hidden agenda (Start the game with this conspiracy face down in the command zone and secretly name a card. You may turn this conspiracy face up any time and reveal the chosen name.)\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell with the chosen name, you may draw a card.', 'Hidden agenda (Start the game with this conspiracy face down in the command zone and secretly name a card. You may turn this conspiracy face up any time and reveal the chosen name.)\\nYou may spend mana as though it were mana of any color to cast spells with the chosen name.', "Ignition Team enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it, where X is the number of tapped lands on the battlefield.\\n{2}{R}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Ignition Team: Target land becomes a 4/4 red Elemental creature until end of turn. It's still a land.", 'Lifelink (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)', 'Look at the top five cards of your library. You may reveal any number of creature cards from among them and put the revealed cards into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Morbid — At the beginning of each end step, if a creature died this turn, you may draw a card.', 'Morbid — When Morkrut Banshee enters the battlefield, if a creature died this turn, target creature gets -4/-4 until end of turn.', 'Morbid — When Wakedancer enters the battlefield, if a creature died this turn, put a 2/2 black Zombie creature token onto the battlefield.', 'Multikicker {1}{B} (You may pay an additional {1}{B} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nSwampwalk\\nQuag Vampires enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each time it was kicked.', 'Multikicker {1}{G} (You may pay an additional {1}{G} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nGnarlid Pack enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each time it was kicked.', 'Multikicker {1}{R} (You may pay an additional {1}{R} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nHaste\\nSkitter of Lizards enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each time it was kicked.', 'Multikicker {1}{U} (You may pay an additional {1}{U} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nIslandwalk\\nEnclave Elite enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each time it was kicked.', 'Multikicker {1}{W} (You may pay an additional {1}{W} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nFlying\\nApex Hawks enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each time it was kicked.', 'Multikicker {G} (You may pay an additional {G} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Wolfbriar Elemental enters the battlefield, put a 2/2 green Wolf creature token onto the battlefield for each time it was kicked.', 'Multikicker {R} (You may pay an additional {R} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Deathforge Shaman enters the battlefield, it deals damage to target player equal to twice the number of times it was kicked.', 'No more than one creature can attack each combat.\\nNo more than one creature can block each combat.', 'Orcish Cannonade deals 2 damage to target creature or player and 3 damage to you.\\nDraw a card.', 'Parley — Each player reveals the top card of his or her library. For each nonland card revealed this way, you put a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying onto the battlefield. Then each player draws a card.', 'Parley — Each player reveals the top card of his or her library. For each nonland card revealed this way, you put a 3/3 green Elephant creature token onto the battlefield. Then each player draws a card.', "Parley — When Selvala's Enforcer enters the battlefield, each player reveals the top card of his or her library. For each nonland card revealed this way, put a +1/+1 counter on Selvala's Enforcer. Then each player draws a card.", 'Parley — {T}: Each player reveals the top card of his or her library. For each nonland card revealed this way, add {G} to your mana pool and you gain 1 life. Then each player draws a card.', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn. You gain 1 life for each attacking creature.', 'Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\\nMorbid — Put three +1/+1 counters on that creature instead if a creature died this turn.', 'Put a 2/2 green Wolf creature token onto the battlefield.\\nMorbid — Put three 2/2 green Wolf creature tokens onto the battlefield instead if a creature died this turn.', 'Put a 4/4 red Ogre creature token onto the battlefield. Starting with you, each player chooses an artifact, a creature, and a land from among the permanents controlled by the player to his or her left. Destroy each permanent chosen this way.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', "Realm Seekers enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it, where X is the total number of cards in all players' hands.\\n{2}{G}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Realm Seekers: Search your library for a land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library.", 'Regenerate each creature you control.', "Return target permanent you control and target permanent you don't control to their owners' hands.", 'Reveal Cogwork Spy as you draft it. You may look at the next card drafted from this booster pack.\\nFlying', 'Reveal Cogwork Tracker as you draft it and note the player who passed it to you.\\nCogwork Tracker attacks each turn if able.\\nCogwork Tracker attacks a player you noted for cards named Cogwork Tracker each turn if able.', "Reveal Lore Seeker as you draft it. After you draft Lore Seeker, you may add a booster pack to the draft. (Your next pick is from that booster pack. Pass it to the next player and it's drafted this draft round.)", "Reveal Lurking Automaton as you draft it and note how many cards you've drafted this draft round, including Lurking Automaton.\\nLurking Automaton enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it, where X is the highest number you noted for cards named Lurking Automaton.", 'Reveal Paliano, the High City as you draft it. The player to your right chooses a color, you choose another color, then the player to your left chooses a third color.\\n{T}: Add one mana to your mana pool of any color chosen as you drafted cards named Paliano, the High City.', 'Reveal the top five cards of your library. An opponent separates those cards into two piles. Put one pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard.', 'Reveal Æther Searcher as you draft it. Reveal the next card you draft and note its name.\\nWhen Æther Searcher enters the battlefield, you may search your hand and/or library for a card with a name noted as you drafted cards named Æther Searcher. You may cast it without paying its mana cost. If you searched your library this way, shuffle it.', 'Sacrifice Sakura-Tribe Elder: Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.', "Sacrifice a creature: Target player puts a number of cards equal to the sacrificed creature's power from the top of his or her library into his or her graveyard.", 'Syphon Soul deals 2 damage to each other player. You gain life equal to the damage dealt this way.', 'Target creature and all other creatures with the same name as that creature get +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Target creature can block any number of creatures this turn.', 'Target creature gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains lifelink until end of turn. (Damage dealt by the creature also causes its controller to gain that much life.)', 'Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.\\nMorbid — That creature gets -13/-13 until end of turn instead if a creature died this turn.', 'Target player draws three cards. Then that player discards two cards unless he or she discards a land card.', 'Trample, haste\\nWhenever Barbed Shocker deals damage to a player, that player discards all the cards in his or her hand, then draws that many cards.', 'Trample\\nParley — Whenever Woodvine Elemental attacks, each player reveals the top card of his or her library. For each nonland card revealed this way, attacking creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn. Then each player draws a card.', 'Trample\\nWhen Pelakka Wurm enters the battlefield, you gain 7 life.\\nWhen Pelakka Wurm dies, draw a card.', "Untap target creature you don't control. That creature blocks this turn if able.\\nDraw a card.", 'Vigilance\\nPlainscycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Plains card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.)', "Vigilance\\nWhen Glimmerpoint Stag enters the battlefield, exile another target permanent. Return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", "Volcanic Fallout can't be countered.\\nVolcanic Fallout deals 2 damage to each creature and each player.", 'When Doomed Traveler dies, put a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying onto the battlefield.', 'When Gamekeeper dies, you may exile it. If you do, reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a creature card. Put that card onto the battlefield and put all other cards revealed this way into your graveyard.', 'When Howling Wolf enters the battlefield, you may search your library for up to three cards named Howling Wolf, reveal them, and put them into your hand. If you do, shuffle your library.', 'When Peace Strider enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.', "When Phage the Untouchable enters the battlefield, if you didn't cast it from your hand, you lose the game.\\nWhenever Phage deals combat damage to a creature, destroy that creature. It can't be regenerated.\\nWhenever Phage deals combat damage to a player, that player loses the game.", 'When Pitchburn Devils dies, it deals 3 damage to target creature or player.', 'When Runed Servitor dies, each player draws a card.', 'When Terastodon enters the battlefield, you may destroy up to three target noncreature permanents. For each permanent put into a graveyard this way, its controller puts a 3/3 green Elephant creature token onto the battlefield.', 'Whenever Copperhorn Scout attacks, untap each other creature you control.', 'Whenever Hydra Omnivore deals combat damage to an opponent, it deals that much damage to each other opponent.', 'Whenever Infectious Horror attacks, each opponent loses 2 life.', 'Whenever Spiritmonger deals damage to a creature, put a +1/+1 counter on Spiritmonger.\\n{B}: Regenerate Spiritmonger.\\n{G}: Spiritmonger becomes the color of your choice until end of turn.', 'Whenever a creature deals combat damage to one of your opponents, its controller may draw a card.', "Whenever equipped creature attacks, look at the top card of your library. If it's a land card, you may put it onto the battlefield tapped.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", "Whenever players finish voting, each opponent who voted for a choice you didn't vote for loses 2 life.", 'While voting, you get an additional vote. (The votes can be for different choices or for the same choice.)', 'Will of the council — At the beginning of your upkeep, starting with you, each player votes for carnage or homage. If carnage gets more votes, sacrifice Coercive Portal and destroy all nonland permanents. If homage gets more votes or the vote is tied, draw a card.', 'Will of the council — Choose target instant or sorcery spell. Starting with you, each player votes for denial or duplication. If denial gets more votes, counter the spell. If duplication gets more votes or the vote is tied, copy the spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', "Will of the council — Starting with you, each player votes for a nonland permanent you don't control. Exile each permanent with the most votes or tied for most votes.", 'Will of the council — Starting with you, each player votes for death or torture. If death gets more votes, each opponent sacrifices a creature. If torture gets more votes or the vote is tied, each opponent loses 4 life.', 'Will of the council — Starting with you, each player votes for sickness or psychosis. If sickness gets more votes, creatures your opponents control get -2/-2 until end of turn. If psychosis gets more votes or the vote is tied, each opponent discards two cards.', 'Will of the council — Starting with you, each player votes for time or knowledge. If time gets more votes, take an extra turn after this one. If knowledge gets more votes or the vote is tied, draw three cards.', 'Will of the council — When Council Guardian enters the battlefield, starting with you, each player votes for blue, black, red, or green. Council Guardian gains protection from each color with the most votes or tied for most votes.', "Wrap in Flames deals 1 damage to each of up to three target creatures. Those creatures can't block this turn.", "You may cast Rout any time you could cast an instant if you pay {2} more to cast it.\\nDestroy all creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'You may cast nonland cards as though they had flash.', "You may exile a blue card from your hand rather than pay Misdirection's mana cost.\\nChange the target of target spell with a single target.", "You may have Dack's Duplicate enter the battlefield as a copy of any creature on the battlefield except it gains haste and dethrone. (Whenever it attacks the player with the most life or tied for most life, put a +1/+1 counter on it.)", 'You may play an additional land on each of your turns.', '{1}, {T}: Put a 1/1 colorless Construct artifact creature token with defender onto the battlefield.\\n{T}, Sacrifice a creature with defender: Flamewright deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', '{1}{U}{B}: Exile target creature card from a graveyard. Dimir Doppelganger becomes a copy of that card and gains this ability.', '{1}{W}, Sacrifice Silverchase Fox: Exile target enchantment.', '{2}{R}: Target creature attacks this turn if able.', "{3}: Put target card from a graveyard on the bottom of its owner's library.", '{3}{U}, {T}: Look at the top X cards of your library, where X is the highest converted mana cost among artifacts you control. You may reveal an artifact card from among them and put it onto the battlefield. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', '{B}, Sacrifice a creature: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', '{B}: Regenerate Twisted Abomination.\\nSwampcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Swamp card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.)', '{R}, Sacrifice Torch Fiend: Destroy target artifact.', '{R}: Chartooth Cougar gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\nMountaincycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Mountain card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.)', '{T}, Sacrifice Magus of the Mirror: Exchange life totals with target opponent. Activate this ability only during your upkeep.', '{T}: Add to your mana pool one mana of any type that a land you control could produce.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Quicksand: Target attacking creature without flying gets -1/-2 until end of turn.', "{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{T}: Put a charge counter on Mirrodin's Core.\\n{T}, Remove a charge counter from Mirrodin's Core: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.", '{T}: Add {G}{G}{G} to your mana pool.\\nForestcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Forest card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.)', '{T}: Choose a player. That player adds one mana of any color he or she chooses to his or her mana pool.', "{T}: Heartless Hidetsugu deals damage to each player equal to half that player's life total, rounded down.", '{T}: Name a creature card. Reveal the top four cards of your library and put all of them with that name into your hand. Put the rest into your graveyard.', '{T}: Target land you control becomes the basic land type of your choice until end of turn.', '{T}: Target player draws a card, then discards a card.', '{X}, Sacrifice Pernicious Deed: Destroy each artifact, creature, and enchantment with converted mana cost X or less.']
